    AtlasNode { kind: "C", id: "final_form_and_limits_m17_summary_32", raw: "@C final_form_and_limits_m17_summary_32 = Kleene recursion theorem: 모든 partial recursive f 에 fixed point. 메타엔진은 항상 자기-fixpoint 보유 — 진보 없는 self-loop 가능 (m4 의 linear_constant 가 이 사례). :: omega_cycle_final-form-and-limits [7]\n  => summary of axis m17\n  |> final-form-and-limits (auto-ingested ω-cycle)", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 5704, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: ["summary of axis m17"], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: ["final-form-and-limits (auto-ingested ω-cycle)"], breakthroughs: [] } },
