    AtlasNode { kind: "C", id: "final_form_and_limits_m18_summary_34", raw: "@C final_form_and_limits_m18_summary_34 = PA(Peano Arithmetic) provability ↔ ε_0 (Gentzen). ZFC ↔ inaccessible. 시스템 i 의 ordinal 한계가 자기 능력의 ceiling. ε_0 → Γ_0 (Feferman-Schütte) → ψ(Ω_ω) 로 escape 시 … :: omega_cycle_final-form-and-limits [7]\n  => summary of axis m18\n  |> final-form-and-limits (auto-ingested ω-cycle)", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 5712, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: ["summary of axis m18"], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: ["final-form-and-limits (auto-ingested ω-cycle)"], breakthroughs: [] } },
