    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "disc-blowup-p4-qfield-coupling", raw: "@R disc-blowup-p4-qfield-coupling = 0.166667 ratio :: discovery [10]\n  \"D-P4-01 양자-장 결합상수 동치: phi*sigma/(n*J2) = 2*12/(6*24) = 24/144 = 1/n = 0.1667. cross-module invariant (quantum.Q2 + field.F4). 수학적 항등식으로 EXACT\"\n  <- blowup_quantum, blowup_field\n  |> experiments/blowup/p4_dfs_5module_report.md", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 39528, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["blowup_quantum", "blowup_field"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: ["experiments/blowup/p4_dfs_5module_report.md"], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "disc-blowup-p4-tdual-goldstone-closure", raw: "@R disc-blowup-p4-tdual-goldstone-closure = 3.0 divisor :: discovery [10*]\n  \"D-P4-02 T-duality 골드스톤 연쇄 폐합: (1/phi)*n = n/phi = 6/2 = 3 = divisors(6). 끈 T-dual 역수+골드스톤 연쇄가 6의 약수 구조에 폐합. cross-module loop (string.S3 + field.F6). P5 승격: 3 = 6/2 EXACT 수학적 항등식\"\n  <- blowup_string, blowup_field\n  |> experiments/blowup/p4_dfs_5module_report.md", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 39533, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["blowup_string", "blowup_field"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: ["experiments/blowup/p4_dfs_5module_report.md"], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "disc-blowup-p4-ouroboros-functor-iso", raw: "@R disc-blowup-p4-ouroboros-functor-iso = 1.0 structural :: discovery [9]\n  \"D-P4-03 우로보로스-함자 동형: forge(Saturated) = functor(EXACT->EXACT). MetaLoop 시드 재생성과 범주론 등급보존사상 대응. structural isomorphism (ouroboros.MetaLoop + toe.T3). NEAR — 정량 검증 대기\"\n  <- ouroboros, blowup_toe\n  |> experiments/blowup/p4_dfs_5module_report.md", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 39538, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["ouroboros", "blowup_toe"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: ["experiments/blowup/p4_dfs_5module_report.md"], breakthroughs: [] } },
