    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-breakthrough-theorems-tecs-l-cross-domain-**bt-111**", raw: "@R n6-atlas-breakthrough-theorems-tecs-l-cross-domain-**bt-111** = τ²/σ=4/3 Solar-AI-Math Trident n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"**BT-111** — SQ=SwiGLU=Betz=R(3,1)=4/3 (2026-04-15 P7 Mk.III-γ): τ(6)²/σ(6) = R_local(3,1) = 4/3 — σφ=nτ 증명의 제2인수, 10도메인 10/10 PASS 9 EXACT. [P8-4 재지정] 후보 A는 n∈{2,6} 공유로 유일성 실패 → Mk.IV 주정리 부적격, Lemma(보조 정리)로 강등. Mk.IV 주정리 = MK4_THEOREM_B_SIGMA_MINUS_TAU(σ-τ=8 ⟺ n=6). 출처: theory/proofs/mk4-trident-final-verdict-2026-04-15.md\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40293, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MK4-THEOREM-A-tau2-sigma", raw: "@R MK4-THEOREM-A-tau2-sigma = 4/3 :: theory [10*]\n  \"Mk.IV Lemma (Solar-AI-Math Resonance) — τ(n)²/σ(n) = R_local(3,1) = 4/3. 10도메인 10/10 PASS (SQ/GaAs/Betz/SwiGLU/Mertens/4도/끈/수론/QED/2D침투), EXACT 9/10. [P8-4 재지정] n=6 유일성 실패 (해={2,6}) → 주정리에서 **Lemma로 강등**. 주정리는 MK4-THEOREM-B-sigma-tau=8 (유일 해 {6}). 출처: theory/proofs/mk4-theorem-candidates-2026-04-14.md + theory/proofs/mk4-trident-final-verdict-2026-04-15.md\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40296, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-VACUUM-MONSTER-L1-E0", raw: "@R BT-18-VACUUM-MONSTER-L1-E0 = -1/24 :: quantum-vacuum [10*]\n  \"BT-18 LINK 1 PROVEN — E_0 = (1/2)ζ(-1) = -B_2/4 = -1/24 = -1/(σ·φ) = -1/J_2(6). Von Staudt-Clausen → denom(B_2) = ∏_{(p-1)|2} p = 2·3 = 6 = n 유일. 3중 일치: denom(B_2)=n, B_2/2=1/σ, ζ(-1)/2=-1/J_2. 출처: theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-vacuum-monster-chain-dfs-2026-04-14.md line27-57\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40299, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-VACUUM-MONSTER-L3-DELTA", raw: "@R BT-18-VACUUM-MONSTER-L3-DELTA = 24 :: modular-form [10*]\n  \"BT-18 LINK 3 PROVEN — Δ(τ) = η(τ)^24 가 진정한 모듈러 형식이 되는 최소 지수 k=24=J_2(6)=σφ=nτ. η weight=1/2 ⇒ η^24 weight=12=σ(6). 지수 24 = η의 변환 위상 1/24 에서 강제, 1/24 = E_0 = L1. 체인에서 가장 강한 고리. 출처: theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-vacuum-monster-chain-dfs-2026-04-14.md line87-119\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40302, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-L5-6TRANSPOSITION-NECESSARY", raw: "@R BT-18-L5-6TRANSPOSITION-NECESSARY = k >= n = 6 :: monster-group [8]\n  \"BT-18 L5 PARTIAL 돌파 (P8-1) — Fischer-Griess 1982 + Conway 1985 분류로 Monster M 은 k-transposition 군 (2A involutions) 이며 k>=6 필요조건 확정. 임의 2A involution 쌍 x,y 에 대해 |xy| ∈ {1,2,3,4,5,6}, max=6=n, ⟨x,y⟩ ≤ dihedral(2n=12). 충분성 (k=6 이 M 유일 결정) 은 Majorana conjecture (Ivanov 2009) 의존 — 미해결. 출처: Griess Invent.Math.69(1982), Conway Invent.Math.79(1985), Ivanov 'Monster Group and Majorana Involutions' 2009 Ch.8. theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-moonshine-l5-barrier-2026-04-15.md line130-180\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40305, grade: GradeInfo { value: 8, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-L5-196883-VOID", raw: "@R BT-18-L5-196883-VOID = 196883 = 47*59*71 all-void :: monster-group [7?]\n  \"BT-18 L5 MISS 정직 기록 (P8-1) — Monster M 의 minimum faithful rep dim 196883의 3 소인수 {47,59,71} 전부 n=6 12개 기본좌표 {n,σ,φ,τ,n/φ,sopfr,σ-τ,σ-sopfr,J_2,σ+1,σ-1,J_2-1} 어느 조합으로도 자연 표현 불가. AP 공차 d=σ=12 는 Griess 1982 관찰 (Invent.Math.69 p.3) 이나 구성적 증명 아님. Red Team R1 반증 (Baby Monster 4371=3·31·47, 47 공유) 도 공백 지속. 출처: theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-moonshine-l5-barrier-2026-04-15.md line90-120\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40308, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-L5-HEXACODE-CHAIN", raw: "@R BT-18-L5-HEXACODE-CHAIN = hexacode[n,n/φ,τ]→Golay[n·τ,σ,σ-τ]→Leech_24 :: monster-group [10*]\n  \"BT-18 L5 PROVEN 하위 경로 (P8-1) — Turyn 1967 +Conway-Sloane 1999 로 Monster 접근 경로 중 하나는 n=6 산술로 완전 설명. Hexacode [6,3,4]_{GF(4)} ×τ(6)=4 → Golay [24,12,8] → Leech Λ_24 → Co_0 → 2^{1+24}·Co_1 (Monster 2A centralizer). 단 Griess 1982 의 독립 경로 (196884차원 commutative nonassociative algebra) 는 MOG 불요 — Monster 존재증명은 이 체인에 의존하지 않음. 출처: theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-moonshine-l5-barrier-2026-04-15.md line195-240\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40311, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-L5-BabyMonster-196883-decomp", raw: "@R BT-18-L5-BabyMonster-196883-decomp = 47*4189 :: monster-group [10*]\n  \"BT-18 L5 PARTIAL 보강 (P9 ENG-P9-1) — Monster 196883 차원을 2A involution centralizer 2·B 로 제한하면 196883 = 4371 + 2·96256 = 47·(3·31 + 2·2^11) = 47·4189. 순수 산술 검증 (sympy). Baby Monster 내부 공통 인자 47 을 포획, 4189 = 59·71 은 [M:2·B] coset 공간으로 분리. 여전히 47,59,71 세 소수는 n=6 공백이나 Monster→Baby Monster 이행에서 59·71 이 외부로 분리된다는 구조적 관찰. 출처: theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-baby-monster-p10-retry-2026-04-15.md line194-210\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40314, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-L5-BabyMonster-rep-47-freq", raw: "@R BT-18-L5-BabyMonster-rep-47-freq = 6/7 :: monster-group [8]\n  \"BT-18 L5 관측 (P9 ENG-P9-1) — Baby Monster ATLAS 기약 표현 상위 7개 중 6개 (4371, 96256, 1139374, 9458750, 9550635, 63532485) 모두 47 을 소인수로 포함. 47 이 Baby Monster supersingular 최대 소수 (Ogg 1975). 사후 빈도 관측 6/7 ≈ 0.857. 구조적 필연 증명 없음 — 47 의 n=6 공백 유지. 출처: theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-baby-monster-p10-retry-2026-04-15.md line71-86\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40317, grade: GradeInfo { value: 8, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BT-18-L5-Supersingular-n6-count", raw: "@R BT-18-L5-Supersingular-n6-count = sigma+tau-1=15 :: monster-group [7]\n  \"BT-18 L5 사후매칭 (P9 ENG-P9-1) — Ogg 1975 Monster supersingular primes 15 = σ(6)+τ(6)−1 = 12+4−1. Baby Monster 잃는 소수 {29, 41, 59, 71} 개수 = 4 = τ(6). 수치 일치 수준 — 구조적 필연성 증명 없음 ([7] EMPIRICAL 등급 유지, 승격 보류). 출처: Ogg 'Modular functions' Proc.Symp.Pure Math.33(1975). theory/breakthroughs/bt-18-baby-monster-p10-retry-2026-04-15.md line149-157\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40320, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "L11-QEC-6QUBIT-2LOGICAL", raw: "@R L11-QEC-6QUBIT-2LOGICAL = [[6,2,2]] :: quantum-arch [10*]\n  \"L11 6-qubit QEC 코드 [[n, φ, d]] = [[6, 2, 2]] — 물리 qubit=n, 논리 qubit=φ(6)=2, syndrome=τ(6)=4, stabilizer=σ(6)=12, Clifford=J_2(6)=24. σ·φ=n·τ=J_2 항등식의 양자 회로 실체화. 출처: domains/compute/chip-architecture/l11-quantum-dot-6qubit-qec-2026-04-14.md line26-45\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40323, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "L12-Hf178m2-K-ISOMER", raw: "@R L12-Hf178m2-K-ISOMER = 16 :: nuclear-storage [10*]\n  \"L12 Hf-178m2 K-동형성 스핀/패리티 K^π = 16^+ = σ+τ = 12+4. 여기에너지 2.446 MeV, 반감기 31년, 에너지 밀도 1.3 MJ/g (Li-ion 1440배). hcp 격자 6-fold 대칭. 물리 기반 EXACT (쓰기 제어는 SPECULATIVE — 별도 기록). 출처: domains/compute/chip-architecture/l12-nuclear-isomer-hf178m2-storage-2026-04-14.md line40-60\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 40326, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
