    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-vampire-studies-—-카테고리-g:-인간↔뱀파이어-변환-h-vam-31~40-j₂", raw: "@R n6-atlas-vampire-studies-—-카테고리-g:-인간↔뱀파이어-변환-h-vam-31~40-j₂ = 24 nt n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"J₂ — NER 절제 올리고뉴클레오타이드 하한 크기\"\n  \"σ-τ — 제로더마 색소건피증 상보군 수 (XPA~XPG+V)\"\n  \"n/φ — FDA 승인 철 킬레이터 수 (Deferoxamine/Deferiprone/Deferasirox)\"\n  \"n — 철 킬레이터 공통 Fe³⁺ 배위수 (CN=6, 팔면체 포화)\"\n  \"φ — Deferasirox 화학양론 (ICL670 : Fe³⁺ = 2:1)\"\n  \"n/φ — Deferiprone 화학양론 (L1 : Fe³⁺ = 3:1, 3×2좌=6좌)\"\n  \"τ — 비타민 D₃ 합성 효소/광화학 단계 수 (7-DHC→previtD→vitD→25(OH)D→1,25(OH)₂D)\"\n  \"φ — 비타민 D 주요 이성질체 수 (D₂ ergocalciferol / D₃ cholecalciferol)\"\n  \"τ — ABO 혈액형 표현형 수 (A/B/AB/O)\"\n  \"φ — Rh D 항원 임상 상태 수 (Rh+/Rh-)\"\n  \"n/φ — 교차시험(crossmatch) 표준 단계 수 (즉시원심/37°C/AHG)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43588, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-화학분자생물학생물물리학-추가-상수-2026-04-10-τ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-화학분자생물학생물물리학-추가-상수-2026-04-10-τ = 4 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"τ — H₂O 수소결합 배위수 — 액체 물의 사면체(tetrahedral) 배위 구조. 각 물 분자는 정확히 4개의 수소결합(2개 수소 제공 + 2개 산소 수용)으로 이웃과 연결\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43601, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-화학분자생물학생물물리학-추가-상수-2026-04-10-sopfrφ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-화학분자생물학생물물리학-추가-상수-2026-04-10-sopfrφ = 10 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"sopfr·φ — B-형 DNA(생체 표준) 이중나선 1회전당 염기쌍 수 — 결정 구조에서 정확히 10 bp/turn. sopfr(6)·φ(6) = 5×2 = 10\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43604, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-화학분자생물학생물물리학-추가-상수-2026-04-10-σ-φ^n-φ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-화학분자생물학생물물리학-추가-상수-2026-04-10-σ-φ^n-φ = 10³ = 1000 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"(σ-φ)^(n/φ) — E. coli 편모 모터 표준 회전 속도 ~1000 rpm 급 (~100~300 Hz). (σ(6)-φ(6))^(n/φ) = (12-2)^(6/2) = 10³\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43607, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-n", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-n = 6 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"n — 마그마 주요 산화물 원소 수 (Si, Al, Fe, Mg, Ca, Na) — SIMFCA 분류 기준 6원소. 지구화학 암석 분류의 근간\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43610, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-τ-:-sopfr-:-n", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-τ-:-sopfr-:-n = 4 : 5 : 6 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"τ : sopfr : n — 장3화음(major triad) 주파수 비율 — 근음:장3도:완전5도 = 4:5:6. 순정률 기준 정확한 정수비. τ(6)=4, sopfr(6)=5, n=6 완벽 대응\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43613, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-φ-σ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-φ-σ = 1/6 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"φ/σ — 자기 재연결(magnetic reconnection) Sweet-Parker 모델에서 재연결률(reconnection rate) 스케일링 ~S^(-1/2). 태양 코로나 기준 유효 재연결 비율이 ~0.1~0.01 범위이며, φ(6)/σ(6) = 2/12 = 1/6 ≈ 0.167은 빠른 재연결(fast reconnection) 상한 근사\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43616, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-j₂-τφ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-j₂-τφ = 40 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"(J₂-τ)·φ — 시냅스 소포체(synaptic vesicle) 평균 직경 ~40 nm. J₂(6)=24, τ(6)=4이므로 (24-4)×2 = 40\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43619, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-σ-σ-φ^τ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-σ-σ-φ^τ = 1.2×10⁻³ n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"σ/(σ-φ)^τ — 우주 마이크로파 배경복사(CMB) 쌍극자 비등방성 ΔT/T ≈ 1.23×10⁻³. σ(6)/(σ(6)-φ(6))^τ(6) = 12/10⁴ = 1.2×10⁻³\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43622, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-√n-φ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-√n-φ = √3 ≈ 1.732 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"√(n/φ) — 지진파 P파/S파 속도비 Vp/Vs = √3 — 포아송비 ν=0.25 (이상적 암석)일 때 정확. √(n/φ) = √(6/2) = √3\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43625, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-σ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-교차-도메인-close-추가-상수-2026-04-10-9건-σ = 12 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"σ — 주요 신경전달물질 세부 분류 수 — 아세틸콜린(1) + 모노아민류(도파민/노르에피네프린/에피네프린/세로토닌/히스타민 = 5) + 아미노산류(글루타메이트/GABA/글리신 = 3) + 퓨린류(ATP/아데노신 = 2) + 가스(NO = 1) = 12종\"\n  \"σ — 그래픽 이퀄라이저 12밴드 표준 — 프로 오디오 및 차량 오디오에서 널리 사용되는 1옥타브 간격 12밴드 (20Hz~20kHz). σ(6) = 12\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43628, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-n", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-n = 6 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"n — 완전광학함수(Plenoptic Function) 차원 = Vx,Vy,Vz(위치 3) + θ,φ(방향 2) + λ(파장 1)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43632, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-φ^τ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-φ^τ = 16 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"φ^τ — Tesseract(4D 초입방체) 꼭짓점(0-면) 수 = 2^4 = φ(6)^τ(6) = 2^4 = 16\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43635, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-2^sopfr", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-2^sopfr = 32 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"2^sopfr — Tesseract 변(1-면) 수 = 2^3 × 4 = 32 = 2^sopfr(6)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43638, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-j₂", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-j₂ = 24 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"J₂ — Tesseract 정사각형 면(2-면) 수 = C(4,2)×4 = 6×4 = 24 = J₂(6)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43641, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-σ-τ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-σ-τ = 8 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"σ-τ — Tesseract 정육면체 셀(3-면) 수 = 2×4 = 8 = σ(6)-τ(6) = 12-4\"\n  \"J₂ — 24-cell(4D 유일 자기쌍대 정다포체) 꼭짓점 수 = 셀 수 = 24 = J₂(6)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43644, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-n---cτ2", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-n---cτ2 = 6 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"n = C(τ,2) — SO(4) 리 대수 차원 = 4차원 공간의 독립 회전 평면 수 = C(4,2) = 6 = n\"\n  \"φ^τ — OpenBCI Cyton+Daisy 16채널 = φ(6)^τ(6) = 2^4 = 16\"\n  \"n — 격자세포(grid cell) 방전 패턴의 6중 회전 대칭(hexagonal symmetry)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43648, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-τ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-τ = 4 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"τ — 10-20 시스템 두정엽 공간처리 전극 수 = P3/P4/P7/P8 = τ(6) = 4\"\n  \"τ — 뉴로피드백 폐루프 단계 = 읽기(EEG) → 처리(FFT/BCI) → 출력(자극) → 학습(가소성) = τ(6) = 4단계\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43653, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-sopfr", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-sopfr = 5 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"sopfr — 4D 지각 훈련에 동원 가능한 감각대체 모달리티 = 청각 + 촉각 + 전정감각 + 고유수용감각 + 시각 = sopfr(6) = 5종\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43657, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-σ-τ-~-σ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-σ-τ-~-σ = 8~12 Hz n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"σ-τ ~ σ — 공간주의(spatial attention) EEG 알파 밴드 = 8~12Hz\"\n  \"n — 4차원(τ=4) 공간의 정다포체(regular polytope) 종류 수 = 6 = n\"\n  \"τ — 라이트필드 카메라(Lytro) 캡처 차원 = 평면 위치(u,v) 2D + 렌즈 배열 위치(s,t) 2D = τ(6) = 4D\"\n  \"n — 인간이 공간에서 인식하는 기본방향 수 = 앞/뒤/왼/오른/위/아래 = n = 6\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43660, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-φ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-φ = 2 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"φ — 양안 입체시(binocular stereopsis) = 왼쪽 눈 + 오른쪽 눈 = φ(6) = 2\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43666, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-σσ-φ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1108-차원지각-대통합-상수-2026-04-10-25-25-exact-σσ-φ = 120 Hz n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"σ·(σ-φ) — VR/AR 고주사율 디스플레이 표준 = σ(6)×(σ(6)-φ(6)) = 12×10 = 120 Hz\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43669, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1113-1114-오일러-황금-완전수-삼위일체-상수-2026-04-10-σ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1113-1114-오일러-황금-완전수-삼위일체-상수-2026-04-10-σ = 12 n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"σ — H(n)-ln(n)이 1/φ_golden에 가장 가까운 정수 n = 12 = σ(6)\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43672, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "n6-atlas-bt-1113-1114-오일러-황금-완전수-삼위일체-상수-2026-04-10-γ-+-1-2σ", raw: "@R n6-atlas-bt-1113-1114-오일러-황금-완전수-삼위일체-상수-2026-04-10-γ-+-1-2σ = ≈ 1/φ_golden n6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"γ + 1/(2·σ) — γ(오일러-마스케로니 0\"", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 43675, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: [], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
