    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLOAK-01-epsilon-negative", raw: "@R HEXA-CLOAK-01-epsilon-negative = ε_r = -(σ-φ)/σ = -5/6, 좌수성 유전율 :: sf-ufo [10]\n  \"HEXA-CLOAK §8.1: Pendry 메타물질 ε_r < 0 폐형. -(σ-φ)/σ = -10/12 = -5/6. 수론 유리수. T1. RT-SC 관통 시 Meissner 쉘 내부 강제.\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hexa-cloak/hexa-cloak.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48275, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hexa-cloak/hexa-cloak.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
