    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ANTIMATTER-03-cost-per-kg", raw: "@R ANTIMATTER-03-cost-per-kg = C_k = $_0 / σ³ = $3.6×10⁸/kg (Mk.V) :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"DFS27: kg당 반물질 비용. NASA 1999 추정 $6.25×10¹³/kg ÷ σ³=1728 = $3.6×10¹⁰ (Mk.III), Mk.V 추가 /σ²로 $2.5×10⁸. σ³ = σ²(병렬)·σ(효율)  체인. T3-EMPIRICAL. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48379, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ANTIMATTER-04-trap-efficiency", raw: "@R ANTIMATTER-04-trap-efficiency = η_trap = α² · B⁴ · σ(n)/(2n) = 288 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"DFS27: SC Penning trap 포획 효율. quantum(α²) × field(B⁴ conf) × toe(σ(6)=2n 완전수 closure=1). α²·48⁴ = 5.3×10⁻⁵·5.3×10⁶ = 281 ≈ 2σ²=288. 완전수 정체성 η 계수 = 1 (unity gating). T2-STRONG. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §8.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48383, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §8.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
