    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-01-B-scaling-law", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-01-B-scaling-law = B(M, A) = sqrt(2μ₀·M·g / A), A_min = 1/(σ-φ)² = 0.01 m² :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HOVER §8.1: 부양력 스케일링 B(M)=sqrt(2μ₀·M·g/A). hexa-hover 는 48 T 단일점(935 t), 본 도메인은 B_req 질량 스펙트럼 법칙. A ∝ M 설계 시 B ≈ 상수. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48436, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-02-triple-scale-B", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-02-triple-scale-B = B_req = 15.7 T ≈ σ+φ+√2·φ, 3 스케일 (100 kg/2 t/100 t) 공통 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HOVER §8.2: hoverboard 100 kg (A=0.01 m²) / hovercar 2 t (A=0.2 m²) / hovertrain 100 t (A=1 m²) 모두 B_req=15.7 T 수렴. 단일 YBCO(B_c2=17 T) 재료로 스펙트럼 전체 커버. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §8.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48440, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §8.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
