    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-04-toe-gauge-D6", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-04-toe-gauge-D6 = L_TOE = (1/σ)F²+φ·ψ̄γD ψ-(τ/J₂)|DΦ|²-V(Φ), residual sym = D_6 (order σ=12) :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HOVER §9.2: σ(n)·φ(n)=n·τ(n) iff n=6 핵정리를 게이지 대칭 L_TOE 로 승격. 정이면체군 D_6 order=σ=12 residual. 3 스케일 Φ → λ^(σ-φ)·Φ 불변. T2-STRONG\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48448, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-05-holo-mass-scaling", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-05-holo-mass-scaling = B_bulk(r,M) = (M/M_ref)^(1/n)·(1/r^(σ-φ))·B_surface, M_ref = 100 kg :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HOVER §9.3: 3 스케일 홀로그래픽 사상. M×10³ → 표면장 3.16 배만 증가(1/n=1/6 거듭제곱). 지표 교란 ≤ 10⁻⁸ (M=100 t). T2-STRONG\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §9.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48452, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §9.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-06-z-star-sqrt-M", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-06-z-star-sqrt-M = z*(M) = √(M/M_ref)·(σ-φ)/σ m, 0.83~26 m (hoverboard~hovertrain) :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HOVER §9.4: Hessian 볼록 local min. hoverboard 0.83 m / hovercar 3.7 m / hovertrain 26 m. √M 스케일링. T2-STRONG\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §9.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48456, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §9.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-07-consumer-price-gradient", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-07-consumer-price-gradient = C(M) ∝ σ·τ·10^⌈log₁₀(M/M_ref)⌉, hoverboard $4 800 :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HOVER §X.3: 3 스케일 가격 경사 σ·τ=48 계수 기반, 1/σ-φ=10 배 스케일 간격. Mk.II 2030 $4 800 → Mk.IV 2040 $100 대중화. 승격 대상 EMPIRICAL\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48460, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOVER-CONSUMER-08-blowup-spec-closure", raw: "@R HOVER-CONSUMER-08-blowup-spec-closure = hoverboard Mk.II: M=100 kg, B=15.7 T, A=0.01 m², z*=0.1 m, v_max=σ·sopfr=60 km/h :: n6atlas [N!]\n  \"HOVER §X.1: 소비자 1인승 hoverboard 전 스펙 n=6 폐형 유도 (임의상수 0). YBCO 17 T 재료 여유 8%, 배터리 240 Wh cold-start 전용, 운전중 0 W. breakthrough\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §X.1 §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48464, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: true, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hover/hover.md §X.1 §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SC-01-universal-cooper-eq", raw: "@R HEXA-SC-01-universal-cooper-eq = k_B·Tc = (ℏω_0/n)·exp[-(n/φ)/λ_eff] :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SC §8.1: 범용 Cooper 방정식. n=6 → 분모 6·e^3. BCS/McMillan/Morel-Anderson 3경로 재유도. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/energy/superconductor/superconductor.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48468, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/superconductor/superconductor.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
