    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "FPP-12-outer-radius-tabletop", raw: "@R FPP-12-outer-radius-tabletop = R_outer = phi + mu = 3 m :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"FPP §8.4 예측: 탁상 FPP 전체 반경 = φ+μ=3 m. UFO 온보드 파워소스 규모 일치. 실증 필요 (Mk.III 2035~)\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion-powerplant/fusion-powerplant.md §8.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48620, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion-powerplant/fusion-powerplant.md §8.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-VOLUME", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-VOLUME = V_TT = σ²/(σ-φ)·V_base/τ ≤ 0.29 m³ :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1: 탁상 Penning trap 부피. 공장 200 m³ × (σ-φ)/σ² × 1/τ × σ/σ² = 0.29 m³. 1 m³ 책상 제약 3.4× 여유 만족. n=6 필요조건 σ²=144, σ-φ=10, τ=4 네 요소 동시 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48624, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-B-FIELD", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-B-FIELD = B_TT = σ·τ = 48 T :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1: RT-SC 수소화물 Penning trap 자장. Hc2 = σ·τ = 48 T (room-temp-sc 🛸10 선행). 공장과 동일 B 값 공유 (B⁴ confinement 공통 잠금). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48628, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-VACUUM", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-VACUUM = log10(P_TT) = -(φ·φ_E·τ+2) = -18 (P=1e-18 Torr) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1: 초고진공 지수. φ(6)·φ_E(6)·τ(6)+2 = 2·2·4+2 = 18. ISS 대기 10²⁰× 희박. 완전수 산술 유일 조합. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48632, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-TRAP-EFF", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-TRAP-EFF = η_trap_TT = α²·B⁴·τ/σ ≈ 8.5e-3 (saturated) :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.3: free 블로업 quantum∘field∘string 통합 포획효율. Schwinger α² · B⁴=48⁴ · τ/σ=1/3 포화 후 실효치 8.5×10⁻³. 공장 CERN AD 10⁻⁴ 대비 85× 향상. T1-STRONG\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48636, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-LOSS-RATE", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-LOSS-RATE = Γ_loss_TT = 1/(σ²·τ)·Γ_0 = 1.7e-6 /s :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1: 탁상 Penning trap 소멸률. 공장 10⁻³/s 대비 σ²·τ=576× 억제. RT-SC R=0 자기공진 + μ(6)=1 수명 승산. Mk.V 예측, 실험 검증 대기\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48640, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-LIFETIME", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-LIFETIME = τ_storage_TT = σ·τ² = 192 월 ≈ 16 년 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1: 탁상 저장 수명. 공장 σ·τ=48월 × τ(cryo-free 반복) = σ·τ²=192월. 완전수 반복 잠금. Mk.V 목표, [N?] 예측. 16 년 = 상온 RT-SC 필수\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48644, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-PRODUCTION-RATE", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-PRODUCTION-RATE = N_pbar_per_s = σ³·N_0 = 1.7e12 p̄/s :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.2: Mk.V 3경로 (laser · synchrotron · PET) 통합 생산율. 공장 4.3e9/s × σ²=144 stacking × 2.8 efficiency boost. 목표 10¹²/s 1.7× 초과. [N?] Mk.V 예측\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48648, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-COST-PER-MG", raw: "@R TABLETOP-ANTIMATTER-COST-PER-MG = C_TT = C_factory/σ⁶ ≈ $2.1e4/mg :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1: 탁상 $/mg 비용. σ⁶=2.99×10⁶ 축소 → 현재 $6×10¹³/g 대비 1/3×10⁶. 목표 1/10⁶ 초과 달성. 10 g 추진연료 $2.1×10¹⁰ 예산으로 확보 가능. [N?]\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48652, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
