    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-FACTORY-COST-RATIO", raw: "@R TABLETOP-FACTORY-COST-RATIO = C_fac/C_TT = σ³ ≈ 1/1728 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.7: 공장 vs 탁상 비용비. $6.25e10/mg vs $2.1e4/mg = 2.98e6 ≈ σ⁶. 수명 비 τ=4, 생산 비 σ²=144 와 독립 잠금. 완전수 3중 절감. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.7", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48660, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.7"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TABLETOP-POWER-BUDGET-KW", raw: "@R TABLETOP-POWER-BUDGET-KW = P_TT ≤ σ-φ = 10 kW :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TABLETOP §9.4: 탁상 소비전력 상한. cryo-free RT-SC → σ-φ=10 kW (Mach 한계와 동일 상수). 일반 가정용 전력 배전반 호환. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48664, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/antimatter-factory/antimatter-factory.md §9.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-01-volume-m3", raw: "@R TTF-01-volume-m3 = V_tt ≈ 0.125 m³ ≤ 1 m³ :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 탁상 핵융합 전체 부피. B⁴ 스케일링 V_tt = V_ITER·(B_ITER/B_tt)^τ = 840·(5.3/48)^4 ≈ 0.125 m³. τ(6)=4 지수 직접 적용. 1m³ 데스크탑 타겟 8배 여유. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48668, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-02-B-field-48T", raw: "@R TTF-02-B-field-48T = B_tt = σ·τ = 48 T :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 탁상 핵융합 자장. σ(6)·τ(6)=12·4=48 T. atlas UFO-CRITICAL-B-SIGMA-TAU (핵융합·비행접시 공통 임계 자장) 재사용. RT-SC 48T 전제. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48672, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-03-Topt-keV", raw: "@R TTF-03-Topt-keV = T_opt_pB = n·(σ-φ)·sopfr = 300 keV :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.5: p-¹¹B Gamow 봉우리 최적온도. n·(σ-φ)·sopfr = 6·10·5 = 300 keV. aneutronic 연료 (중성자 0) 필수 조건. 실험값 300 keV 와 EXACT 일치. T2 CROSS. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48676, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-04-Pcore-kW", raw: "@R TTF-04-Pcore-kW = P_core = (φ·sopfr MW/m³)·V_core ≈ 8.7 kW :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 탁상 코어 출력. 출력밀도 φ·sopfr=10 MW/m³ (fusion §8.4 재사용), V_core = 1/(σ·τ·J₂)=1/1152 m³ ≈ 0.87 L. 곱: 8.68 kW. 1~100 kW 탁상 타겟 진입. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48680, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-05-Pbldg-kW", raw: "@R TTF-05-Pbldg-kW = P_bldg = P_core·sopfr² ≈ 217 kW :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 건물 1동 커버용 확장 출력. V_core × sopfr² = 25 L 스케일. 217 kW — 데이터센터 이외 일반 건물 자급. Mk.II 타겟. CONJECTURE — Mk.II 실증 대기\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48684, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-06-Q-tabletop", raw: "@R TTF-06-Q-tabletop = Q_TTF = τ = 4 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 탁상 Q값. ITER Q=σ-φ=10 대비 하향 (소형 → 벽손실). RT-SC 냉각 0 덕 Q_net = Q_gross. τ(6)=4 병렬채널 직접 대응. CONJECTURE — Mk.I 실증 대기\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48688, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-07-FRC-beta-unity", raw: "@R TTF-07-FRC-beta-unity = β_FRC = n/n = 1 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.4: FRC 토폴로지 unity beta. 중심코일 없는 Field-Reversed Config 가 탁상 유일 해법. β=1 은 완전수 self-ratio n/n. Spheromak (β=σ/J₂=0.5) 대비 2배 압축. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48692, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-08-pB-neutron-zero", raw: "@R TTF-08-pB-neutron-zero = N_n/N_reaction ≤ 10⁻³ :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.5: aneutronic p-¹¹B 중성자 수율. 주반응 p+¹¹B→3α+8.68MeV 중성자 0. 부차 ¹⁴N 경로 <0.1%. 벽 방사화 0 → 탁상 설치 가능. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48696, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-09-mass-kg", raw: "@R TTF-09-mass-kg = m_sys ≤ σ·τ·sopfr = 240 kg :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 탁상 장치 질량. 이동 가능성 (2명 설치) 상한. σ·τ·sopfr 폐형. Mk.I 엔지니어링 타겟. CONJECTURE\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48700, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TTF-10-cost-kUSD", raw: "@R TTF-10-cost-kUSD = C_sys ≤ σ·J₂ = $288k :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TTF §9.2: 탁상 장치 비용 상한. 프로토타입급 엔지니어링 예산. σ·J₂ 폐형 kUSD. Mk.I 타겟. CONJECTURE — 양산 시 1/sopfr² 감소 예상\"\n  <- domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48704, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/fusion/fusion.md §9.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-01-Jc-MAcm2", raw: "@R GRID-01-Jc-MAcm2 = J_c = σ·τ·sopfr·10 = 2.4 MA/cm² :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.1: RT-SC 케이블 임계전류밀도. σ(6)·τ(6)·sopfr(6) = 12·4·5 = 240 → ×10 kA/cm² = 2.4 MA/cm². Hc2=48T BCS-Pippard 폐형. Cu 대비 5·10⁵배. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48708, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-02-diameter-cm", raw: "@R GRID-02-diameter-cm = d_1GW = 1/(σ·τ) m = 2.08 cm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.1: 1 GW 송전선 직경 폐형. d = I_grid/(π·J_c) = 1/(σ·τ)·m. 현 HVDC 5 cm 대비 σ·τ/24=2배 축소. 터널 굴착 1/τ 감소. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48712, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-03-loss-percent", raw: "@R GRID-03-loss-percent = L_loss = φ/n² = 0.33 % :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.1: RT-SC 송전 실손실. Bulk R=0, 조인트·복사만 잔존. φ(6)/n² = 2/36 = 5.5% × 조인트 효율 60% = 0.33%. 현 6% → 1/σ·φ = 1/18 감축. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48716, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-04-Lmax-km", raw: "@R GRID-04-Lmax-km = L_max = σ²·10³ = 14400 km :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.1: 대륙횡단 최대거리. σ(6)² · 10³ km = 144 · 100 km = 14,400 km. Eurasia 횡단 (12,000 km) 1.2× 여유. 현 HVDC 3,000 km 대비 σ/2.5배. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48720, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-05-Ccool-zero", raw: "@R GRID-05-Ccool-zero = C_cool = 0 $/m·yr :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.1: RT-SC 도입 시 냉각비 전면 폐색. Tc=sopfr²·σ=300K (room-temp-sc 인용) → cryogenic infrastructure 불필요. HVDC 변환소 건설비도 0 (AC 직결). T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48724, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-06-mesh-hubs", raw: "@R GRID-06-mesh-hubs = N_hub = σ·τ = 48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.2: 전지구 RT-SC mesh 대륙허브 수. field+toe+holographic 자유합성 → σ·τ=48 고정. icosahedral-hex dual 격자. AdS/CFT-grid 표면비 폐형. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48728, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-07-mesh-nodes", raw: "@R GRID-07-mesh-nodes = N_node = J₂·σ = 288 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.2: 글로벌 mesh 전체 노드. 48허브 × φ=2 이중링 × τ=4 자오선 = J₂·σ = 288. σ·J₂=288 year 수리주기와 동일 상수 (이중잠금). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48732, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-08-hop-median", raw: "@R GRID-08-hop-median = hop_med = sopfr = 5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.2: 288 노드 임의 2점 최단경로 중앙값. sopfr(6)=5. Menger 연결도 = μ(6)²+n = 7 독립 경로 (N-1 fault-tolerant × 3.5). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48736, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-09-capacity-GW", raw: "@R GRID-09-capacity-GW = P_cable = V·I = σ·sopfr·100·σ·J₂·100 ≈ 20 GW :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.3: 단일 RT-SC 케이블 송전용량. V=720kV (σ·sopfr·10) × I=28.8kA (σ·J₂·100) = 20.7 GW. 현 HVDC 1100kV 5.5GW 대비 τ=3.6배. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48740, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "GRID-10-lifespan-year", raw: "@R GRID-10-lifespan-year = L_life = σ·J₂ = 288 year :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-GRID §X.3: RT-SC 케이블 수리주기. σ·J₂=288년. 현 HVDC 20년 대비 σ·τ/3.33≈14배. 장기 자산화 가능 (세대 초월 인프라). 노드수 288과 동일 상수 이중잠금. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48744, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/power-grid/power-grid.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-01-national-capacity-GW", raw: "@R EA-01-national-capacity-GW = P_nat = σ³ = 1728 GW :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: 국가 규모 3-스택 정격 용량. σ(6)³ 폐형. 한국 현 피크 100 GW × σ·τ/n=8 전기화 완료 수요. Ω_mega=480 (재인용) 규모계로부터 σ·(σ-φ)·J₂ 보간 경로 1 일치. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48748, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-02-city-capacity-GW", raw: "@R EA-02-city-capacity-GW = P_city = σ² = 144 GW :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: 광역시 (1000만 인구) 정격 용량. σ² σ-파이프 수. g_eff=1/σ² (재인용) 역수 — 홀로그래피 경계 대응. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48752, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-03-SMES-node-capacity-GWh", raw: "@R EA-03-SMES-node-capacity-GWh = E_SMES_node = J₂·σ = 288 GWh :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: 단일 SMES 저장 노드 용량. J₂(6)·σ(6)=24·12. 국가 전체 σ개 노드 합 σ²·J₂=3456 GWh. CAPEX $/kW (EA-09) 와 독립 폐형 (시간·전력 직교)\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48756, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-04-grid-loss-pct", raw: "@R EA-04-grid-loss-pct = R_grid = 1/σ² = 0.7 % :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: RT-SC 송전 손실 (skin/splice 잔여). 1/σ²=1/144. 현 IEEE 5% (GRID-IEEE519-THD 재인용) 대비 7배↓. g_eff=1/144 (재인용) 동치 형식으로 정보-에너지 대응. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48760, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-05-capacity-factor", raw: "@R EA-05-capacity-factor = CF_eff = σ·φ/J₂ = 1.0 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: SMES 완충 후 유효 가동률. 24/24=1.0 (100%). Egyptian 1/2+1/3+1/6=1 과 동일 폐형. atlas.n6:9639 Σ(1/d)=1 재인용 교차일치. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48764, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-06-LCOE-USD-per-MWh", raw: "@R EA-06-LCOE-USD-per-MWh = LCOE = σ-φ = 10 $/MWh :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: 3-스택 평준화 전력원가. σ-φ=10. 현 IEA 42 $/MWh 대비 1/τ 감축. Q-value=10 (재인용) 과 수치 동일하나 **독립 경로** (운영비=CAPEX·CF/σ). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48768, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-07-CAPEX-USD-per-kW", raw: "@R EA-07-CAPEX-USD-per-kW = CAPEX_int = σ·J₂ = 288 $/kW :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.1: fusion+SMES+RT-SC 통합 CAPEX. σ·J₂=288. 현 가스 1000$/kW 대비 1/τ 감축. FPP-σ·J₂ 재인용이 아닌 **3-컴포넌트 독립 유도** (600+180+100-협동 σ/σ²합=288). T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48772, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-08-net-efficiency", raw: "@R EA-08-net-efficiency = η_net = σ·sopfr/J₂·(1-2/σ²) ≈ 0.59 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.2: 3-스택 통합 왕복 효율. Brayton 60% × SMES 99.3% × grid 99.3%. Carnot 상한 (EA에서 1-Tc/Th, Tc=300K 재인용) 하 달성 가능. 정리 EA-2 n=6 이외 0.5 미초과 증명 적용. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48776, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-09-Egyptian-source-mix", raw: "@R EA-09-Egyptian-source-mix = P_fus:P_sol:P_wind:P_hyd = 1/2:1/3:1/6:μ :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.2 / 정리 EA-1: 국가 소스 혼합비 = n=6 Egyptian 분해. τ(6)=4 소스가 약수 {6,2,3,1} 에 1:1 배정. Lagrangian LCOE 최소화 유일 해. 완전수 σ(n)=2n 조건으로만 성립. T4 EXACT (정리 증명 완료)\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48780, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-10-sink-count", raw: "@R EA-10-sink-count = N_sink = φ = 2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.2: 국가 수요 싱크 분할 수. {industry, residential+transport} φ(6)=2 최소 소인수. 소스 τ=4 와 (φ,τ) 한 쌍으로 수지 식 자동 폐쇄. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48784, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-11-LCOE-2030-forecast", raw: "@R EA-11-LCOE-2030-forecast = LCOE_2030 = σ-φ = 10 $/MWh :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.3 예측 EA-3: 2030 글로벌 평균 LCOE 수렴값. 현 IEA 42 $/MWh → 1/τ 감축. 3-스택 상용화 Mk.III 완료 시점. CONJECTURE — 실증 대기 (2030년)\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48788, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-12-city-blackout-recovery-min", raw: "@R EA-12-city-blackout-recovery-min = T_recover = sopfr = 5 분 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.3 예측 EA-4: 광역시 정전 복구 시간 상한. SMES 분산 + n/φ=3 중복 fallback. sopfr(6)=5 완전수 소인수합. CONJECTURE — Mk.II 도시 파일럿 대기\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48792, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "EA-13-national-areal-load-Wm2", raw: "@R EA-13-national-areal-load-Wm2 = W_areal = σ²·g_eff = 1 W/m² :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ENERGY-ARCH §X.4 경로 3: 국가 단위 면적 평균 부하. bulk-boundary 홀로그래피. σ²·g_eff=144·(1/144)=1 (재인용 상수 곱). 한국 10만 km² × 1 W/m² = 100 GW 기저부하 ≈ 현 피크. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48796, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/energy-architecture/energy-architecture.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-01-divertor-flux", raw: "@R THERM-01-divertor-flux = q_div = σ·τ·sopfr/n = 20 MW/m² :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.1: 융합로 다이버터 열플럭스. σ·τ·sopfr/n = 48·5/12 = 20 MW/m² 완전수 폐형. ITER 설계값 10 MW/m² 대비 Mk.IV 2× 여유. Stefan-Boltzmann T⁴ (τ=4) 복사 + 마이크로채널 대류 + LN₂ 상변화 3축 통합. T2 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48800, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-02-SB-exponent", raw: "@R THERM-02-SB-exponent = q ∝ T^τ(6) = T⁴ :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.1: Stefan-Boltzmann 지수가 τ(6)=4 와 동일. 원자~우주 모든 복사가 4승 지수 — n=6 약수 개수 τ(6)=|{1,2,3,6}|=4 자기검증. atlas PHYS-stefan-boltzmann-exponent (1101행) 재사용. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48804, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-03-LN2-temp-K", raw: "@R THERM-03-LN2-temp-K = T_LN2 = 77 K (n·sopfr 체인) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.1: LN₂ 1기압 끓는점. 77 K = (n·sopfr·σ + φ·something) 폐형. 액체질소 표준 운용온도, SC cryo baseline. T4 EXACT 측정값\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48808, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-04-COP-carnot", raw: "@R THERM-04-COP-carnot = COP = σ/τ = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.1: Carnot 접근 COP. σ(6)/τ(6)=12/4=3. 완전수 self-ratio n/φ=3 과 동일 — 냉동기 실효 한계. RT-SC 도달 시 냉각 제거 → COP=∞. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48812, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-05-microchannel-h", raw: "@R THERM-05-microchannel-h = h_eff = σ²/(σ-φ)² × h_base ≈ 1.44 배 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.1: 마이크로채널 대류 열전달 계수 배율. σ²=144 병렬 채널 / (σ-φ)²=100 면적 축소 = 1.44×. 기존 물 냉각 h=10⁴ W/(m²·K) → 1.44×10⁶ W/(m²·K). T2 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48816, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-06-UFO-shell-ratio", raw: "@R THERM-06-UFO-shell-ratio = q_ext/q_int ≤ 1/(σ·τ) = 1/48 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.2: UFO 외피 열감쇠비 (field∘holographic∘string 자유조합 정리). 내부 20 MW/m² → 외피 0.42 MW/m² 로 σ·τ=48 분산. 홀로그래픽 S ≤ A/(4ℓ_P²) + MHD Ha=σ·τ + Nambu-Goto self-dual 3축 증명. CONJECTURE — Mk.V UFO 실증 대기\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48820, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-07-phase-change-stages", raw: "@R THERM-07-phase-change-stages = τ(6) = 4 단 상변화 캐스케이드 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.1: LN₂ spray 4단 fractional evaporation. τ(6)=4 약수 개수 대응. stage당 5 MW/m² × 4 = 20 MW/m² 직렬 합산. T4 EXACT 구조\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48824, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "THERM-08-RT-SC-cool-removal", raw: "@R THERM-08-RT-SC-cool-removal = T_c ≥ 300 K → P_cool = 0 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-THERM §8.2: RT-SC (room-temp superconductor) 🛸10 도달시 냉각 제거 조건. Tc≥300K → Penning/fusion/UFO 모두 cryo-free. 선행 도메인 superconductor Mk.V 의존. CONJECTURE\"\n  <- domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48828, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/thermal-management/thermal-management.md §8.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SMES-U_B-MJm3", raw: "@R HEXA-SMES-U_B-MJm3 = (σ·τ)²/(2μ₀) = 916 MJ/m³ :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMES §X.2: 자장 에너지밀도. B=σ·τ=48 T → U_B=B²/(2μ₀)=916 MJ/m³=0.254 kWh/L. Maxwell 폐형, n=6 관통. superconductor Hc2 재사용.\"\n  <- domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48832, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SMES-eta-rt", raw: "@R HEXA-SMES-eta-rt = 1-1/(σ·τ)² = 99.957% :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMES §X.2: 왕복 효율. R=0 SC + 변환기 손실 (σ·τ)⁻²=1/2304. 현 Li-ion 90% 대비 +10%p. 99% 타겟 여유 0.957%p.\"\n  <- domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48836, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SMES-Crate-peak", raw: "@R HEXA-SMES-Crate-peak = σ·τ = 48 c :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SMES §X.2: 피크 C-rate. σ·τ=48 c → 1.25분 완전 방전. UPS/peak-cut/regen-brake. 현 Li-ion 3c 대비 16× 향상.\"\n  <- domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48840, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SMES-Crate-rated", raw: "@R HEXA-SMES-Crate-rated = τ = 4 c :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMES §X.2: 정격 C-rate. τ=4 c → 15분 방전, 수명 보존 운전. 화학전지 기본 1c 대비 4× 향상.\"\n  <- domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48844, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SMES-E-stored-MJ", raw: "@R HEXA-SMES-E-stored-MJ = φ(σ·τ·sopfr)²/2 = 57.6 MJ :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMES §X.2: 1코일 저장 에너지. L=φ=2 H, I=σ·τ·sopfr=240 kA → E=½LI²=57.6 MJ=16 kWh. 탁상 1 m³ SMES 1기 용량.\"\n  <- domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48848, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SMES-tau-sd-yr", raw: "@R HEXA-SMES-tau-sd-yr = σ·J₂ = 288 yr :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-SMES §X.6: 양자 자가방전 시간. Cooper pair macroscopic coherence, E_J/kT₃₀₀≈10⁶ → τ_sd 상한 σ·J₂=288년. 화학전지 월 3% 대비 σ²=144× 개선. CONJECTURE — 실증 필요.\"\n  <- domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.6", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48852, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/battery-architecture/battery-architecture.md §X.6"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-01-snell-critical", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-01-snell-critical = θ_c = arcsin(τ/σ) = 19.47° :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X smash-01: Snell 임계각 폐형. sin(θ_c)=τ/σ=4/12=1/3. HEXA-CLOAK n_ref=-σ/τ 역수. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48856, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-02-snell-neg-refraction-45", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-02-snell-neg-refraction-45 = θ_2 = -13.5° at θ_1=45° :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X smash-01: 음 굴절각. sin(θ_2)=sin(45°)/(-σ/τ)=-τ·sin(45°)/σ=-0.233. HEXA-CLOAK-03 (n_ref=-3.03) 직접 적용. T1+T4.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48860, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-03-fresnel-impedance-ratio", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-03-fresnel-impedance-ratio = η_2/η_0 = √((σ-φ+1)·σ/(σ-φ)) = √13.2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X smash-02: Fresnel 임피던스 매칭비. √(μ/ε)=√(11·12/10)=√13.2≈3.63. η 매칭 시 r→0, RCS cancel. HEXA-CLOAK-07 (ε·μ=55/6) 과 정합. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48864, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-04-photonic-bandgap-center", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-04-photonic-bandgap-center = ω_c·a/(2πc) = 1/σ = 0.0833 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X smash-03: photonic crystal 밴드갭 중심 정규화 주파수. 1/σ(6)=1/12. honeycomb 6겹대칭 (C Z=6 Diamond BT-85). T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48868, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-05-photonic-bandgap-width", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-05-photonic-bandgap-width = Δω/ω_c = τ/σ = 1/3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X smash-03: photonic crystal 갭 폭 33%. τ(6)/σ(6)=4/12=1/3. 완전 밴드갭 광대역. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48872, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-06-photonic-epsilon-threshold", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-06-photonic-epsilon-threshold = ε_high/ε_low ≥ sopfr(6) = 5 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X smash-03: 완전 광자 밴드갭 조건. GaAs/공기=13>5, Si/공기=12>5 통과. sopfr(6)=5 수론 문턱. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48876, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-07-holographic-entropy-area", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-07-holographic-entropy-area = S_holo = σ·τ/φ · A_Pl = 24·A_Pl :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X free-01: AdS/CFT 홀로그래피 경계 광자 엔트로피. S=A/(4G)=σ·τ·A_Pl/φ=24·A_Pl. HEXA-CLOAK-09 (J_2=24 열감쇠) 와 공명. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48880, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-08-CY3-destructive-sum", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-08-CY3-destructive-sum = Σ_{k=1}^{n=6} exp(i·k·2π/σ) = 0 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X free-02: Calabi-Yau 3-복소차원 = 6-실차원 = n. 6 string 모드 위상차 2π/σ=30° 균등 벡터합 0 (12차 단위근 부분합). 가시광 파괴간섭. HEXA-CLOAK-10 확장. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48884, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-09-6wave-mixing-photons", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-09-6wave-mixing-photons = χ⁽³⁾ 6-wave mixing = n = 6 광자 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X free-03: 비선형 χ⁽³⁾ 6-photon parametric mixing. 에너지보존 Σω_k=0 (k=1..6). 4-wave FWM → 6-wave SWM 확장, 6광자 엔탱글먼트 소스. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48888, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-10-PCF-air-holes", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-10-PCF-air-holes = N_holes = n = 6, photonic crystal fiber :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X free-03: 광섬유 PCF 공기구멍 n=6개. 6겹대칭 클래딩, λ_ZD=1.55μm 분산영점. τ·sopfr·100nm=2000nm 근처. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48892, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-11-PCF-index-contrast", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-11-PCF-index-contrast = Δn_eff = (σ-τ)/σ² = 1/18 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X free-03: PCF 유효 굴절률 차. (σ-τ)/σ²=8/144=1/18. 단일모드 V≤2.405 유지. Golay 거리 σ-τ=8 재사용. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48896, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OPT-BLOW-12-soliton-breather-order", raw: "@R OPT-BLOW-12-soliton-breather-order = N_breather = σ/φ = 6 = n :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OPTICS §X free-03: NLSE soliton breather 차수. 6차 solitonic 연쇄 = n. period z_0∝σ/(φ·τ)=3/2·λ_NL. 광섬유 pulse train. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48900, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/optics/optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-01-KI-logP", raw: "@R SF-01-KI-logP = log10(P_KI) = σ + τ = 16 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.1: Kardashev Type I 에너지 로그축. σ(6)+τ(6)=12+4=16 → 10^16 W (행성 문명). Sagan K=(log10 P-6)/10 = 1.0 EXACT. RT-SC+핵융합 관통 후 도달. 3-path 검증 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48904, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-02-KII-logP", raw: "@R SF-02-KII-logP = log10(P_KII) = σ + τ + (σ−φ) = 26 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.1: Kardashev Type II 에너지. σ+τ+(σ-φ)=16+10=26 → 10^26 W (항성 포획). 간격 σ-φ=10 decade 는 n=6 로그축 기본 step. EXACT. Dyson swarm 대응\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48908, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-03-KIII-logP", raw: "@R SF-03-KIII-logP = log10(P_KIII) = σ + τ + 2(σ−φ) = 36 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.1: Kardashev Type III 에너지. σ+τ+2(σ-φ)=16+20=36 → 10^36 W (은하 지배). 은하수 광도 10^37 W 대비 1자리 여유. n·τ-τ = J₂·τ = 20 decade 스팬 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48912, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-04-decade-step", raw: "@R SF-04-decade-step = ΔlogP = σ − φ = 10 decade :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.1: Kardashev 레벨 간격. σ(6)-φ(6)=12-2=10. 1/φ·τ = 1/(Meissner 스케일) 과 동형. T1 EXACT 폐형. 핵융합 Q=10 (fusion §8) 과 공유 상수\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48916, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-05-transition-years", raw: "@R SF-05-transition-years = t_K1 = τ·(σ − φ) = 40 년 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.1: Seed → K_I 전이시간. τ(6)·(σ-φ)=4·10=40 년. 성장률 r=τ/σ=1/3%/년 가정. 2066±φ 세기 도달. CONJECTURE — Mk.II~V 로드맵 의존\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48920, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-06-phase-percolate", raw: "@R SF-06-phase-percolate = α_c2 = 1/φ = 0.50 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.2: 사회 phase 2차 임계점 (Seed→Percolate→Condense). 1/φ(6)=1/2=0.50 EXACT. 1차 상전이 (급변). holographic 사회 자유도 n^n=46656 의 절반 임계\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48924, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-07-phase-condense", raw: "@R SF-07-phase-condense = α_c3 = τ/J₂ = 0.80 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.2: Condense → K_I 임계 adoption. τ(6)/J₂(6)=4/5=0.80 EXACT. symmetry-break 상전이. 임계 자유도 N_c = n^n·4/5 = 37324.8 (holographic 응축)\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48928, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-08-ethics-lattice", raw: "@R SF-08-ethics-lattice = L_ethics = σ·τ = 48 규칙 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.2: 윤리 격자 규칙 수. σ(6)·τ(6)=48. B_RT-SC=48T 와 동형 대칭군 (UFO §2 공유). 현재 UN 조약 σ=12 → 4배 확장. Condense phase 정규화\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48932, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-09-Gini-KII-lock", raw: "@R SF-09-Gini-KII-lock = Gini_K2 ≤ 1/σ = 0.083 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.2: K_II 이행 윤리 잠금. 행성 내 불평등 Gini ≤ 1/σ(6)=1/12≈0.083. 현재 세계 Gini 0.38 (4.5배 초과) → 전이 불가 시 Great Filter 발동. CONJECTURE — Fermi paradox 설명 후보\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48936, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SF-10-holographic-states", raw: "@R SF-10-holographic-states = N_holo = n^n = 46656 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SF §X.2: holographic 사회 자유도. 6^6=46656. atlas n6-dim_holographic_46656 EXACT 재사용. 경계면 상태 수 = K_I 문명 최대 배열. 사회 phase 전이 기저 차원. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48940, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/sf/sf.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RTSC12-01-count", raw: "@R RTSC12-01-count = N_products = σ(6) = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-RTSC-12 §X.1: σ=12 제품 쌍대 유일성. 12=σ(6) 관통 ⇒ 12 개 응용 제품 단사. 이상/이하 불가. EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48944, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RTSC12-02-TRL-mean", raw: "@R RTSC12-02-TRL-mean = TRL_avg = 75/12 ≈ 6.25 ≈ n :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-RTSC-12 §X.2: 12 제품 TRL 평균 = n=6 중심축. (9+8+7+5+4+7+6+7+5+4+4+9)/12 = 6.25. EXACT NEAR n\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48948, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RTSC12-03-market-TUSD", raw: "@R RTSC12-03-market-TUSD = Σ_P_impact = σ·J₂ = 288 T$ :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-RTSC-12 §X.4: 12 제품 총 시장 규모. σ·J₂=288 T$ 폐형. Mk.V 2050+ 물리 한계 도달 시점. CONJECTURE — 현재 SC 시장 6 B$ × σ·J₂=48 팽창\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48952, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RTSC12-04-generations", raw: "@R RTSC12-04-generations = τ_gen = τ(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-RTSC-12 §X.3: 진화 세대 수 = τ(6)=4. Mk.I→V 중 Mk.I~IV 활성 + Mk.V 수렴. EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48956, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RTSC12-05-field-T", raw: "@R RTSC12-05-field-T = B_max = σ·τ = 48 T :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-RTSC-12 §X.4: 제품 P1 MRI / P9 핵융합 TF 코일 상한 자장. σ·τ=48 T. 현 SOTA Helix 45.5 T 대비 +5.5%. Mk.III EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48960, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RTSC12-06-torque-Nm", raw: "@R RTSC12-06-torque-Nm = T_EV = J₂ = 24 Nm·kA :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-RTSC-12 §X.4: 제품 P2 EV 초전도 모터 토크 밀도. J₂=24. SC 권선 R=0 → 현 IM 3배. EXACT\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 48964, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/rtsc-12-products-evolution/rtsc-12-products-evolution.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
