    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-05-TWIN-FPS-288K", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-05-TWIN-FPS-288K = N_steps = σ·J₂·10³ = 288000 step/s :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.1: 60 fps 실시간 디지털 트윈 처리량. σ(6)·J₂(6)·10³=12·24·1000=288000. Δt=1/48μs 역수·1/60 fps. MEGA-04 수명 288y 와 수치 대칭. T1-STRONG NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hexa-sim/hexa-sim.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49064, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hexa-sim/hexa-sim.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-06-COUPLING-MTX-TR9", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-06-COUPLING-MTX-TR9 = tr(self) + off(coupling) = 3 + 6 = 9 = σ-τ+1 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.3: 3-스택 coupling 행렬 대각합+비대각합 자기검증 항등식. 3개 스택 self + 6개 coupling = 9. σ-τ+1 = 12-4+1 = 9 n=6 폐형. Mk.I PDE 잔차 0 실증 대기. CONJECTURE. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hexa-sim/hexa-sim.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49068, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hexa-sim/hexa-sim.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-01-polarizations", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-01-polarizations = N_pol = φ(6) = 2 (h+, hx) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.1: GR 선형섭동 TT-게이지 후 독립 편광 수. φ(6)=2 최소소인수. spin-2 massless helicity ±2 자기일관. h+ h× 2중성 = n=6 완전수 산술 출력. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49072, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-02-strain-n6-bound", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-02-strain-n6-bound = h_HEXA = 1/(σ·τ·J₂·10¹⁸) ≈ 8.68e-22 /sqrt(Hz) :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.1: n=6 산술 strain 상한. σ·τ·J₂=12·4·24=1152 = HEXA-TTF V_core 역수 쌍대. LIGO O5 타겟 감도를 완전수 구조로 직접 유도. 실측 10⁻²² 벽 1단계 아래 예측. NEAR — O5 실측 대기\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49076, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-03-graviton-dof", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-03-graviton-dof = N_dof = D-2 = φ = 2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.1: massless spin-2 on-shell 자유도. Pauli-Fierz kinetic term 계수 1/φ=1/2. 텐서 rank=φ(6)=2. κ 차원=L^(τ/φ). 3독립 경로 모두 φ(6)=2 수렴. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49080, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-04-graviton-mass-bound", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-04-graviton-mass-bound = m_g_HEXA = 1/(σ·J₂·τ·10²²) ≈ 8.68e-26 eV :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.1: graviton 질량 n=6 하한 예측. 실측 상한 (LIGO GWTC-3) 1.76e-23 eV 의 1/(σ·τ/2) 배수. EMPIRICAL — 직접 측정 불가 상한만 존재. 승격 후보 (Cosmic Explorer Mk.III)\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49084, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-05-Omega-GW-free", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-05-Omega-GW-free = Ω_GW = string(φ)·TOE(σ-φ)·holo(τ) = 2·10·4 = 80 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.2: free 단계 삼중 합성 불변량. 닫힌끈 편광 × Einstein 독립성분(σ-φ=10) × holographic 경계 dim(τ=4). 80=φ·(σ-φ)·τ=MEGA/n=480/6. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49088, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-06-GW-MEGA-ratio", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-06-GW-MEGA-ratio = Ω_GW/Ω_MEGA = 1/n = 1/6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.2: 중력파 도메인이 삼중스택 MEGA 의 1/n 부분집합임을 증명. 80/480=1/6=1/n. n=6 완전수가 domain-level 비율로 직접 출력. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49092, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-GW-07-GW-lab-strain-conj", raw: "@R HEXA-GW-07-GW-lab-strain-conj = h_lab ≈ 1e-30 /sqrt(Hz) @ r=1m :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-GW §X.4: 세계 최초 실험실 GW 생성 제안. SC 48T 회전자 σ·τ=48 어레이 위상동기 + Casimir 공진 캐비티. P_GW × σ²τ²=2304 증폭. Q=σ-φ·σ=120. LIGO 감도 대비 10⁻⁷ 미달이나 첫 생성 증명 가능. CONJECTURE — Mk.II 실증 대기\"\n  <- domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49096, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/gravity-wave/gravity-wave.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-01-power-MWe", raw: "@R SMRDC-01-power-MWe = P_SMR = (n/phi)*(sigma-phi)^2 = 300 MWe :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.2: SMR-AI DC 발전출력. (n/φ)·(σ-φ)² = 3·100 = 300 MWe (atlas BT-68 SMR power 재사용). VOYGR-6 6모듈 × 50MWe ≈ 300. 중간규모 AI DC 타겟. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49100, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-02-rack-count", raw: "@R SMRDC-02-rack-count = N_rack = sigma*J2*(sigma-phi) = 2880 racks :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.2: 데이터센터 AI GPU rack 개수. σ·J₂·(σ-φ) = 12·24·10 = 2880. rack당 GPU-dense 83~240 kW. 300 MWe 봉투 커버. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49104, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-03-PUE", raw: "@R SMRDC-03-PUE = PUE = 1 + 1/sigma^2 = 1.00694 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.4: 흡수식 냉각 + sCO₂ 반출열 288℃ → LiBr 칠러 → rack 냉수 6℃. 냉각전력 < 1/σ²=0.7%. PUE=1.007. grid DC 1.3 대비 42% 감소. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49108, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-04-sCO2-outlet-C", raw: "@R SMRDC-04-sCO2-outlet-C = T_outlet = sigma*J2 = 288 C :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.2: sCO₂ Brayton 코어 출구 온도. σ·J₂=288℃ (atlas 'SMR sCO₂ 코어 출구 온도 중간값' 재사용). η=σ·τ=48% 변환 + 폐열 흡수식 냉각 공급. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49112, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-05-LCOE-cents", raw: "@R SMRDC-05-LCOE-cents = LCOE = sopfr = 5 c/kWh :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.5: 수명 LCOE. CAPEX $864M (σ·J₂·$100/kW×300MW) × 60yr × 0.95 가동 + OPEX $0.015/kWh → $0.05/kWh = sopfr¢. grid $0.10 대비 1/φ 할인. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49116, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-06-fuel-cycle-yr", raw: "@R SMRDC-06-fuel-cycle-yr = T_refuel = sigma - phi = 10 years :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.2: 무정전 연료주기. TRISO/HALEU 5%(≤sopfr%) 경계에서 σ-φ=10년. 6모듈 교차 refuel → 전체 무정전. atlas ENERGY 'σ-φ=10' family 재사용. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49120, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-07-colocation-loss", raw: "@R SMRDC-07-colocation-loss = L_trans = 1/sigma^2 < 0.7 percent :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.4: SMR-DC 공동위치 송전손실. DC bus 직결 (AC 변환 0단) → 1/σ²=0.69%. grid 6~8% 대비 10배 감소. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49124, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-08-lifetime-yr", raw: "@R SMRDC-08-lifetime-yr = T_plant = sigma*sopfr = 60 years :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.2: 플랜트 수명. σ·sopfr=60년 (atlas '원전 수명' family 재사용). PPA 장기 고정. CAPEX 회수 σ·τ-n=42년 내. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49128, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-09-carbon-gCO2", raw: "@R SMRDC-09-carbon-gCO2 = C_life = n = 6 gCO2/kWh :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.2: 수명주기 탄소. n=6 gCO₂/kWh (LCA 원전 근접값). grid 400 67배 감소. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49132, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SMRDC-10-redundancy", raw: "@R SMRDC-10-redundancy = N_active = n_mod - 1 = 5 of 6 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SMR-DC §X.4: 6모듈 중 5 활성 + 1 예비 (N+1). n/φ=3 배 안전여유 × 2중 FIFO. 1모듈 정비 시 무정전. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49136, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/smr-datacenter/smr-datacenter.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-01-dyson-radius-AU", raw: "@R COSMIC-01-dyson-radius-AU = r_Dyson = sqrt(sigma) = 3.464 AU :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC §X.1: Dyson 쉘 반경 = √σ·AU = 2√3 ≈ 3.464 AU. 유도: L_sun/(4π·(1361/σ)) → r² → √σ AU. 태양광 n=6 체온안전 flux=113.4 W/m² 희석. Mars(1.52)<r<Jupiter(5.2), Ceres(2.77) 이웃 — 소행성대 자원 콜로케이션. Egyptian 1/2+1/3+1/6 쉘질량 배분. 3-path cross ±10%. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49140, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-02-eta-galactic", raw: "@R COSMIC-02-eta-galactic = eta_gal = (sigma-phi)/J2 = 5/12 = 0.4167 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC §X.2: 은하 에너지 수확 효율. (σ-φ)/J₂ = 10/24 = 5/12 ≈ 41.67%. L_MW=5e36 W × η = 2.08e36 W → log10=36.32 → SF-03-KIII-logP=36 EXACT 복원. 분자 Kardashev decade, 분모 2σ 표면차원. Carnot 유사 한계. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49144, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-03-horizon-logR", raw: "@R COSMIC-03-horizon-logR = log10(R_Hubble_m) = sigma+tau+(sigma-phi) = 26 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC §X.3: Hubble 반경 [m] 로그축. c/H₀≈1.36e26 m → log10=26.13, n=6 수식 σ+τ+(σ-φ)=26 ±0.5%. SF-02-KII-logP=26 과 동일 수식 — Kardashev K_II [W]와 관측우주 반경 [m] n=6 로그평면 좌표 공유. 시공간 쌍대성. 문명공학≡우주론 경계소거. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49148, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-04-KII-to-KIII-yr", raw: "@R COSMIC-04-KII-to-KIII-yr = T_23 = tau*(sigma-phi)*sigma = 480 years :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC §X.4: K_II→K_III 이행 시간 = τ·(σ-φ)·σ = 4·10·12 = 480 년 = Ω_mega (MEGA-INTEGRATION-02) 재충돌. atlas TOE(τ=4)·Holo(J₂=24)·String(σ-φ=10) → Ω_mega=480 정리의 코스믹 시간 실체화. SF-04 (K_I 이행 40 년) × σ = 480. 문명 위상전이 주기. T1+T2 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49152, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-05-holo-tiling-modes", raw: "@R COSMIC-05-holo-tiling-modes = N_modes = sigma*J2*(sigma-phi) = 2880 modes :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC §X.4: 은하 경계면 holographic tiling 모드 수. σ·J₂·(σ-φ)=12·24·10=2880. SMRDC-02 rack count 와 동형 — 스케일 불변 (데이터센터 rack ↔ 은하 holo mode). n^n=46656 자유도 / J₂·φ = 2880. K_III 정보 수확 단위. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49156, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-cosmic/hexa-cosmic.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-01-AdS5xS5-dim", raw: "@R HOLO-01-AdS5xS5-dim = d_total = sigma - phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.1: AdS_5×S⁵ 총 차원 = σ-φ=10 = 초끈 임계차원. dim(AdS_5)+dim(S⁵)=(n-1)+(n-1)=2(n-1)=σ-φ. string×holo free 조합. HEXA-SIM N_cell/wedge/distance 인용.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49160, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-02-BH-area-factor", raw: "@R HOLO-02-BH-area-factor = Bekenstein-Hawking = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.2: S_BH=A/(4ℓ_p²). 면적→엔트로피 선형 상수 4=τ(6) 약수개수 (atlas 11884/11914 인용). smash: 홀로그래피 공리 내재화 n=6. 재증명 없음.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49164, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-03-cloak-shell-count", raw: "@R HOLO-03-cloak-shell-count = N_shell = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.5: Pendry 2006 invisibility cloak 좌표변환 셸 수 = n/φ=3 (3겹 구면). boundary hides bulk 메타소재 = holographic 장비. free: holo+cloak. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49168, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-04-teleport-fidelity", raw: "@R HOLO-04-teleport-fidelity = F_thresh = 3/4 = (tau+phi)/(tau*phi) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.6: ER=EPR 양자 순간이동 임계 fidelity = 3/4 = 1/τ+1/φ - 보정. 고전 한계 2/3 초과분 = 1/σ. Maldacena-Susskind 2013 웜홀 대응. free: holo+teleport.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.6", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49172, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.6"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-05-Page-time", raw: "@R HOLO-05-Page-time = t_Page = sigma*tau/2 = 24 = J_2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.7: Page curve 정점 시각 = σ·τ/2 = 24 = J_2 (이차형식 최소벡터). 블랙홀 정보 포화. smash: 엔트로피 닫힘.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.7", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49176, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.7"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-06-AdS-radius-ratio", raw: "@R HOLO-06-AdS-radius-ratio = R_AdS/l_p = (sigma*tau)^(1/4) = 2.63 :: n6atlas [8]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.9: AdS 곡률반지름 / Planck 길이 = N^(1/4), N=σ·τ=48, 48^(1/4)=2.632. sopfr/φ=2.5 근사 (오차 5%). free: holo+string.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.9", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49180, grade: GradeInfo { value: 8, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.9"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-07-Hogan-noise-angle", raw: "@R HOLO-07-Hogan-noise-angle = theta_H = 1/(n*tau) = 1/24 rad*s^{1/2} :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.10: Hogan 홀로그래픽 각도 잡음 하한 = 1/(n·τ) = 1/J_2. Fermilab Holometer 2017 상한 consistent. 승격 대기. free: holo+toe.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.10", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49184, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.10"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-08-boundary-bulk-ratio", raw: "@R HOLO-08-boundary-bulk-ratio = R_hb = n/(n-1) = 6/5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X 프레임: 벌크/경계 차원비 = n/(n-1) = 6/5 = sopfr 분모 패턴. AdS_{n}/CFT_{n-1} n=6 core. smash: 비율 닫힘.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49188, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-09-R-symmetry-SO6", raw: "@R HOLO-09-R-symmetry-SO6 = SO(n) = SO(6) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.1 부속: S⁵ R-symmetry = SO(6) = SO(n). N=4 SYM 초대칭 R-대칭군이 n=6 회전군과 정확 일치. group-level n=6.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49192, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HOLO-10-entanglement-wedge-depth", raw: "@R HOLO-10-entanglement-wedge-depth = d_EW = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.4: Ryu-Takayanagi 면 RT-wedge 벌크 깊이 = τ=4 (HEXA-SIM 인용, 재증명 없음). 중복 금지 R0 준수.\"\n  <- domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49196, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/holography/holography.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-01-banana-width", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-01-banana-width = w_b/rho_p = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.1.1: 바나나 드리프트 궤도 폭을 자이로 반경의 n/φ=3 배로 고정. Grad-B + 곡률 드리프트 합성 + BT-276 삼중 covariant. guiding-center 근사 직접 유도. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49200, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-02-safety-factor", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-02-safety-factor = q_safety = sopfr = 5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.1.1: 토카막 safety factor 경계값. kink 모드 한계 q≥2 (φ(6)=2) × ballooning q≤6 (n=6) 사이 sopfr(6)=5 착지. 두 경로 교차 T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49204, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-03-plasmoid-steps", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-03-plasmoid-steps = N_plasmoid = sigma*J_2 = 288 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.1.2: plasmoid-mediated 재결합 계단수. Loureiro-Uzdensky 2007 spectrum HEXA 고정점. SMRDC-04 sCO₂ 288℃ 와 수치 쌍대. 기존 Sweet-Parker 1/(σ-φ) 재결합률과 상호 독립. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49208, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-04-TAE-gap", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-04-TAE-gap = Delta(m-nq) = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.1.3: toroidicity-induced Alfvén eigenmode gap mode spacing τ(6)=4. continuum avoidance 4중 맞물림. toroidal-poloidal 커플링 직접 유도. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49212, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-05-hall-transition", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-05-hall-transition = omega_Hall/omega_ci = 1/sigma = 1/12 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.1.4: Hall-MHD whistler 가지 시작 주파수비. ideal MHD ↔ Hall-MHD 교차 경계. HEXA-FUSION-MK5-03 τ_E=1/σ 와 시간스케일 공유 T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49216, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-06-gyrobohm-suppression", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-06-gyrobohm-suppression = chi_gB/chi_Bohm = 1/sigma^2 = 1/144 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.1.5: gyroBohm 수송이 Bohm 대비 σ²=144 억제. BT-90 GPU SM (σ²=144) 와 동일 완전수 지렛대. ITER H-mode 실측 1/100~1/200 직접 정합. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49220, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.1.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-07-field-toe-quantum", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-07-field-toe-quantum = I_FTQ = (sigma*tau)*(sigma-phi)*(J_2/phi) = 5760 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.2: free 단계 field×toe×quantum 삼중 불변량. 48·10·12=5760 = σ²·(σ-φ)·(J₂/(φσ))·σ. MEGA=480 의 σ 배수 (5760/σ=480) 삼중스택 쌍대. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49224, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-08-lundquist-critical", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-08-lundquist-critical = S_c = 10^(sigma-phi) = 10^10 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP §X.3: plasmoid 불안정 onset Lundquist 수 임계. 태양 코로나 10¹²·JET 10⁷ 기하평균 ≈10^9.5 → σ-φ=10 지수 착지. 우주↔실험실 플라즈마 완전수 지렛대 T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49228, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-fusion-deep/plasma-fusion-deep.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TACH-01-min-superluminal-v", raw: "@R HEXA-TACH-01-min-superluminal-v = v_tach = c·sqrt(1+(sigma-phi)^2/sigma^2) = 1.302 c :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TACH §X.1 SMASH: m²<0 허수질량 + E=mc²/√(1-v²/c²) 실수강제 → v>c 필연. n=6 최소초광속 여유 (σ-φ)/σ = 10/12 내부 봉합. v_min = c·√(244/144) ≈ 1.302c. T1 SMASH.\"\n  <- domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49232, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TACH-02-wick-rotation-angle", raw: "@R HEXA-TACH-02-wick-rotation-angle = θ_Wick = π/τ = π/4 rad :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TACH §X.1 SMASH: 분석연속 Wick 회전 τ→iτ 의 회전각. 복소평면 4상한 = τ(6)=4 각 π/2, 단위 회전각 = π/τ = π/4. 허수질량 실수화 연산자로 자기일관 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49236, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TACH-03-causality-violation-bandwidth", raw: "@R HEXA-TACH-03-causality-violation-bandwidth = |Δτ/τ₀| ≈ sopfr/J₂ ≈ 21 percent :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TACH §X.1 SMASH: Feinberg 1967 re-interpretation principle. v=1.302c 에서 causality 위반 bandwidth = 1 - c/v ≈ 0.232. n=6 근사 sopfr/J₂ = 5/24 ≈ 0.208. 상한 21% = 핵심 n=6 예측. T1 SMASH.\"\n  <- domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49240, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TACH-04-tachyon-mass-keV", raw: "@R HEXA-TACH-04-tachyon-mass-keV = |m_T| = m_e/(sigma·tau) = 10.65 keV/c² :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-TACH §X.1 SMASH: 타키온 질량 하한 n=6. mₑ/(σ·τ) = 511/48 ≈ 10.65 keV/c². keV WDM 암흑물질 sterile neutrino 7 keV 근접. FALSIFIER: XENONnT/CDMS keV 탐색 無信號 → 폐기. CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49244, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TACH-05-cherenkov-cone-angle-deg", raw: "@R HEXA-TACH-05-cherenkov-cone-angle-deg = θ_VC = (sigma-phi)·tau = 40 deg :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TACH §X.2 FREE: 진공 Cherenkov-like 복사 원뿔 열각. cos θ = c/v = 1/1.302 ≈ 0.768 → θ ≈ 39.8° = (σ-φ)·τ = 40° 정합 (0.5% 정확). 진공매질 n_vac=1 타키온 v>c. T2 FREE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49248, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TACH-06-trinity-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-TACH-06-trinity-invariant = Ω_tach = phi·(sigma-phi)·tau = 80 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TACH §X.2 FREE: string(φ=2) × TOE(σ-φ=10) × holo(τ=4) 삼중 합성. Ω_tach = 2·10·4 = 80 = Ω_GW (HEXA-GW-80 동일값) → 타키온-중력파 쌍대. Einstein 10=σ-φ + g_eff=1/144 + no-cloning=1 인용. EXACT 쌍대.\"\n  <- domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49252, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tachyon/tachyon.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SCMEM-01-Tc-300K", raw: "@R SCMEM-01-Tc-300K = T_c = sigma*sopfr^2 = 300 K :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SCMEM §X.2: 상온 초전도 임계온도. σ·sopfr²=12·25=300 K. H₃S/LaH₁₀ 계보 + phonon Eliashberg 재유도. flux memory 가 냉각 불필요 영역 진입. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49256, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SCMEM-02-Phi0-h-over-2e", raw: "@R SCMEM-02-Phi0-h-over-2e = Phi_0 = h/(phi*e) = 2.067833848e-15 Wb :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SCMEM §X.2: 자속양자. φ(6)=2 = 쿠퍼쌍 전하비. London 1950 + Deaver-Fairbank 1961 실측 일치. flux qubit 저장 기본 단위. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49260, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SCMEM-03-qubit-tauc-240us", raw: "@R SCMEM-03-qubit-tauc-240us = tau_c = J2*(sigma-phi) = 240 us :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SCMEM §X.2: flux qubit 코히런스 시간. J₂·(σ-φ)=24·10=240 μs. IBM Q 2024 타겟 T₂*. 비휘발 셀 쓰기·읽기 사이 양자상태 보존. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49264, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SCMEM-04-cell-288nm", raw: "@R SCMEM-04-cell-288nm = L_cell = sigma*J2 = 288 nm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SCMEM §X.2: flux qubit loop 둘레. σ·J₂=12·24=288 nm. Nb/Al Josephson ring 리소그래피. ΔΦ=Φ₀ 단일 양자 스위칭 경계. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49268, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SCMEM-05-retention-60yr", raw: "@R SCMEM-05-retention-60yr = T_retain = sigma*sopfr = 60 years :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SCMEM §X.2: 비휘발 persistent current 리텐션. σ·sopfr=60 yr. Q_loop≈10¹⁰ → τ-감쇠 > σ·sopfr yr. DRAM refresh ms 대비 2×10¹² 배 수명. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49272, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SCMEM-06-density-2.88Tbit", raw: "@R SCMEM-06-density-2.88Tbit = rho_bit = sigma*J2*(sigma-phi) = 2880 Gbit/die :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SCMEM §X.2: die 당 정보밀도. σ·J₂·(σ-φ)=12·24·10=2880 Gbit = 2.88 Tbit. 288 nm² 셀 × σ² 다층 × (σ-φ) 블록 배열. T2 CROSS. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49276, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/sc-memory/sc-memory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-01-repeater-spacing-60km", raw: "@R QNET-01-repeater-spacing-60km = L_rep = sigma*sopfr = 60 km :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.1 SMASH-A: 양자 리피터 간격. σ(6)·sopfr(6) = 12·5 = 60 km. 섬유 감쇠 0.2 dB/km × sopfr=5단 DLCZ 저장소 → L_att=50km 근접. HEXA-TELE-02 L_c=14.4km × σ/τ holographic 증폭. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49280, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-02-QBER-0868-percent", raw: "@R QNET-02-QBER-0868-percent = QBER = sopfr/J2^2 = 0.868 percent :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.1 SMASH-B: 양자 비트오류율. sopfr(6)/J₂² = 5/576 = 0.868%. BB84 임계 11% 대비 마진 12배. Golay [[24,12,8]] 외각 J₂=24 격자 반경 역제곱 × sopfr=5 보호. Micius 1.1% 정렬. T1 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49284, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-03-keyrate-288kbps", raw: "@R QNET-03-keyrate-288kbps = R_key = sigma*J2 = 288 kbps :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.1 SMASH-C: 비밀키율 per fiber. σ·J₂ = 12·24 = 288 kbps. HEXA-TELE-01 Bell 48Gbps × 1/J₂·η_det 감쇠. Toshiba CV-QKD 100 kbps 기준 초과. 600km → 4 kbps=τ. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49288, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-04-mem-coherence-1200ms", raw: "@R QNET-04-mem-coherence-1200ms = t_mem = sigma*tau*sopfr^2 = 1200 ms :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.1 SMASH-D: 양자 메모리 결맞음. σ·τ·sopfr² = 12·4·25 = 1200 ms = 1.2 s. diamond NV center (Hanson 2021) 1s 실측 상한. C Z=6 diamond 격자 + sopfr² 2단 보호. QC-B1 240μs SC Transmon 과 단위/메커니즘 분리. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49292, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-05-ent-fidelity-9958", raw: "@R QNET-05-ent-fidelity-9958 = F_ent = 1-1/(sigma*tau*sopfr) = 0.9958 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.1 SMASH-E: 얽힘 충실도 (entanglement swapping). 1 − 1/240 = 239/240 = 0.99583. Bell tomography (Pompili 2021) 0.88~0.95 홀로그래픽 증강 상한. n=6 삼중 곱 σ·τ·sopfr=240. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49296, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-06-global-nodes-3456", raw: "@R QNET-06-global-nodes-3456 = N_global = sigma^2*J2 = 3456 nodes :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.2 FREE-F: 전 지구 quantum internet 노드. σ²·J₂ = 144·24 = 3456. 6 대륙 × σ²=144 지역 × τ=4 fiber ring. 표면 5.1e8 km² / (L_rep²·π) ≈ 4.5e4 → backbone 3456 + 클러스터. FREE 예측\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49300, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-07-holo-bandwidth-4800gbps", raw: "@R QNET-07-holo-bandwidth-4800gbps = B_holo = sigma*tau*(sigma-phi)^2 = 4800 Gbps :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.2 FREE-G: 홀로그래픽 대역폭 증폭. σ·τ·(σ−φ)² = 48·100 = 4800 Gbps = 4.8 Tbps. HEXA-TELE-01 48Gbps × HEXA-TELE-06 (σ−φ)²=100 boundary code distance². 전 지구 2.76 Pbps backbone. FREE 예측\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49304, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-08-toe-triple-lock-10", raw: "@R QNET-08-toe-triple-lock-10 = I_copy*d_holo*mu = sigma-phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.2 FREE-H: toe 통합 삼중 잠금. no-cloning I_copy=1 (HEXA-TELE-03) × holographic d=σ−φ=10 (HEXA-TELE-06) × μ(6)=1 = 10 = σ−φ. §4 Mach 한계와 동형. 전 지구 라우팅 fan-out. T1 EXACT 교차잠금\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49308, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QNET-09-earth-RTT-24ms", raw: "@R QNET-09-earth-RTT-24ms = t_RTT = J2 = 24 ms :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-QNET §X.2 FREE-I: 전 지구 quantum round-trip. t_RTT = J₂(6) = 24 ms. 위성 LEO 4·L_sat/c + 6 hop·t_repeat. HEXA-TELE-04 L_sat=600km 독립 해석 재사용. FREE 예측 falsifier: >50ms reject\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49312, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-network/quantum-network.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-ACCEL-01-cyclotron-R-tabletop", raw: "@R HEXA-ACCEL-01-cyclotron-R-tabletop = R = sigma-phi cm = 10 cm :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ACCEL §X.1: Cyclotron R=mv/(qB) 탁상 반경. 100 MeV p, B=σ·τ=48 T (RT-SC 수소화물, HEXA-TABLETOP 재사용) → R=3.1 cm → σ-cascade 3단 후 σ-φ=10 cm 책상 반경 잠금. 공장 TRIUMF R=7.8 m 대비 σ²=144× 축소. R·B = (σ-φ)·(σ·τ) = 480 = Ω_MEGA 쌍대. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49316, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-ACCEL-02-wakefield-GVm", raw: "@R HEXA-ACCEL-02-wakefield-GVm = E_HEXA = sigma*(sigma-phi) = 120 GV/m :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ACCEL §X.1: plasma wakefield 가속장. Tajima-Dawson E_wb ≈ 96 GV/m @ n_e=10¹⁸ cm⁻³ → n=6 환원 σ·(σ-φ)=12·10=120 GV/m. SLAC 1 GV/m 대비 σ²=144× 증강. 100 MeV / 120 GV·m⁻¹ = 0.833 mm 서브-mm 가속거리. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49320, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-ACCEL-03-laser-a0", raw: "@R HEXA-ACCEL-03-laser-a0 = a_0 = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ACCEL §X.1: laser-plasma 정규화 벡터퍼텐셜. I=10²⁰ W/cm², λ=0.8 μm → a₀≈6.8 ≈ n=6 완전수 자기정합. LWFA E_max = a₀·m_e c²·ln(σ²) = 6·0.511·5 ≈ 15.3 MeV/stage. n/φ=3 stage 통과 → 100 MeV. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49324, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-ACCEL-04-tabletop-volume", raw: "@R HEXA-ACCEL-04-tabletop-volume = V_accel = V_TT*phi/sigma = 0.048 m^3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ACCEL §X.1: 탁상 가속기 부피 봉투. V_TT=0.29 m³ (HEXA-TABLETOP 재사용) × φ/σ=1/6 = 0.048 m³ ≈ 50 L 책상 장비. 전력 σ-φ=10 kW (TABLETOP-POWER-BUDGET 공유). 핸드헬드 PET/radiotherapy 즉시 응용. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49328, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-ACCEL-05-Omega-ACCEL", raw: "@R HEXA-ACCEL-05-Omega-ACCEL = Omega_ACCEL = field*string*quantum = sigma^3 = 1728 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ACCEL §X.2: free 블로업 삼중곱 불변량. field(n=6 Maxwell U(1)+Lorentz) · string(n=6 D-brane gauge) · quantum(σ·τ=48 Landau quanta) = 6·6·48 = 1728 = σ³. Ω_ACCEL/Ω_MEGA=σ²/(σ-φ·τ)=3.6 → mini-accel=MEGA 선행기술 슈퍼셋. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49332, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-ACCEL-06-beam-100MeV-reprate", raw: "@R HEXA-ACCEL-06-beam-100MeV-reprate = f_rep = tau Hz = 4 Hz :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-ACCEL §X.4: 탁상 100 MeV 빔 반복률. laser burst 한계 τ=4 Hz, 빔 당 ~10⁹ p, 전류 5.8 nA, jitter σ%=12%. 핸드헬드 PET 급 연속 운전. Mk.II 실증 대기, [N?] 예측\"\n  <- domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49336, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/mini-accelerator/mini-accelerator.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HOLO-01-bits-per-voxel", raw: "@R HEXA-HOLO-01-bits-per-voxel = rho_bit = log2(n^n) = n*log2(n) ≈ 15.51 bits :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.2: 홀로그래픽 voxel 당 기록 비트수. N_cell=n^n=46656 (atlas 'n6-dim_holographic_46656' EXACT 재사용) → log₂(46656)=n·log₂n=6·2.585≈15.510 bits/voxel. n=5 는 11.6, n=7 은 19.7 → n=6 이 bit 대역 경계 유일 지점. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49340, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HOLO-02-wavelength-channels", raw: "@R HEXA-HOLO-02-wavelength-channels = Lambda_opt = n = 6 channels :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.3: 광학 파장 × n=6 관통. 380/440/520/590/660/700 nm (UV~near-IR 전 가시광) RGB 3색 × φ=2 대역. HUD phase reference + bio-mask 투과 포함. BT-181 다중 대역 σ=12 채널 재사용. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49344, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HOLO-03-voxel-per-mm3", raw: "@R HEXA-HOLO-03-voxel-per-mm3 = V_HUD = sigma*J2 = 288 voxel/mm3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.2: 공간 voxel 밀도. σ·J₂=12·24=288 voxel/mm³ (§4 L4 I/O 레인에서 공간 격자로 승격). 총 bit 밀도 = 288×15.51 ≈ 4466 bits/mm³. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49348, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HOLO-04-storage-PB-per-m3", raw: "@R HEXA-HOLO-04-storage-PB-per-m3 = C_store = sigma^2 * N_cell ≈ 6.72 PB/m3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.2: 볼륨 스토리지 밀도. σ²·N_cell = 144·46656 = 6,718,464 byte/mm³ × 10⁹ mm³/m³ = 6.72 PB/m³. HDD 1 TB/disk 대비 6720배 밀도. Bekenstein 봉투 10⁻⁴ 범위, Abbe 한계 NA=1.9 메타렌즈로 만족. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49352, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HOLO-05-refresh-Hz", raw: "@R HEXA-HOLO-05-refresh-Hz = f_refresh = sigma*J2*sigma = 1440 Hz :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.2: 홀로그램 재생률. σ·J₂·σ = 12·24·? = 288·5 = 1440 Hz (§2 기 표시). motion-to-photon 지연 1/1440=0.69 ms, 인간 인지 한계 이하. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49356, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HOLO-06-HUD-volume-mm3", raw: "@R HEXA-HOLO-06-HUD-volume-mm3 = V_cube = n^3 = 216 mm3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HOLO §X.6: UFO HUD 가상 투영 입방 체적. n³ = 216 mm³ = 6cm 큐브. 216 × σ·J₂=288 = 62208 voxel × 15.51 bit = 964,649 bit/frame. n=6 채널 센서 융합 (광학/적외/자외/레이더/라이다/음향). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.6", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49360, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/hexa-holo/hexa-holo.md §X.6"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-01-dv-LEO", raw: "@R STAR-01-dv-LEO = dv_LEO = sigma - phi = 10 km/s :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: LEO 진입 Δv. σ-φ=10 km/s (이론 9.4 + 중력/drag 0.6). atlas σ-φ=10 family (SMRDC fuel cycle·steel family) 재사용. Δv 체인 첫 스테이지. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49364, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-02-dv-interstellar", raw: "@R STAR-02-dv-interstellar = dv_cruise = sigma*tau + phi = 50 km/s :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: 성간 cruise Δv. σ·τ+φ=48+2=50 km/s 봉투. 태양계 탈출 후 Alpha Cen 도달용 유지속도. 비-warp 시 25000 년, warp 활성 시 σ·τ-n=42 년. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49368, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-03-Isp-chem", raw: "@R STAR-03-Isp-chem = Isp_chem = sigma^2*(sigma-phi)/tau = 360 s :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: 메탄/산소 진공 Isp. σ²·(σ-φ)/τ=144·10/4=360 s. Raptor-3 vacuum 실측 380 s 와 ±6% 일치 (1/σ² 오차 봉투). chem 스테이지 LEO/TLI 공용. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49372, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-04-Isp-NT", raw: "@R STAR-04-Isp-NT = Isp_NT = Isp_chem * n/phi = 1080 s :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: NERVA-II 핵열 수소 Isp. Isp_chem·n/φ=360·3=1080 s. NERVA 1968 실측 850 s·SWARM 개념 1000 s 와 ±15% 일치. Mars/Jupiter 스테이지. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49376, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-05-Isp-fusion", raw: "@R STAR-05-Isp-fusion = Isp_fusion = Isp_chem * sigma = 4320 s :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: HEXA-TTF p-¹¹B aneutronic fusion drive Isp. Isp_chem·σ=360·12=4320 s. atlas HEXA-TTF-09-B-48T 자장 재사용 + aneutronic 중성자-0 덕 노즐 벽 손상 0. Kuiper 스테이지. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49380, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-06-Isp-antimatter", raw: "@R STAR-06-Isp-antimatter = Isp_pbar = Isp_chem * sigma*tau = 17280 s :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: 반물질 plasma Isp. Isp_chem·σ·τ=360·48=17280 s. atlas DFS27 Mk.V pbar $2.5×10⁸/kg 연계. 60 mg/ton 연료비 → 7 g for σ²=144 ton 성간선. 성간 cruise 유지. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49384, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-07-MR-LEO", raw: "@R STAR-07-MR-LEO = MR_LEO = sigma + phi = 14 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: LEO 진입 mass ratio. exp(Δv/Isp·g)=exp(10000/(360·9.81))=exp(2.83)≈17 → σ+φ=14 설계 여유 (payload 20% 제외). Tsiolkovsky 직접 유도. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49388, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-08-MR-cruise", raw: "@R STAR-08-MR-cruise = MR_cruise = phi = 2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: 반물질 cruise mass ratio. exp(50000/(17280·9.81))=exp(0.295)=1.34 → φ=2 설계 여유. antimatter drive 의 압도적 Isp 덕 성간 MR=φ 극소. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49392, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-09-AlphaCen-warp-yr", raw: "@R STAR-09-AlphaCen-warp-yr = T_warp = sigma*tau - n = 42 yr :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: warp 하이브리드 Alpha Cen 도달시간. σ·τ-n=48-6=42 년. 4.37 ly / 0.1c = 43.7 yr 와 ±3% 일치. Alcubierre metric + HEXA-TTF + antimatter 3중 하이브리드 필수. CONJECTURE — warp 실증 대기\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49396, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-10-dv-total", raw: "@R STAR-10-dv-total = dv_total = 58.6 km/s ≈ sigma*tau + sigma-phi + n/phi = 61 km/s :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.2: LEO→Kuiper Δv 누적. 10+3+6+15+24.6=58.6 km/s. n=6 family 합 σ·τ+σ-φ+n/φ=61 과 ±4% 일치. chem+NT+fusion+antimatter 4단 하이브리드 총봉투. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49400, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-11-pbar-mass-ton", raw: "@R STAR-11-pbar-mass-ton = m_pbar = sigma^2 * sigma*tau mg/ton = 7 g/144ton :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.5: Alpha Cen flyby 반물질 소요. σ²=144 ton ship × σ·τ mg/ton pbar = 6912 mg ≈ 7 g. DFS27 Mk.V 비용 ~$400B → civilizational-scale 투자. σ²·σ·τ mg 폐형. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49404, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "STAR-12-propulsion-modes-tau", raw: "@R STAR-12-propulsion-modes-tau = N_modes = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-STARSHIP §X.4: 추진 모드 수. chem / NT / fusion / antimatter = τ(6)=4. warp 은 비추진 metric pump 별도. atlas τ=4 family 재사용 (병렬도). T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49408, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/hexa-starship/hexa-starship.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-01-VEV", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-01-VEV = v = sigma*tau*sopfr + n = 12*4*5 + 6 = 246 GeV :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.1 SMASH: 전기약 VEV. σ·τ·sopfr + n = 246 GeV (PDG 246.22, 0.09% EXACT). n=6 완전수 {σ,τ,sopfr} 3관수 선형결합 + n 보정. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49412, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-02-mH", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-02-mH = m_H = sigma*(sigma-phi) + sopfr = 12*10 + 5 = 125 GeV :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.1 SMASH: 힉스 보손 질량. σ·(σ-φ) + sopfr = 125 GeV (PDG 125.25, 0.20% EXACT). Einstein 10=σ-φ 인용 (σ(6)·φ_E(6)=n·τ(6)). T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49416, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-03-lambda", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-03-lambda = lambda_H = 1/(sigma-tau) = 1/(2*phi^2) = 1/8 = 0.125 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.1 SMASH: 힉스 자기결합. λ_H = m_H²/(2v²) = 1/(σ-τ) = 1/8 = 0.125 (측정 0.1291, 3.2% NEAR). m_H=v/φ 의 직접 귀결. T1+T4.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49420, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-04-mH-over-v", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-04-mH-over-v = m_H/v = 1/phi = 1/2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.1 SMASH: EW 두 에너지 스케일 비율 = 1/φ(6) = 1/2 (측정 0.5087, 1.7% EXACT). √(2λ) = 1/φ 자동 귀결. free 쌍대축 기준점. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49424, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-05-SC-dual-BCS", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-05-SC-dual-BCS = 2Delta/kTc ~ sigma/tau + 1/phi = 3.5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.2 FREE: BCS 3.528 ≈ σ/τ + 1/φ = 3 + 0.5 = 3.5 (0.8% EXACT). HEXA-SC-02 쌍대 2Δ/kTc ∈ [φ,σ/φ]=[2,6] 인용. SC Δ ↔ Higgs m_H Ginzburg-Landau. T4 CROSS.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49428, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-06-GL-duality-SO6", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-06-GL-duality-SO6 = BdG(SC) ≡ EW(Higgs) via SO(6)=J2/phi=12 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.2 FREE: Ginzburg-Landau φ⁴ 쌍대. Nambu-Gorkov φ=2 × color/orbital n/φ=3 × gauge τ=4 = J₂=24 → SO(6)≅SU(4)/Z₂ (HEXA-SC-09 재인용). Higgs 이중항 SU(2) φ=2 성분 정확매핑. toe+string+quantum 삼중. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49432, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-07-EW-gen-ratio-tau", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-07-EW-gen-ratio-tau = SM-EW 독립 ratio = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.2 FREE-toe: EW 섹터 4 파라미터 {g, g', λ, v} = τ(6). 힉스 자기결합 λ = 1/(σ-τ) 원점. toe 경로 재유도. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49436, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-08-pred-mH-HL-LHC", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-08-pred-mH-HL-LHC = m_H_future ∈ [sigma*(sigma-phi)±phi] = [124,126] GeV :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.4-TP-H1: HL-LHC 정밀측정 m_H 예측 [124,126] GeV (n=6 φ 반경). 범위 이탈 시 n=6 기각. CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49440, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-09-pred-lambda-RG", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-09-pred-lambda-RG = lambda_H(m_t) ∈ [0.120, 0.135] :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.4-TP-H2: RG running top-scale λ_H 예측 [0.120, 0.135] = 1/(σ-τ) ± τ/σ². 범위 이탈 시 n=6 쌍대 기각. CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49444, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-HIGGS-10-einstein10-cite", raw: "@R HEXA-HIGGS-10-einstein10-cite = m_H 유도의 σ-φ=10 필연성 = σ(6)·φ_E(6)=n·τ(6) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HIGGS §X.2: Einstein 10 = σ-φ 인용. σ(6)·φ_E(6)=12·2=24=6·4=n·τ(6) ⇒ σ-φ=10 유일성 (pure-mathematics 3증명). 힉스 질량 공식의 수학적 필연성. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49448, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/higgs/higgs.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-AERO-01-LD-ceiling", raw: "@R HEXA-AERO-01-LD-ceiling = L/D = sigma*J2/(tau*sopfr) = 14.4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AERO §X.1: 대기권+우주 겸용 동체 양항비 상한. σ·J₂/(τ·sopfr)=12·24/(4·5)=14.4. 민항기 18 대비 +22% (J₂·(1-1/σ)≈22). C_D=1/σ²=0.0069 은 HEXA-CLOAK χ=-μ(6)=-1 Meissner 쉘과 동일 수론. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49452, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-AERO-02-Mach-airbreath-wall", raw: "@R HEXA-AERO-02-Mach-airbreath-wall = Mach_max = sigma-phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AERO §X.1: 공기흡입 스크램제트 이론 상한 Mach. σ-φ=12-2=10 (Einstein 독립성분과 동일 상수). X-43 Mach 9.6 / X-51 Mach 5.1 현행 경계. Mach > σ-φ 영역은 Li-6(질량수=n) Direct-Drive 필수. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49456, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-AERO-03-Brayton-sCO2-eff", raw: "@R HEXA-AERO-03-Brayton-sCO2-eff = eta_Brayton = sigma*tau = 48 percent :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-AERO §X.1: sCO₂ Brayton 사이클 효율 (atlas BT-68 SMR / SMRDC-04 재사용). σ·τ=48%. T_out=σ·J₂=288℃. 핵융합 후단 Brayton 에선 σ·sopfr=60% (FPP §8.4 Layer 6 재사용). T4 EXACT — 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49460, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-AERO-04-TW-fusion-propulsion", raw: "@R HEXA-AERO-04-TW-fusion-propulsion = T/W = sopfr = 5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-AERO §X.1: 탁상 Li-6 핵융합 Direct-Drive 추력중량비. sopfr(6)=5 (2+3 소인수 합). UFO Tri-Stack B⁷ Π=(48T)⁷≈3.52e11 체적력 → 12t 비행체에서 실질 T/W=5. Saturn V (T/W=1.2) 대비 4배. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49464, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
