    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-AERO-06-ratio-AERO-UFO", raw: "@R HEXA-AERO-06-ratio-AERO-UFO = PI_AERO/PI_UFO(B=48) = 1/n^8 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-AERO §X.2: 항공우주-UFO 사영비. 1920/(48)⁷≈5.45e-9 ≈ 1/n⁸ = 1/6⁸ = 1/1679616. 항공우주체는 UFO Tri-Stack B⁷ 의 민수 스케일 1/n⁸ 사영. B^(7-n-2)=B^(-1) 저자장 한계. UFO-TRI-STACK-B7-SCALING 쌍대. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49472, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace/aerospace.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
