    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CHIPSC-B3-flux-quantum-n6", raw: "@R HEXA-CHIPSC-B3-flux-quantum-n6 = Φ_trap = n·Φ₀ = 1.2407e-14 Wb :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPSC §X.1 SMASH-C: Φ₀=h/(2e)=2.0678e-15 Wb SI 고정. 분모 2=φ(6) 재인용 (atlas 9682/10365). ring 트랩 vortices N_v=n=6 → Φ_trap=n·Φ₀. SQUID ΔΦ~Φ₀/J₂=8.6e-17 Wb. SFQ bit=1Φ₀. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49488, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
