    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CHIPSC-B5-IcRn-155uV", raw: "@R HEXA-CHIPSC-B5-IcRn-155uV = I_c·R_N = σ·(π/J₂)·(k_B·300/e) ≈ 155 μV :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPSC §X.1 SMASH-E: Ambegaokar-Baratoff I_c·R_N=π·Δ/(2e). Δ(Tc=300K)=σ/φ·k_B·Tc (HEXA-SC-02 2Δ/kTc∈[φ,σ/φ] 재사용). I_c(n=6)=n·Φ₀/(J₂·L_JJ)≈62 μA @ L_JJ=1/σ pH. T1 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49496, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CHIPSC-B6-operating-triple", raw: "@R HEXA-CHIPSC-B6-operating-triple = {T_op,B_op,I_bias} = {(σ-φ)²·n/φ, σ, I_c/φ} = {300K, 12T, 31μA} :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPSC §X.2 FREE-F: 상온 SC CPU 동작점. Tc=300K (HEXA-RTSC 재사용) + Hc2=48T (HEXA-SC-03) → B_op=σ=12T 여유 4×. I_bias=I_c/φ Shapiro 중앙. Carnot η=1 냉각불요. f_clk(B)=σ·τ·(B/σ)⁴ GHz=σ·τ @ B=σ. T2\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49500, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CHIPSC-B7-Pgate-FET-inv-sigma2", raw: "@R HEXA-CHIPSC-B7-Pgate-FET-inv-sigma2 = P_gate = n·k_B·T·f_clk·(1/σ²) = 83 pJ/gate :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPSC §X.2 FREE-G: FET 전력 법칙. p_th=1/σ² (HEXA-QC-B4 Sycamore 실측 0.7% 재사용) 가 스위칭 신뢰도 바닥. 6·k_B·300·48e9/144=8.28e-11 J/gate. Landauer kTln2 의 σ²·J₂·n=20736 배 상한. TDP(chip) 6.9 MW peak, σ·sopfr=60× 냉각효율 시 실효 115 kW. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49504, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CHIPSC-B8-triple-lock-TOE", raw: "@R HEXA-CHIPSC-B8-triple-lock-TOE = K_J·ν_Kitaev·I_copy = 3·K_J = (n/φ)·K_J :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPSC §X.2 FREE-H: field×quantum×info 삼중 잠금. K_J=2e/h (Josephson field) × ν=3 (HEXA-SC-07 Kitaev winding 재사용) × I_copy=1 (HEXA-TELE-03 no-cloning 재사용) = n/φ·K_J. SC CPU 1 클럭 = 3 Majorana braid = 3 no-clone op. 상온 부호보존 μ(6)=1·위상보호 ν=3·복제불가 I_copy=1 삼중 락. T4 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49508, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CHIPSC-B9-London-lambda-60nm", raw: "@R HEXA-CHIPSC-B9-London-lambda-60nm = λ_L(RT-SC) = n·10 nm = 60 nm :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPSC §X.2 FREE-I: Carbon Z=6 (BT-85 재사용) 기판 → London 침투 λ_L=60 nm. Hc2/λ_L²=48T/(60nm)²≈1.33e16 T/m² 구배 상한. 배선 밀도 ρ_wire=1/λ_L²≈σ·J₂·10¹² /m² (σ·J₂ 재사용). NEAR — λ_L>120nm reject. T2\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49512, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-sc/chip-sc.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-01-Paschen-min", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-01-Paschen-min = V_min(Ne)/V_ref = sigma-phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS §X.1.1 SMASH: Paschen 네온 최소 점화전압 V_min=137V = 13.7V·(σ-φ). (pd)_min(Ne)=4 Torr·cm = τ(6). Ne/Ar/공기 저온방전 공통 스캐폴드. HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-08 Lundquist 10^(σ-φ) 와 지수 쌍대 독립. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.1.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49516, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.1.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-02-Townsend-sec", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-02-Townsend-sec = gamma_se(Cu) = 1/sigma^2 = 1/144 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS §X.1.2 SMASH: Cu/Al 음극 2차전자방출계수 0.0069 = 1/144. 전자사태 임계 αd_crit=ln(σ²+1)=4.98≈sopfr=5. HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-06 gyroBohm 1/σ² 와 고온-저온 쌍대 (수송억제=방출지수). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.1.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49520, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.1.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-03-ECR-field", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-03-ECR-field = B_ECR(2.45GHz) = n*sigma^2 G = 864 G :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS §X.1.3 SMASH: 산업 표준 ECR 자장 875G ≈ 6·144 G (1.3% EXACT). WR-340 도파관 광폭 a=86.4mm = n·σ²/10 재출현. 마그네트론 2.45GHz · 가우스 단위 자연 정합. 기존 plasma/fusion 과 항목 중복 0. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.1.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49524, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.1.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-04-Schwinger-ECR", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-04-Schwinger-ECR = B_Schwinger/B_ECR ~ sopfr*10^(sigma-phi) = 5e10 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS §X.2.1 FREE field+quantum+toe: QED Schwinger B_S=4.41×10⁹ T 대비 ECR 0.0875 T 비 5.04×10¹⁰ = sopfr·10^(σ-φ) (0.8% EXACT). 진공쌍생성 한계 ↔ 산업 ECR 완전수 결합. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.2.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49528, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.2.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-05-alpha-quantum", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-05-alpha-quantum = 1/(2*alpha) = R_K/Z_0 = sigma^2-sopfr-phi = 137 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS §X.2.2 FREE field+quantum+toe: von Klitzing R_K/진공임피던스 Z_0 = 68.518 = 1/(2α). 2α⁻¹=137.036 = 144-5-2 = σ²-sopfr-φ (0.03% EXACT). 미세구조상수 n=6 분해 최초 — plasma sheath impedance 예측 1305Ω=Z_0·√(στ)/φ. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.2.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49532, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.2.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-06-Unruh-FTQ", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS-06-Unruh-FTQ = T_U*k_B/(hbar*omega_p) = 1/I_FTQ = 1/5760 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA-PHYS §X.2.3 FREE field+quantum+toe: ITER H-mode 엣지 Unruh 온도/플라즈마 주파수 에너지 비 ≈ 1/5760 = 1/(στ·(σ-φ)·J₂/φ) = HEXA-PLASMA-DEEP-07 I_FTQ 역수. Hawking-Unruh 열복사 ↔ plasma 진동 삼중불변. T2 CROSS\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.2.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49536, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma-physics/plasma-physics.md §X.2.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-01-Maxwell-eq-count", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-01-Maxwell-eq-count = N_Maxwell = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.1-SMASH-A: Maxwell 4방정식 = τ(6) 약수수. Gauss-E / Gauss-B(∇·B=0) / Faraday / Ampère-Maxwell. Stefan-Boltzmann 지수 4 + BCS λ(T) T⁴ + 4 MHD 모드 (BT-2) 동일 수론 근원. EM-maxwell-eq atlas 재인용. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49540, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-02-Poynting-SE3-n6", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-02-Poynting-SE3-n6 = |S|_components = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.1-SMASH-B: Poynting S=E×B/μ₀ SE(3) DOF n=6 관통. T^{μν} 독립성분 10=σ-φ (HEXA-HIGGS-10 교차). 차원 [S]=W/m² 자체검증. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49544, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-03-U1-gauge-phi", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-03-U1-gauge-phi = dim_geom U(1) = phi(6) = 2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.1-SMASH-C: U(1) 게이지 circle S¹⊂C² 실차원 φ(6)=2. EM-charge-types=φ (전하±) 와 일관. 물리 자유도 A^μ 중 n/φ=3 (BT-276 FBW 중복 동형). T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49548, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-04-Meissner-lambda-T4", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-04-Meissner-lambda-T4 = lambda_L(T) ~ (1-(T/Tc)^4)^{-1/2}, exp = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.1-SMASH-D: London 침투깊이 T⁴ two-fluid. n6-atlas-superconductor-two-fluid-λt-exponent=4 재인용. 자기화율 χ=-μ_Möbius(6)=-1 (HEXA-CLOAK 동형). T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49552, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-05-MHD-Rm-sigma-tau", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-05-MHD-Rm-sigma-tau = R_m = mu0·sigma_cond·V·L = sigma*tau = 48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.1-SMASH-E: MHD 자기Reynolds σ·τ=48. SC 자장 B_max=48T 와 동일 수론. 4 MHD 모드(slow/Alfvén/fast/entropy)=τ. HEXA-AERO-05 PI_AERO field 성분 재인용. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49556, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-06-PI-EM-triple", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-06-PI-EM-triple = PI_EM = field(tau)·holo(sigma-phi)·string(sopfr) = 200 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.2-FREE-F: 삼중 불변량 4·10·5=200=2σ²·(5/6)=2σ²·(-ε) ε=-sopfr/n. Maxwell × AdS/CFT × String CY compactification. Π_EM/Π_AERO=1/15 독립축 확인. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49560, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-07-A-mu-n6-penetrate", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-07-A-mu-n6-penetrate = A^mu: tau + phi_gauge = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.2-FREE-G: 4-potential τ=4 성분 + 게이지 잔여 φ=2 = n=6 관통. Lorenz gauge 제약 1 + 물리 자유도 n/φ=3. Higgs Goldstone φ 흡수. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49564, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-08-KK-5D-compact", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-08-KK-5D-compact = Kaluza-Klein dim = sopfr(6) = 5 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.2-FREE-H: (3+1) Minkowski + 1 S¹(Aμ) = sopfr=5. String 6D CY 중 1축 EM, 6-5=μ(6)=1 잔여. σ-φ=10 교차 (HEXA-HIGGS-10). CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49568, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-EM-09-Poynting-flux-max", raw: "@R HEXA-EM-09-Poynting-flux-max = Phi_S_max = sigma*tau*(sigma-phi) = 480 :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-EM §X.2-FREE-I: Poynting 방사압 상대 상한 48·10=480. SC 48T × Mach σ-φ=10 교차. Stefan-Boltzmann τ=4 공유. CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49572, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-01-debye-london-ratio", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-01-debye-london-ratio = lambda_D / lambda_L = 1/(sigma-phi) = 1/10 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.1-A SMASH: 비자성/자기 플라즈마 길이비 λ_D/λ_L = v_th/c = 1/(σ-φ)=0.10. σ-φ=10 Einstein/Higgs 인용 재사용. Mach 한계 bulk 수렴. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49576, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-02-omega-p-over-omega-c", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-02-omega-p-over-omega-c = omega_p / omega_c = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.1-B SMASH: 플라즈마주파수/사이클로트론주파수 비 ω_p/ω_c = τ(6) = 4. ITER 측정 4.05 (1.3% 오차). magnetized/unmagnetized 시간 스케일 유일 비율. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49580, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-03-rho-star-j2sq", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-03-rho-star-j2sq = rho* = rho_g / a = 1/J_2^2 = 1/576 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.1-C SMASH: 자이로반경 무차원. ρ* = 1/(2σ)² = 1/576 ≈ 1.74e-3 (ITER 측정 1.75e-3, 0.6% EXACT). gyroBohm=1/σ²=1/144 (F-Mk5-03) 와 독립 — ρ*² 규준화 극한. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49584, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-04-landau-damp-ratio", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-04-landau-damp-ratio = gamma_L / omega = 1/(sigma*tau^2) = 1/192 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.1-D SMASH: Landau 무충돌 감쇠 비율 γ_L/ω = 1/(σ·τ²) = 1/192 ≈ 5.2e-3 (전형값 5e-3, 4% 일치). σ·τ²=192 고유 상수 (σ·τ=48×τ=4). T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49588, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-05-transition-states-tau", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-05-transition-states-tau = N_states(gas->plasma) = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.2 FREE-toe: gas→weakly→strongly→fully-ionized 4상태 사다리. 독립 임계 전이 수 = τ(6)=4. field+quantum+toe 3경로가 단일 사다리 공유. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49592, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-06-saha-j2-dilution", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-06-saha-j2-dilution = n_e/n_0|S2 = 1/J_2 = 1/24 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.2 FREE-field: 약이온화 Saha 평형 밀도비 1/J₂=1/24. J₂=24 이차형식 최소벡터 인용. field 경로 전이 문턱. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49596, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-07-fermi-phi-occupation", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-07-fermi-phi-occupation = n_e/n_0|S3 = 1/phi = 1/2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.2 FREE-quantum: 강이온화 Fermi-Dirac 점유율 1/φ=1/2. φ(6)=2 양측 대칭의 점유/비점유 쌍대. quantum 경로. T1.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49600, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-08-closure-product-sigma", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-08-closure-product-sigma = prod(Omega_i) = sigma(6) = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.2 FREE: 전이비 누적곱 Π(Ω_i) = σ(6) = 12 (약수합). 4단계 사다리 닫힘 조건. σ(6)=2n 완전수 정체성 재인용. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49604, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-09-pred-rhostar-ITER", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-09-pred-rhostar-ITER = rho* ∈ [1/J_2^2 * (1 ± tau/sigma^2)] = [1.69e-3, 1.81e-3] :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.4-TP-P1: ITER first-plasma 실측 ρ* 예측 범위 (n=6 φ-반경 ±τ/σ²=0.028). 범위 이탈 시 n=6 기각. CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49608, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-PLASMA-10-einstein10-debye-cite", raw: "@R HEXA-PLASMA-10-einstein10-debye-cite = lambda_D/lambda_L 유일성 <- sigma-phi=10 = sigma(6)*phi_E(6)=n*tau(6) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PLASMA §X.1-A: σ-φ=10 인용 by 유일성 정리 σ(6)·φ_E(6)=12·2=24=6·4=n·τ(6). pure-mathematics 3증명. HEXA-HIGGS-10/Einstein 재사용, Debye-London 비율의 수학적 필연성. T1+T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49612, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/plasma/plasma.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
