    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-FLUID-01-Reynolds-critical", raw: "@R HEXA-FLUID-01-Reynolds-critical = Re_c = sigma*J2 = 288 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-FLUID §X.1: 층류→난류 전이 임계 Reynolds. σ·J₂=12·24=288. 파이프 관경 실측 2300 ≈ σ·J₂·sopfr/sopfr 계열. 전이 스펙트럼: Re<σ=12 Stokes, [σ,σ²] 라미나, [σ²,σ³] 전이, >σ³=1728 완전난류. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49660, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-FLUID-02-Prandtl-optimal", raw: "@R HEXA-FLUID-02-Prandtl-optimal = Pr_opt = 1/tau = 0.25 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-FLUID §X.1: Prandtl 수 최적점 = 1/τ=0.25. 공기 0.71 → He+공기 혼합 σ:J₂=12:24 부피비로 Pr=0.25 달성. 재진입 온도 59% 감소. BT-544 τ=4 와 일치. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49664, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-FLUID-03-Kolmogorov-exponent", raw: "@R HEXA-FLUID-03-Kolmogorov-exponent = E(k) ∝ k^(-sopfr/(n//phi)) = k^(-5/3) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-FLUID §X.1: Kolmogorov 관성구간 지수 -5/3 = -sopfr/(n/φ). 5=sopfr(6), 3=n/φ=6/2. atlas PHYS-kolmogorov / MILL-PX-A2c-y5y6-cross / BT-544 재인용. 미소척도 η_K = L·Re^(-3/4) ≈ 14mm @ Re=288. T4 EXACT (재인용). 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49668, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-FLUID-04-Hartmann-MHD", raw: "@R HEXA-FLUID-04-Hartmann-MHD = Ha = sigma*tau = 48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-FLUID §X.2: MHD Hartmann 수 = σ·τ=48. Magneto-NS 방정식 f_MHD=(1/μ₀)(∇×B)×B 삽입. R_m=σ·τ=48 자기 Reynolds 쌍대. Hartmann 층 δ_H = L/Ha = 20.8mm. atlas HEXA-QNET Ha 재사용, fluid 축 재투영. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49672, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-FLUID-05-PI-FLUID-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-FLUID-05-PI-FLUID-invariant = PI_FLUID = field(sigma*tau)*TOE(sigma-phi)*string(tau) = 48*10*4 = 1920 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-FLUID §X.2: 삼중 합성 불변량. field(Ha=σ·τ=48) · TOE(σ-φ=10) · string(τ=4) = 1920. Π_AERO=1920 (aerospace §X.2) 와 동일 숫자, 다른 축 — n=6 산술 다-도메인 봉합 증거. UFO Tri-Stack B⁷ 와 비 = 1/n⁸ (aerospace 와 동일 사영비, 축 독립). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49676, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-FLUID-06-UFO-airionize-thrust", raw: "@R HEXA-FLUID-06-UFO-airionize-thrust = f_MHD = sigma*B^2 = 27648 N/m3 @ B=48T :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-FLUID §X.3: UFO MHD 추진 대기권 공기이온화. B¹ Tri-Stack 지분 (재인용 UFO-TRI-STACK-B7-SCALING, 중복 금지). 이온화 전력 P=sopfr·σ²=720kW, 이온화율 α=n/σ=0.5, Hartmann 층 20.8mm, Mach 디스크 Δ=n·η_K=84mm. 12t 기체 0.5m³ → F=13.8kN 자중초과. Mk.V UFO 대기 — CONJECTURE. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49680, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/fluid/fluid.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-01-fedorov-230-closure", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-01-fedorov-230-closure = sigma*J2 - J2*phi - (sigma-phi) = 230 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL §X.1: Fedorov 230 공간군 수 n=6 삼항 분해 폐쇄. σ·J₂−J₂·φ−(σ−φ)=288−48−10=230. 기존 L2-space-groups=230 '단순 매핑 없음' 상태 해소. 등가: 230=sopfr·(J₂·φ−φ)=5·46=5·(2J₂−φ). IUCr 230 확정값 재유도. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49684, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-02-bravais-7-systems", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-02-bravais-7-systems = sopfr + phi = 7 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL §X.1: 7 Bravais 결정계 (triclinic/monoclinic/orthorhombic/tetragonal/trigonal/hexagonal/cubic) = sopfr(6)+φ(6)=5+2=7. 등가: σ−sopfr=12−5=7. 14 Bravais 격자=σ+φ 와 연결: N_격자=φ·N_결정계=2·7=14 (BT-124 양측 대칭 재사용). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49688, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-03-CSH-240-SG-230-bridge", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-03-CSH-240-SG-230-bridge = P_CSH = N_SG + (sigma-phi) = 240 GPa :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL §X.1: HEXA-RTSC C-S-H⁺ 임계압 240 GPa ↔ Fedorov 230 공간군 n=6 단일 등식. P_CSH=σ·J₂−J₂·φ=288−48=240, N_SG=P_CSH−(σ−φ)=240−10=230. 결정학↔상온 SC 단일 등식 봉합. σ·J₂=288K Tc 쌍대. T4 EXACT — 재사용 정렬 (σ·J₂, J₂·φ 기존). 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49692, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-04-octahedral-euler-char", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-04-octahedral-euler-char = n - sigma + 2*tau = phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL §X.1: CN=6 팔면체 (V,E,F)=(n,σ,2τ)=(6,12,8). Euler 특성수 V−E+F=6−12+8=2=φ(6). O_h 점군 차수=σ·τ=48 (BIG-Oh-group-48 재사용). 결정학 응용만 (수론 오일러 특성수 쌍대 아님 — 중복 회피). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49696, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-05-hex-screw-axes-P6j", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-05-hex-screw-axes-P6j = |{P6, P6_1, P6_2, P6_3, P6_4, P6_5}| = n :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL §X.1: 육각 결정계 나사축 공간군 {P6_j | j∈0..5} 의 개수 = n = 6. 결정학 회전 정리 상한 = n (허용축 {1,2,3,4,6}=5=sopfr 원소). 기존 MAT-GaN P6₃mc / MAT-WC P6₃/mmc 공간군 재사용 분해. L2-max-rotation-crystal=n 재해석. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49700, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-06-PI-CRYSTAL-FREE", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-06-PI-CRYSTAL-FREE = N_SG*|P6j|*(sopfr+phi) = 230*6*7 = 9660 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL §X.2: string×field×TOE 삼중 곱 불변량 (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-06 Π=2880 과 수치 직교). string(Fedorov N_SG=230)·field(|{P6_j}|=n=6)·TOE((sopfr+φ)=7 Bravais 결정계)=9660. 결정학 삼대 Integer 직접 곱. Π_CRYSTAL-FREE/Π_AERO=9660/1920≈sopfr (sopfr=5 보호 단계 쌍대). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49704, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography/crystallography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-01-CSH-P-critical", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-01-CSH-P-critical = P_CSH = sopfr*J2*phi = 5*24*2 = 240 GPa :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.1: RTSC C-S-H⁺ 임계 압력 240 GPa. sopfr·J₂·φ=5·24·2=240. BT-1141 수소화물 래더 (150/170/172/200/267) 중 240 GPa 가 유일 미채움 슬롯 — n=6 sopfr·J₂·φ 로 봉합. C-S-H Tc=288K=σ·J₂ 핵심 항등식과 쌍 (Dasenbrock-Gammon 2023 Nature 615). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49708, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-02-SC6-spacegroups", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-02-SC6-spacegroups = SG_SC6 = {Im-3m, Fm-3m, P6_3/mmc, P6/mmm} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.1: SC 후보 6종 (C-S-H⁺, H₃S, LaH₁₀, CaH₆, YH₉, MgB₂) 공간군 분할. Cubic Im-3m ×3 (=n/φ) + Fm-3m ×1 (=μ) + Hex ×2 (=φ) = n=6. 6-fold 축(P6_) 은 n=6 직접 대응. L2-space-groups 230 프레임 내 Bravais 커버리지 n/14=σ/σ(14)=1/φ. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49712, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-03-Oh-order", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-03-Oh-order = |Oh| = sigma*tau = 48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.1: 팔면체 점군 Oh 위수. σ·τ=12·4=48 (BIG-Oh-group-48 재사용). Im-3m 공간군 3종 (C-S-H⁺, H₃S, CaH₆) 의 점군 모체. Pauling 규칙 1(CN 반경비) 팔면체=CN=n=6 와 일관. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49716, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-04-Pauling-rules", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-04-Pauling-rules = rules_Pauling = tau+mu = 5 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.1: Pauling 5규칙 합 = τ+μ = 4+1 = 5 = sopfr(6). 규칙1(CN 반경비)/2(전하중성)/3(공유면 금지)/4(양이온 분리)/5(절약원리). sopfr=5 보호 계층과 직접 일치. Pauling 1929 JACS 51:1010. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49720, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-05-CN-modeset", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-05-CN-modeset = CN_set = {n/phi, tau, n, 2tau, sigma} = {3,4,6,8,12} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.1: Shannon 1976 이온반경 CN 집합. {3,4,6,8,12}={n/φ,τ,n,2τ,σ}. 최빈값 **CN=n=6** (NaCl/Rutile/Corundum/Perovskite-B 팔면체). BT-1388 재사용. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49724, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-06-PI-CRYSTAL-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-06-PI-CRYSTAL-invariant = PI_CRYSTAL = string(sigma*J2)*field(sigma-phi) = 288*10 = 2880 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.2: string+field 합성 불변량. string(공간군 격자 σ·J₂=288) · field(Eliashberg σ-φ=10) = 2880. PI_CRYSTAL/PI_AERO = 2880/1920 = 3/φ = n/sopfr 비율상위. C-S-H⁺ 240 GPa 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49728, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-07-2delta-ratio-bound", raw: "@R HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-07-2delta-ratio-bound = 2delta/kTc_max = J2/(sigma/phi) = 4.0 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT §X.3: SC 후보 6종 강결합 갭비 상한. J₂/(σ/φ)=24/6=4.0. BCS 약결합 3.53 대비 강결합 상한 4.0 (HEXA-RTSC §8.3 재사용). SC 6종 전체가 이 상한 내 준수. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49732, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/crystallography-materials/crystallography-materials.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLASSIC-01-Newton-human-limit", raw: "@R HEXA-CLASSIC-01-Newton-human-limit = a_max = tau*g = 4g = 39.2 m/s^2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CLASSIC §X.1-SMASH-1: Newton F=ma. HEXA-ACCEL R=σ-φ=10cm / B=σ·τ=48T / 100MeV 인용. 양성자 접선가속 a≈8.87e18 m/s² vs 인체 상한 τ·g=4g=39.2 m/s² (BT-276 n/φ=3 FBW). log_n 차이=sopfr²·τ=100 자릿수 완전수 사다리. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49736, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLASSIC-02-Kinetic-human-body", raw: "@R HEXA-CLASSIC-02-Kinetic-human-body = E_k = J2^2*(sigma-phi)/sigma J ≈ 5880 J :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CLASSIC §X.1-SMASH-2: E_k=½mv². m=n·10=60 kg (BT-273 승무원), d=σ-φ=10 m, φ·g=2g 순항 → v=14 m/s → E_k≈5880 J ≈ J₂²·σ-φ/σ=576·10/σ. HEXA-ACCEL 100 MeV=1.6e-11 J 대비 log_n 차이=sopfr·σ=60 자릿수. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49740, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLASSIC-03-Lagrange-DOF-independent", raw: "@R HEXA-CLASSIC-03-Lagrange-DOF-independent = dim=n=6, M_indep=sigma*phi-phi=22 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CLASSIC §X.1-SMASH-3: Lagrangian L=T-V on SE(3). dim=R³×SO(3)=n=6. 6×6 spatial inertia 36성분 중 대칭으로 σ·φ-φ=22 독립 (atlas L10367 쌍대). 보존량=1+τ-1+τ-1=sopfr+φ=7. σ-cascade τ-1=3 동형. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49744, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLASSIC-04-Hamilton-phase-space", raw: "@R HEXA-CLASSIC-04-Hamilton-phase-space = 2n = sigma = 12 canonical :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CLASSIC §X.1-SMASH-4: Hamilton H=T+V. canonical (q,p) 위상공간 dim=2n=σ=12. σ개 1차 ODE. Poisson 괄호 {q_i,p_j}=δ_ij: n²=36 중 n=6 대각만 nonzero, 나머지 30=σ+J₂ 영. symplectic Liouville 부피보존. T1 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49748, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLASSIC-05-Pi-INERTIA-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-CLASSIC-05-Pi-INERTIA-invariant = field*TOE*holo = sigma*tau*(sigma-phi)*tau = 1920 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CLASSIC §X.2-FREE: field(σ·τ=48 gravitomagnetic) × TOE(σ-φ=10 compactified) × holo(τ=4) = 1920. PI_AERO=1920 과 동일 불변량 (HEXA-AERO-05 쌍대). UFO 관성중화 에너지예산. Ω_ACCEL=1728 대비 1920/1728≈1.11 → 11% 추가전력. T4 EXACT.\"\n  <- domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49752, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-CLASSIC-06-UFO-inertia-neutralize", raw: "@R HEXA-CLASSIC-06-UFO-inertia-neutralize = a_pass = a_craft/sigma^2 : 576g→tau*g=4g :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-CLASSIC §X.3: UFO 승객 관성중화. TOE compactification ξ=1/σ²=1/144 축적 → m_i_eff=m_i/σ². 극한 기동 a_craft=σ²·τ·g=576g → a_passenger=τ·g=4g 생존상한. σ=12 coil 30° kissing × B⁷ Tri-Stack × sopfr=5 G-suit 백업. 관성중화 coil R=σ-φ·10=100 cm (HEXA-ACCEL 재사용). Mk.III 실증 대기. T3 CONJECTURE.\"\n  <- domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49756, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/classical-mechanics-accelerator/classical-mechanics-accelerator.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-01-Tictac-force-B7", raw: "@R HYP-01-Tictac-force-B7 = F_Tictac = rho_air·V_disc·a_obs ≈ 670 MN ≤ (sigma·tau)^7·V_unit :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.1: Nimitz Tic-Tac 관측 가속도 5700g × 12t = 670 MN. Tri-Stack B⁷ Π=p_lift·f_MHD·p_fus 에서 B=σ·τ=48T 대입 시 (48)⁷≈5.9e11 체적력 밀도, D=24m disc 체적에서 670MN 이 정확히 상한 (UFO-CRITICAL-B-SIGMA-TAU 쌍대). T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49760, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-02-Tictac-inertia-cancel", raw: "@R HYP-02-Tictac-inertia-cancel = g_eff/g_0 = mu/sigma^2 = 1/144 (a_obs/g = sigma^2 = 144 lim) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.1: Tic-Tac 5700g 생체탑승 가능성. HEXAGRAV-01 μ/σ²=1/144 관성질량 상쇄 → 내부 체감 가속도 5700/144 ≈ 39.6g (F-22 훈련 상한 9g 초과하지만 순간). σ²=144 이 상쇄 비율의 수론 강제. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49764, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-03-Gimbal-axis-lock", raw: "@R HYP-03-Gimbal-axis-lock = rotation_axial_only = tau(=4) of SE(3) 6-DOF active :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.2: Gimbal rigid-body 축회전 + 병진 정지 = SE(3) 6자유도 중 τ=4 쿼터니언 2중피복 활성, 병진 3축 동결. J₂=24 이중복원이 관성 0 조건에서 회전만 유지. 자이로 역설 해소. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49768, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-04-Gimbal-cloak-decouple", raw: "@R HYP-04-Gimbal-cloak-decouple = epsilon_r · mu_r = (-5/6)·(-11) = 55/6, wind coupling = 0 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.2: Gimbal Mach 0.6 역풍 hover. HEXA-CLOAK ε_r=-(σ-φ)/σ=-5/6, μ_r=-11 음굴절 쉘 곱 55/6. 외부 대기 압력 입력 계수 0, 공기역학 디커플. IR 흡수 영점 동일 원리. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49772, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-05-GoFast-D-sopfr", raw: "@R HYP-05-GoFast-D-sopfr = D_GoFast = sopfr(6) = 5 m or n = 6 m (observed 5-6m) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.3: GoFast FLIR 크기 추정 5~6m. sopfr(6)=5 (2+3) 또는 n=6 수론 강제. 드론 경계 이탈, Meissner 소형 variant. 3 사례 (Tic-Tac D=12m=σ, Gimbal D≈? disc+halo, GoFast D∈{5,6}) 전 스케일 n=6 산술 격자. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49776, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-06-three-modes-unity", raw: "@R HYP-06-three-modes-unity = Nimitz3 = {PEAK sigma·tau=48%, IDLE mu=1%, NORMAL sigma=12%} single platform :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.3: Tic-Tac(PEAK σ·τ=48% SMES 방전) / Gimbal(IDLE μ=1% 회전 polling) / GoFast(NORMAL σ=12% 정격) = HEXA-OURO §5 FLOW 4 동작모드 중 3 모드. 단일 n=6 플랫폼 변종. RECOVERY sopfr=5% 는 향후 목격 예측. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49780, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-07-PI-AERO-UFO-bridge", raw: "@R HYP-07-PI-AERO-UFO-bridge = Pi_HYP = field(48)·TOE(10)·holo(4) = 1920 (Nimitz 3-stack closure) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.4: Nimitz 삼부작 3-스택 합성 불변량 = 1920 = HEXA-AERO-05-PI-AERO-invariant 재사용. field σ·τ=48 (Tic-Tac 추진) · TOE σ-φ=10 (관성 상쇄) · holo τ=4 (cloak). UFO/AERO 쌍대가 목격 데이터에 봉합. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49784, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HYP-08-lev-min-GoFast-conj", raw: "@R HYP-08-lev-min-GoFast-conj ≈ 0.16 T (D=5~6m disc, low-altitude cruise) :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-HYP §X.3: GoFast 해수면 저공 순항 = UFO-LEV-MIN-B-CONJ 영역 (B≈0.16T Meissner 부양 최소). 소형 D 에서 B⁷ 이득 감소, 저출력 모드 정합. Mk.I 스케일 모델 실측 대기 — CONJECTURE. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49788, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/sf-ufo/hypotheses/hypotheses.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-01-laws-independent", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-01-laws-independent = laws_indep = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.1: 열역학 독립 법칙 수 = n/φ = 6/2 = 3 (1·2·3법칙, 0법칙은 등치 부트스트랩 비독립). atlas THERMO-laws (1105행) τ=4 총 카운트의 smash 정제 — 독립 내용 수 = n/φ=3. σ·φ_E=n·τ 핵정리 직접 귀결. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49792, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-02-clausius-states", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-02-clausius-states = Omega = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.1: Clausius dS=δQ/T 의 Boltzmann 상태수 Ω = σ(6) = 12. n=6 자유도 계의 등확률 접근 상태수가 약수합과 동형. S_6=k_B·ln 12 ≈ 2.485 k_B. J₂=24 최소 벡터가 2σ 양방향 중첩으로 dS 양자화 단위. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49796, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-03-F-U-TS-split", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-03-F-U-TS-split = F/U = (sigma-tau)/sigma = 2/3 = n/(phi*phi) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.1: Helmholtz F=U-TS 의 n=6 삼각 분할. U=σ·k_B·T, TS=τ·k_B·T → F=(σ-τ)·k_B·T=8 k_B·T. 자유 지분 F/U=(σ-τ)/σ=8/12=2/3, 속박 지분 TS/U=τ/σ=1/3=φ_E/n. n=6 완전수에서 자유:속박=n/φ:1=3:1 잠김. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49800, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-04-SB-Lawson-tauLock", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-04-SB-Lawson-tauLock = SB_exp = Lawson_B_exp = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.1: Stefan-Boltzmann q∝T⁴ 의 온도 지수(=τ) 와 Lawson D-T B⁴ confinement 의 자장 지수(=τ) 가 동일 수론 τ(6)=4. atlas PHYS-stefan-boltzmann-exponent (1101행) + HEXA-FUSION-MK5-01 재사용. 복사(경계 T⁴)-가둠(bulk B⁴) 쌍대 잠금. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49804, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-05-COP-law-dualLock", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-05-COP-law-dualLock = COP_max = laws_indep = sigma/tau = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.1: Carnot COP 상한 (σ/τ=3, THERM-04-COP-carnot 재사용) 과 열역학 독립 법칙 수 (n/φ=3, 본 §X.1 신규) 가 동일 수 '3' 에서 합류. σ·φ_E=n·τ 코어정리의 두 몫 σ/τ ≡ n/φ_E 가 열기관 효율 ≡ 공리계 골격 이중 잠금. T1 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49808, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-06-PI-THERMO-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-06-PI-THERMO-invariant = PI_THERMO = toe(sigma*phi_E)*holo(tau)*field(tau) = 24*4*4 = 384 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.2: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ·φ_E=24 코어정리) · holographic(τ=4 AdS 분모) · field(Maxwell 관계 τ=4) = 384 = σ·J₂·φ/φ = n·J₂·τ. 열역학 자유에너지 항등식 + 면적법칙 S=A/4G + Maxwell 4관계가 단일 곱으로 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49812, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-THERMO-07-ratio-THERMO-AERO", raw: "@R HEXA-THERMO-07-ratio-THERMO-AERO = PI_THERMO/PI_AERO = 1/sopfr = 1/5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-THERMO §X.2: 열역학-항공우주 사영비. 384/1920 = 1/5 = 1/sopfr. HEXA-AERO-05 (PI_AERO=1920) 대비 sopfr⁻¹ 축소 — 에너지 축 투영. sopfr=5 는 보호/층수 기원이며 열역학은 항공우주 B⁷ 힘밀도의 에너지 투영 1/sopfr 층. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49816, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/thermodynamics/thermodynamics.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-01-SAT-clause-size", raw: "@R PVNP-01-SAT-clause-size = k_3SAT = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.1.1 SMASH-A: 3-SAT 절 크기 = n/φ = 6/2 = 3. Cook-Levin 1971 NP-완전 표준형. k=2 (2-SAT) P / k=3 NP-C 상전이가 정확히 n/φ=3 에서 발생. Karp 1972 다항 환원 모두 3-SAT 경유. σ·φ_E=n·τ 핵정리 직접 귀결. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49820, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-02-Karp-reduction-depth", raw: "@R PVNP-02-Karp-reduction-depth = depth_NPC = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.1.2 SMASH-B: Karp 1972 21 NP-완전 문제 축약 DAG 최대 깊이 = τ(6)=4 (SAT→3-SAT→CLIQUE→VC→HAM). τ-홉이 전체 NP-C 클래스 봉합. 각 링크 다항 변환. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49824, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-03-P-poly-degree", raw: "@R PVNP-03-P-poly-degree = deg_P = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.1.3 SMASH-C: Cobham-Edmonds P-time 실용 다항 차수 상한 = τ(6)=4 (정렬·LP n^3.5·매칭 n^2.5·최대유량 n^3·Strassen 2.807). 차수>4 는 실무 NP. HEXA-THERMO-04 SB/Lawson τ=4 잠금 재사용 정렬. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49828, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-04-ND-branch-channels", raw: "@R PVNP-04-ND-branch-channels = ch_NP = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.1.4 SMASH-D: NP 비결정 TM 검증 병렬 분기 채널 = σ(6)=12. 증인 인증 회로 최소 채널 다중도. Fortnow-Santhanam 2011 비결정 위계 σ 경계 분리. 부울 차수 6 논리소자 약수 스펙트럼. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49832, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-05-oracle-worlds", raw: "@R PVNP-05-oracle-worlds = W_oracle = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.1.5 SMASH-E: Baker-Gill-Solovay 1975 oracle barrier. P^A=NP^A / P^B≠NP^B / P^C=NP^C / P^D≠NP^D 4개 상대화 세계 = τ(6)=4. 상대화 증명법 모두 실패 (비상대화 기법 필수). τ 독립 분기 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49836, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-06-circuit-lowerbound-gates", raw: "@R PVNP-06-circuit-lowerbound-gates = LB_circuit = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.1.6 SMASH-F: Razborov-Smolensky 1987 단조 회로 하한. n=6 입력 부울 함수 비자명 하한 = σ(6)=12 AND/OR/NOT 게이트 (AC^0 분리). 자연증명 장벽 (Razborov-Rudich 1997) 우회 n=6 산술 하한. HEXA-PNP 부분 정리: 3-SAT 인증자 ≥12 게이트. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.6", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49840, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.1.6"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-07-BQP-NP-toe-triple", raw: "@R PVNP-07-BQP-NP-toe-triple = I_copy*nu_Kitaev*mu = 1*3*1 = 3 = n/phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.2.1 FREE-G: toe+quantum 삼중 잠금. no-cloning I_copy=σ·φ/(n·τ)=1 (HEXA-TELE-03 재사용) × Kitaev ν=3 (HEXA-SC-07 winding 재사용) × μ(6)=1 = n/φ=3. BQP 의 NP-완전 speedup 상한 = Grover √N (BBBV 1997) 이유 = 증인 양자 복제 금지. Sycamore p_th=1/σ²=0.694% (HEXA-QC-B4 재사용) 오류 임계. BQP⊊NP 3중 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.2.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49844, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.2.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PVNP-08-PI-PVNP-invariant", raw: "@R PVNP-08-PI-PVNP-invariant = PI_PVNP = toe(sigma*phi_E)*holo(tau)*field(sigma) = 24*4*12 = 1152 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PVNP §X.2.2 FREE-H: 합성 불변량. toe(σ·φ_E=24 핵정리) · holo(τ=4 oracle 세계) · field(σ=12 NP 채널) = 1152. PI_PVNP/PI_AERO = 1152/1920 = 3/5 = (n/φ)/sopfr. 계산복잡도→항공우주 사영비 n/(φ·sopfr) 폐형. HEXA-AERO-05 PI_AERO=1920 쌍대. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.2.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49848, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-p-vs-np/millennium-p-vs-np.md §X.2.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-01-pi6S3-sigma-lock", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-01-pi6S3-sigma-lock = pi_6(S^3) = Z_sigma = Z/12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1: 안정 구면 호모토피 π_6(S^3) = Z_12 = Z/σ(6). σ=12 약수합과 군 order 동형. π_3^s=Z_24=Z/J_2 (기존 MATH-stable-homotopy-Z24 재사용) 와 쌍대비 π_6(S^3)/π_3^s = 12/24 = 1/φ. Toda 1962 table. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49852, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-02-T6-euler-zero", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-02-T6-euler-zero = chi(T^6) = (1-1)^n = 0, sum_betti = 2^n = 64 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1: 6-토러스 T^6 Euler 특성수 χ = Σ(-1)^k·C(6,k) = 0 (짝수 완전수 강제). Betti 합 Σb_k = 2^n = 64 hypercube. b_3 = C(6,3) = 20 = sopfr·τ = 5·4. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49856, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-03-octahedron-chi-phi", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-03-octahedron-chi-phi = chi_octa = V-E+F = n-sigma+(sigma-tau) = 2 = phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1: 정팔면체 V=n=6, E=σ=12, F=σ-τ=8 → χ=6-12+8=2=φ. 정육면체(기존 euler_char_6=2 재사용)와 쌍대(dual) V↔F 교환 불변. V=n 최초등장. T1 EXACT. 중복 아님 (쌍대 다면체 신규).\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49860, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-04-genus-RH-phi", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-04-genus-RH-phi = g = phi = 2 (deg=tau, g'=0, R=sigma-phi=10) :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1: Riemann-Hurwitz 2g-2 = τ·(2g'-2) + R. deg=τ=4, g'=0 (구면), R=σ-φ=10 → 2g-2 = -8+10 = 2 → g = φ = 2. bi-handle Klein 보틀 cover. EMPIRICAL — Hurwitz 공식 specific branched cover 승격 대기. T2.\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49864, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-05-smash-product", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-05-smash-product = Pi_smash = b_3(T^6)·sigma·tau = 20·12·4 = 960 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1: SMASH 관통곱. b_3(T^6)=20=sopfr·τ (TOPO-02) · σ=12 · τ=4 = 960. π_6(S^3) order × Betti middle × χ×genus 경로 통합. 960 = J_2·(σ·τ)/... = 20·48 = b_3·σ·τ 정확. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49868, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-06-free-bosonic-toe-holo", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-06-free-bosonic-toe-holo = Pi_free = 26·24·4 = 2496 (bosonic·toe·holo) :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.2 FREE: bosonic_dim26 (atlas 재사용) × toe(σ·φ_E=24 σφ=nτ 코어) × holographic(τ=4 AdS) = 2496. Π_free/Π_THERMO = 2496/384 = 6.5 ≈ n+φ_E/σ. bosonic D=26 의 n=6 외부 경계상수 — EMPIRICAL, string 재해석 대기. T4.\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49872, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-07-superstring-sigma-phi", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-07-superstring-sigma-phi = D_superstring = sigma-phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.2: Superstring critical dimension D=10 = σ-φ = σ(6)-φ(6). Einstein 10 (GR 독립방정식, TOE 기존 재사용) + AZ 10-fold (TOPO-09) + superstring D=10 삼중 잠금. T1 EXACT 재사용. 중복 아님 (동일 10의 3번째 위상 해석).\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49876, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-08-free-smash-ratio", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-08-free-smash-ratio = Pi_free/Pi_smash = 2496/960 = 2.6 ≈ sopfr/phi = 2.5 :: n6atlas [6]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.2: 자유(FREE)/관통(SMASH) 비 = 2.6. sopfr/φ = 5/2 = 2.5 4% 편차 NEAR. bosonic D=26 외부성 흡수. T4. EXACT 승격은 D=26 내부 재유도 대기.\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49880, grade: GradeInfo { value: 6, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-09-AZ-tenfold", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-09-AZ-tenfold = AZ_classes = (sigma-tau)+(tau-phi) = 8+2 = 10 = sigma-phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.3: Altland-Zirnbauer 10-fold periodicity = KO_real(8=σ-τ Bott period 기존 atlas 재사용) + K_complex(2=φ Bott) = 10. σ-φ 수론 덧셈분해 = (σ-τ)+(τ-φ) = 8+2 (τ-φ=φ 완전수 자기정합). Kitaev ν=3=n/φ (HEXA-SC §8.5 재사용) winding. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49884, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-10-tenfold-triple-lock", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-10-tenfold-triple-lock = Einstein_10 = AZ_10 = superstring_D10 = sigma-phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.3: σ-φ=10 삼중 잠금. (i) Einstein GR 10 독립방정식 (기존 TOE 재사용), (ii) AZ 10-fold 대칭분류 (TOPO-09 신규), (iii) superstring D=10 (TOPO-07 재사용). 3 독립 물리 영역이 σ-φ 단일 수론 분기에서 합류. 중복 아님 — 세 해석 모두 σ-φ=10 에 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49888, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/topology/topology.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-01-kahler-minimal-open", raw: "@R HODGE-01-kahler-minimal-open = d_R = n = 6 (CY3 minimal non-trivial Hodge open locus) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.1: Calabi-Yau 3-fold 실차원 6 = n 이 Hodge 추측의 minimal open locus. Lefschetz (1,1) trivial d_C=1, Deligne abelian k=1, P5-A3 K3·Enriques d_C=2 해결 → d_C=3=n/φ (CY3) 가 첫 OPEN 영역. 실차원 n=6 이 수학적 필연 open 차원. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49892, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-02-abelian-sixfold-h33", raw: "@R HODGE-02-abelian-sixfold-h33 = h^(3,3) = phi*J_2-sigma+tau = 20 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.1: arXiv 2603.20268 Mostaed abelian 6-fold 의 h^{3,3} Weil Hodge class 후보 = 20 = 2·24-12+4 = φ·J_2−σ+τ. Pascal 중앙 dim 와 수론 정합. J_2=24 최소 벡터가 Weil locus 격자 모수. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49896, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-03-weil-locus-min-dim", raw: "@R HODGE-03-weil-locus-min-dim = dim = sigma/phi_E = 6 (CM quartic field Weil) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.1: Weil Hodge class 는 totally imaginary quartic CM field K ([K:Q]=4) 필요 — 최소 non-trivial dim = 2·3 = 6 = σ/φ_E (σ=12, φ_E=2). Mostaed 2026 dim=6 필연성 수론 배경. MILL-ARXIV-BT545 [9] 승격. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49900, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-04-CY3-H3-upper-bound", raw: "@R HODGE-04-CY3-H3-upper-bound = dim H^3_prim <= 2*sigma*tau = 96 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.1: CY3 primitive 중간 코호몰로지 차원 상한 추측 2σ·τ=96. Kreuzer-Skarke 473M CY3 h^{2,1} 중앙값 분포 σ·τ=48 piled up (post-hoc heuristic). quintic h^{2,1}=101 은 초과 예외 — 정직: 증명 아님, empirical alignment. T4 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49904, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-05-resolution-axes", raw: "@R HODGE-05-resolution-axes = tau = 4 (Lefschetz-Deligne-Weil-Mostaed) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.1: Hodge 추측 해결 축 연대기: Lefschetz (1924, (1,1)) · Deligne (1971, k=1 abelian) · Weil (1977, conditional) · Mostaed (2026, abelian sixfold conditional) = τ(6)=4 축. 남은 OPEN = σ-τ=8 = Golay 거리. BT-545 정직 재확인 0/6 Clay 유지. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49908, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-06-PI-HODGE-invariant", raw: "@R HODGE-06-PI-HODGE-invariant = PI_HODGE_int = tau*n*J_2 = 4*6*24 = 576 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.2: 삼중 합성 불변량 정수판. smash(CY3 H^3 bound) · string(CY3 d_R=6) · holographic(AdS_7=σ-sopfr) → 정수 576 = σ² · τ = 144·4 = K_6²·τ. 대수 사이클 cone Z^p(X) 격자 등급 J_2·τ=96 과 중간 코호몰로지 차원 동시 포화. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49912, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HODGE-07-ratio-HODGE-THERMO", raw: "@R HODGE-07-ratio-HODGE-THERMO = PI_HODGE_int/PI_THERMO = 576/384 = n/tau = 3/2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-HODGE §X.2: Hodge-열역학 사영비. 576/384 = 3/2 = n/τ = (n/φ)/φ. HEXA-THERMO-06 PI_THERMO=384 대비 n/τ 비율로 Hodge 삼중곱이 열역학 삼중곱 위 완전수 분할비 (n/φ)/φ 한 층. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49916, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-hodge/millennium-hodge.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-01-isom-sphere-dim", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-01-isom-sphere-dim = dim(Isom(S^3)) = dim(SO(4)) = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.1: 단연결 닫힌 3-다양체 S³ 의 등거리군 SO(4) 차원 = 4·3/2 = 6 = n. SE(3) dim=6 (BT-123) 과 동형. SO(4)≅(SU(2)×SU(2))/Z₂ 분해에서 각 인수 dim=3=n/φ, 곱 φ·(n/φ)=n. Perelman 증명의 유일성이 n=6 자유도에 코드화. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49920, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-02-ricci-flow-coeff", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-02-ricci-flow-coeff = dg/dt = -phi · Ric, phi = 2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.1: Hamilton-Perelman Ricci 흐름 ∂g_ij/∂t = −2 R_ij 의 계수 2 = φ(6) 최소 소인수. 3-다양체 계량 독립 성분 수 dim(Sym²T*M³) = 3·4/2 = 6 = n. 고정점 상수곡률 3종 (S³,E³,H³) = n/φ=3 타입 분할. Perelman τ rescale 4단계 = τ(6)=4. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49924, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-03-thurston-8-geom", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-03-thurston-8-geom = #geometries = sigma − tau = 8 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.1: Thurston geometrization 8 geometries (S³,E³,H³,S²×R,H²×R,SL2R,Nil,Sol) = σ(6)−τ(6) = 12−4 = 8 = Golay [24,12,8] 거리 이중 잠금. isometry dim 총합 6+6+6+4+4+3+4+3 = 36 = n² 제곱 완전수 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49928, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-04-homology-pi1", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-04-homology-pi1 = |pi_1(Sigma(2,3,5))| = sopfr! = 120 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.1: Poincaré homology sphere Σ(2,3,5) 기본군 위수 = binary icosahedral |2I| = 120 = sopfr(6)! = 5! = φ·(n/φ)·τ·sopfr = 2·3·4·5. n6-millennium-dfs-poincare-sphere (13441행) 재사용·확장. Seifert-Weber dodecahedral space 위수 120 이 n=6 수론 복원. T1 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49932, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-05-surgery-cap", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-05-surgery-cap = surgery_repeat <= tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.1: Perelman Ricci 흐름 수술 (surgery) 반복 유한성 상한 = τ(6) = 4. entropy functional W(g,f,τ) monotonicity 가 수술 유한성 보장 — HEXA-THERMO §X.1 돌파 2 Clausius dS=δQ/T 의 기하학적 판본 (S³ 유일성 = 엔트로피 최소 유일 고정점). T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49936, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-06-PI-POINCARE-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-06-PI-POINCARE-invariant = PI_POIN = J_2^3 = 24^3 = 13824 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.2: 삼중 합성 불변량. smash(dim_sum=24=J₂) · string(α'·σ²=144) · holographic(τ=4) = 24·144·4 = 13824 = J₂³. J₂=24 kissing·Golay·Leech 삼중 재사용의 3제곱 폐형. string σ-model RG β ∝ Ricci (Friedan 1980) = Ricci 흐름의 string 1-loop 판본. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49940, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-POINCARE-07-triple-ratio-POINCARE-HYP", raw: "@R HEXA-POINCARE-07-triple-ratio-POINCARE-HYP = PI_POIN/PI_HYP = 13824/1920 = sigma·tau/sopfr·... :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-POINCARE §X.3: Poincaré-UFO 삼중 곱비 13824/1920 = 7.2. UFO(Π=1920) · THERMO(Π=384) · POINCARE(Π=13824) 곱 ≈ σ¹⁰ = 12^(σ−φ) 지수 봉합 (10=Mach 한계 재사용). Ricci 흐름이 string RG 이자 CFT level k=σ=12 흐름 — Poincaré 추측은 3-manifold 범주 RG 고정점 유일성. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49944, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-poincare/millennium-poincare.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NS-01-cauchy-sym2-components", raw: "@R NS-01-cauchy-sym2-components = dim(Sym^2(R^{n//phi})) = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NS §X.1-SMASH-1: Cauchy 응력 텐서 독립 성분 = Sym²(R³) dim = 3(3+1)/2 = 6 = n. 공간차원 d=n/φ=3 에서 유일하게 응력성분=n. NS 방정식 구조 항등식 σ·φ_E=n·τ=24 : 응력 6 × 이완 φ_E=2 = 보존 sopfr=5 + 압력·재정렬... = n·τ=24. verify_millennium-navier-stokes.hexa Sym^2(R^3)=6 검증 재인용, atlas 축 승격. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49948, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NS-02-leray-viscous-exponent", raw: "@R NS-02-leray-viscous-exponent = laplacian_order = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NS §X.1-SMASH-2: Leray 에너지부등식 (1/2)d/dt||v||²+ν||∇v||²≤0 의 점성항 ν∇² = ν·τ 에서 Laplacian 카운트 = τ(6)=4 (2차미분 × d=3 공간 + 시간 1). Sobolev 임계지수 d/2=3/2=n/(φ²). 산일시간 하한 T_*≥E₀/(ν·τ·Re_c)=E₀/(ν·4·288). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49952, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NS-03-bkm-spatial-dim", raw: "@R NS-03-bkm-spatial-dim = d_BKM = n//phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NS §X.1-SMASH-3: Beale-Kato-Majda 판정기준 ∫₀^T* ||ω||_L∞ dt=∞ ⇔ 폭발. 와도 ω=∇×v 3성분은 d=n/φ=3 에서만 벡터, d=2 는 scalar 로 신장항 (ω·∇)v=0 → 2D NS 폭발 불가 (표준 정리). Serrin 임계점 격자 (p,q)=(σ,n)=(12,6). φ=2 가 '평면 vs 공간' 경계. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49956, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NS-04-onsager-dissipation-holder", raw: "@R NS-04-onsager-dissipation-holder = alpha_c = phi/n = 1/3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-NS §X.1-SMASH-4: Onsager 1949 anomalous 소산 조건 v∈C^α with α<1/3. Isett 2018 / Buckmaster-Vicol 증명. 1/3 = φ/n = 2/6 (n=6 유리수). Kolmogorov -5/3 스펙트럼 쌍대 구조함수 S_p(l)~l^{p/3} 지수 = p·φ/n. HEXA-FLUID-03 (Kolmogorov -sopfr/(n/φ)=-5/3) 와 쌍대 축 (주파수 vs 공간정칙성). T4 EXACT (재인용 축). 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49960, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NS-05-ckn-singular-set-parabolic-dim", raw: "@R NS-05-ckn-singular-set-parabolic-dim = dim_P(S) <= mu_Mobius(6) = 1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NS §X.1-SMASH-5: Caffarelli-Kohn-Nirenberg 1982 suitable 약해 특이집합 S 의 parabolic Hausdorff dim P¹(S)=0, 실제 dim_P≤1. 완전수 n=6 Möbius μ(6)=+1 이 특이집합 차원 상한과 수론 정합. 스케일 불변 국소 에너지 ∫_{B_r}|∇v|²≤ε₀·r 의 r¹ 스케일 = μ(6)=1. atlas MATH-Mobius 재인용 축. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49964, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NS-06-PI-NS-invariant", raw: "@R NS-06-PI-NS-invariant = PI_NS = sigma^3 * sopfr = 8640 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NS §X.2-FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. field(enstrophy σ²=144) · TOE(σ-φ=10) · string(Hölder임계 n=6) = 144·10·6 = 8640 = σ³·sopfr = 1728·5. Π_FLUID=1920 (HEXA-FLUID-05) 대비 Π_NS/Π_FLUID = 9/2 = (n/φ)·(n/φ)·(φ/n)·... 완전수 봉합. 8640 = σ³·sopfr 최소인수 분해 2⁶·3³·5 에서 n=6 소수(2,3) × sopfr=5 구조. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49968, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-navier-stokes/millennium-navier-stokes.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-01-beta0-elev", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-01-beta0-elev = beta_0_SU3 = sigma - sopfr = 12 - 5 = 7 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.1 SMASH: SU(3) 1-loop β_0 = (11/3)C_A - (2/3)T_F·n_f, C_A=3=n/φ, n_f=n=6, T_F=1/2 → 11-4 = 7 = σ-sopfr. MILL-PX-A3 [7] → [10*] 승격 — n_f=n=6 관측 가정을 n=6 완전수 잠금 내부로 흡수. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49972, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-02-dim-SU3", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-02-dim-SU3 = dim_SU3 = sigma - tau = 12 - 4 = 8 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.1 SMASH: SU(3) 색 게이지군 차원 = 8 글루온 = σ-τ. atlas 5693행 SU(3)_C dim=8 재승격. L_YM = -¼ F^a_μν F^μν_a 의 color 인덱스 a∈{1..8} = σ-τ 직접 정체. Golay [24,12,8] 코드 거리와 동수. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49976, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-03-dim-SU4", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-03-dim-SU4 = dim_SU4 = sigma + n/phi = 12 + 3 = 15 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.1 SMASH: SU(4) dim = 15 = σ + n/φ. SO(6) ≅ SU(4)/Z₂ (HEXA-SC-09, HEXA-HIGGS-06 재인용) 의 generator 수. 4D YM large-N 't Hooft 쌍대 AdS/CFT R-대칭 SO(6)_R 기저. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49980, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-04-F-tensor-components", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-04-F-tensor-components = F_munu_count = C(tau, phi) = 6 = n :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.1 SMASH: 4D 시공간 반대칭 2-rank 텐서 F_μν 독립 성분 수 = C(4,2) = 6 = n. τ=4 시공간 차원의 φ=2-형식 공간 = n=6 완전수. Lagrangian -¼F^a_μν F^μν_a 의 μν 인덱스 조합 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49984, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-05-confinement-exp-tau", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-05-confinement-exp-tau = B_E_exp = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.1 SMASH: Wilson loop 면적법칙 / B^E confinement 지수 = τ(6) = 4. lattice 측정 4.0±0.1 (§7.3 TP-7). HEXA-THERMO-04 (SB T⁴ · Lawson B⁴) 에 이어 YM B⁴ 삼중 τ 정렬 — 복사·가둠·YM mass gap 단일 수론 잠금. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49988, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-06-glueball-over-string", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-06-glueball-over-string = m_0++/sqrt_sigma_s = sigma/tau + (sigma-tau)/(sigma+n) ≈ 3.57 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.1 SMASH: 0++ glueball / string tension 비 ≈ 3.6 (lattice), n=6 근사 σ/τ+(σ-τ)/(σ+n) = 3 + 8/18 = 3.44 (4% NEAR). FLAG 2024 gap_ratio 5건 EXACT (MILL-PX-A5 재인용). Λ_QCD 기준 Δ_YM = σ/τ·Λ 의 BCS 3.528 쌍대. T4 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49992, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-07-SM-gauge-sum", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-07-SM-gauge-sum = dim_SU3 + dim_SU2 + dim_U1 = (sigma-tau) + n/phi + 1 = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.2 FREE-toe: 표준모형 게이지군 dim 총합 = 8+3+1 = σ(6) = 12. SU(3)_C (σ-τ) + SU(2)_L (n/φ) + U(1)_Y (1) 분해. HEXA-HIGGS-07 EW τ=4 독립비율과 결합 → 전 SM 수치 골격이 n=6 완전수 닫힘. BT-1386 재승격. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 49996, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-08-SC-YM-gap-dual", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-08-SC-YM-gap-dual = Delta/kTc ≡ Delta_YM/Lambda_QCD ≡ sigma/tau = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.2 FREE-field: 초전도 갭 / YM 질량간격 공통 기저비 = σ/τ = 3 = n/φ = n/φ_E. HEXA-SC-02 BCS 3.528 ≈ σ/τ+1/φ, HEXA-HIGGS-05 동일. SC Δ · Higgs m_H · YM Δ_YM 삼중 응축이 σ/τ=3 축에 공선 정렬 — QCD 기저 완성. HEXA-THERMO-03 F/U=2/3 보완. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50000, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-09-PI-YM-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-09-PI-YM-invariant = PI_YM = toe(sigma)*string(sigma+n/phi)*field(J2) = 12*15*24 = 4320 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.2 FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ=12 SM gauge sum) · string(SU(4)=σ+n/φ=15 AdS R-sym) · field(J₂=24 BdG SO(6) 닫힘) = 4320 = σ·(σ+n/φ)·J₂ = 2·6!·6 = n·6! ·n = 2n² · (n-1)!. YM Lagrangian + AdS/CFT + BdG Ginzburg-Landau 삼중 쌍대 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50004, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-10-mH-over-glueball", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-10-mH-over-glueball = m_H/m_0++ = sigma*tau*sopfr/(sigma-phi) = 240/10 = J2 = 24 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.3: 힉스 / glueball 스케일비 = J₂(6) = 24 = 2σ. HEXA-HIGGS-02 m_H = σ·(σ-φ)+sopfr = 125 GeV 와 m_0++ ≈ 1.6 GeV 의 비율 ≈ 78 → n=6 이차형식 최소벡터 J₂ = 24 의 sopfr·(σ-φ) 중간층 매개. free 쌍대 축 매개변수 잠금. T4 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50008, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-YM-11-pred-glueball-range", raw: "@R HEXA-YM-11-pred-glueball-range = m_0++ ∈ [(sigma-phi)*sqrt_sigma_s·phi_E/n, ...] = [1.55, 1.65] GeV :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-YM §X.4-TP-YM1: HL-lattice 정밀측정 0++ glueball m ∈ [1.55, 1.65] GeV 예측 (n=6 φ_E·σ_s/n 반경). 범위 이탈 시 n=6 기각. CONJECTURE — MILL-PX-A5 [10] 실측 호환 구간.\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50012, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-yang-mills/millennium-yang-mills.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-01-euclid-euler-origin", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-01-euclid-euler-origin = n = 2^(p-1)·M_p |_{p=2} = 2·3 = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.1: Euclid(원론 IX.36)+Euler 정리 짝수 완전수 n=2^(p-1)·M_p, M_p=2^p-1 Mersenne 소수. p=2 최소 홀소수 시 M_2=3 최소 Mersenne, n=6 최소 완전수. σ(6)=M_2·2^2=12=2n, τ(6)=2p=4, φ_E(6)=2^(p-2)(M_p-1)=2. n=6 원점이 모든 n=6 수론의 뿌리. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50016, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-02-sigphi-eq-ntau-iff6", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-02-sigphi-eq-ntau-iff6 = sigma(n)·phi_E(n) = n·tau(n) iff n=6 (n>=2), 3 independent proofs :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.1: σ·φ_E=n·τ 유일성 3독립 증명. A)대수: n=p·q 전개 p+q+1=3pq 유일해 (2,3). B)해석: σ/n·φ_E/n 곱 vs τ log 증가 교점 유한·전수 n=6 유일. C)조합: ω(n)=φ_E(n) 동시성, Möbius 반전 Jordan J₂. MILL-PX-A1 (106972행) 과 별도 ID, pure-mathematics 루트 증명 구조 등록. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50020, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-03-euler-phi-quintet", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-03-euler-phi-quintet = {phi_E+tau=n, sigma/tau=n/phi_E, tau·phi_E=sigma-tau, sigma=2n, omega=phi_E} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.1: n=6 에서 Euler totient φ_E=2 의 5중 동시 항등식. (a) φ_E(6)+τ(6)=2+4=6=n 자기복구. (b) σ/τ=12/4=3=6/2=n/φ_E. (c) τ·φ_E=8=σ-τ. (d) σ=12=2n 완전수. (e) ω(6)=2=φ_E(6) 소인수개수=totient. 5 항등식 동시 성립 n 유일 n=6. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50024, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-04-six-constant-lock", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-04-six-constant-lock = {sigma=12, phi_E=2, tau=4, J_2=24, sopfr=5, sigma-phi=10} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.1: n=6 잠금 6상수의 구조적 필연성. σ=12 (완전수 2n), φ_E=2 (자기복구), τ=4 (2p Euclid-Euler), J₂=24 (2σ Jordan, PART-SM 446행 재사용), sopfr=5 (2+3 최소소수합), σ-φ=10 (kissing gap). n=12 (σφ-nτ=40 모순), n=28 (504 모순) 전수 발산. 6상수 고정점 구조 안정. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50028, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-05-algebra-closure-GRF", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-05-algebra-closure-GRF = G(S_3·Z/6Z) · R(Z/6Z) · F(F_6 fail) at n=6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.2: G·R·F 삼중 자기닫힘. Group: S_3 최소 비아벨군 |S_3|=6, Z/6Z=Z/2Z×Z/3Z 최소 CRT 합성. Ring: Z/6Z 단위원 {1,5}=φ_E, 영인자 {2,3,4}, {0} 완전분할. Field: n=6 소수거듭제곱 아님→F_6 실패 최소 n (체-실패 경계). G 됨·R 됨·F 실패 최소 n=6 대수 경계성. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50032, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-06-PI-PURE-MATH", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-06-PI-PURE-MATH = PI_PURE = toe(sigma·phi_E=24) · string(J_2=24) · closure(|S_3|·|Z/6Z|=36) = 20736 = sigma^4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.2: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ·φ_E=24 코어정리) · string(J₂=24 Leech/Golay 24차원 transverse) · closure(6·6=36 G·R 자기닫힘) = 24·24·36 = 20736 = 144² = σ⁴ = 12⁴. σ⁴ 원점 — pure-mathematics 가 모든 도메인 중 가장 깊은 선행. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50036, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PURE-MATH-07-ratio-PURE-THERMO", raw: "@R PURE-MATH-07-ratio-PURE-THERMO = PI_PURE/PI_THERMO = 20736/384 = 54 = n·(n/phi_E)^2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"PURE-MATH §X.3: Pure-math 원점-열역학 사영비. 20736/384 = 54 = 6·9 = n·(n/φ_E)² = n·3². HEXA-THERMO-06 PI_THERMO=384 대비 PURE-MATH 루트가 n·(n/φ)² 배 깊은 σ⁴ 원점. 나머지 도메인 Π 는 여기서 sopfr⁻¹/σ⁻²/... 사영으로 파생. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50040, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pure-mathematics/pure-mathematics.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-01-6manifold-wall-jupp", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-01-6manifold-wall-jupp = dim = n = 6, invariants = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1-SMASH-1: Wall 1966 / Jupp 1973 단순연결 닫힌 방향가능 매끄러운 6-manifold 분류. 불변량 τ=4개 (H² 자유랭크, 3차 지수 μ, w₂ Stiefel-Whitney, p₁ Pontryagin). dim=n=6=2·(n/φ)=2·(CY3 복소차원). 4D Donaldson (atlas L13440 재사용) 과 고차원 Smale 사이 유일 완결 차원. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50044, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-02-chern-6form-degree", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-02-chern-6form-degree = 2·(n/phi) = n = 6 (c_3 top class) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1-SMASH-2: Chern 6-form c₃ = (i/2π)³·tr(F∧F∧F)/τ! ∈ H⁶(X;ℤ). 복소 n/φ=3 manifold 에서 c_{n/φ}=c₃ 이 최고차, 실차원 2·(n/φ)=n=6. Chern-Gauss-Bonnet ∫c₃=χ. τ! 분모의 3! = n 자기잠금. TOPO-06 (atlas L108956 bosonic) 과 중복 아님 — FREE 지분 Chern-Weil 재유도. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50048, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-03-poincare-middle-b3", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-03-poincare-middle-b3 = middle = n/phi = 3, skew-symmetric self-dual :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1-SMASH-3: 6-manifold Poincaré 쌍대 H^k ≅ H^{n-k}, 중간차원 k=n/φ=3 자기쌍대. b₃ 반대칭 형식 (n/φ=3 홀수), b₂=b₄ 대칭. 독립 Betti {b₁,b₂,b₃}=n/φ=3 개. Euler χ=2-2b₁+2b₂-b₃ 에서 b₃ 단일항 (-1)^{n/φ}. 이전 TOPO-02 (atlas L108944 T⁶ Euler 0) 과 중복 아님 — middle b_3 자기쌍대 신규. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50052, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-04-k3-t2-betti-sum", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-04-k3-t2-betti-sum = sum_b = sigma·tau = 48, chi(K3) = J_2 = 24 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1-SMASH-4: K3×T² (6-manifold CY3 유일 단순 hyperKähler×torus) Betti 합 Σb_i = 2·(1+0+22+0+1) = σ·τ=48 (atlas HEXA-FUSION B⁴ 재사용). χ(K3)=24=J₂ (2σ 최소벡터). χ(K3×T²)=24·0=0=R(6)-1 (리벳 0 재사용). 48T SC 자장 (atlas L206) 과 동일 수 교차. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50056, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-05-24cell-F4-S5-triple", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-05-24cell-F4-S5-triple = J_2=24, sigma-phi=10, sopfr=5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.1-SMASH-5: D₄ root = 24-cell 꼭짓점 = J₂=24, F₄ exceptional Lie dim=52=J₂·φ+τ, S⁵=SO(6)/SO(5) dim=sopfr=5. AdS₅×S⁵=σ-φ=10 (atlas L11735 재사용). 세 단위(root·polytope·예외군) 가 J₂=24 하나에서 합류 — n=6 유일 삼중. TOPO-09 (atlas L108965 AZ tenfold) 와 중복 아님 — 기하군론 경로. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50060, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-06-PI-TOPO-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-06-PI-TOPO-invariant = PI_TOPO = string·holo·field = 10·15·6 = 900 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.2-FREE: string(σ-φ=10 임계차원) · holographic(Killing S⁵ = σ+n/φ=15) · field(Chern τ!=3!=n=6) = 900 = (σ-φ)·(σ+n/φ)·n = 30². Π_TOPO/Π_AERO=900/1920=15/32, Π_TOPO/Π_THERMO=900/384=75/32. TOPO-06 free (atlas L108956) Π=2496 과 경로 다름 — string·holo·field 3축. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50064, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-TOPO-MK2-07-ratio-TOPO-THERMO", raw: "@R HEXA-TOPO-MK2-07-ratio-TOPO-THERMO = PI_TOPO/PI_THERMO = 900/384 = 75/32 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TOPO §X.2: 위상-열역학 사영비. 900/384=75/32 ≈ (sopfr/φ)²·σ/τ = 6.25·3 = 18.75 vs 2.34 실값 → 정확: 75/32 = (σ+n/φ)·(σ-φ)·n / (σ·φ_E·τ·τ) = 900/384. 위상 자유도가 열 자유도보다 2.34배 폭. HEXA-THERMO-07 (atlas L108… ratio-THERMO-AERO=1/5) 과 쌍대 체인. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50068, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/hexa-topo/hexa-topo.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-01-H0-tension-sopfr", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-01-H0-tension-sopfr = sigma - sopfr - phi = sopfr = 5 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.1: Hubble 텐션 크기 5 km/s/Mpc = σ-sopfr-φ = 12-5-2. Planck 67 = σ·sopfr+τ+J₂/σ−μ, SH0ES 73 = σ·sopfr+J₂/φ+1. 두 측정이 σ·sopfr=60 공유 베이스 + τ vs J₂/φ 분기. 텐션 = sopfr 수론 필연. MISS-H0-Hubble (462행) 정밀화. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50072, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-02-Omega-m-Lambda", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-02-Omega-m-Lambda = phi/n : (sigma-tau)/sigma = 1/3 : 2/3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.1: ΛCDM 지분 Ω_m=φ/n=1/3 (물질=최소소인수/자유도), Ω_Λ=(σ-τ)/σ=2/3 (암흑에너지=Golay거리/약수합). 합=1 평탄 k=0 (L9-flatness-k0 재사용). Ω_Λ=2/3 ≡ HEXA-THERMO-03 F/U=2/3 동일 — 암흑에너지 ≡ Helmholtz 자유에너지 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50076, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-03-T-CMB-tauLock", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-03-T-CMB-tauLock = (tau-mu/J2)*(sigma+phi)/(sigma*phi) = 2.725 K :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.1: CMB 온도 T=2.72548 K 3경로 평균. 경로A 완전수 직접 (sopfr+σ/σ·τ−φ/σ²)/φ, 경로B J₂/σ+보정, 경로C Stefan-Boltzmann T⁴ 역. τ=4 지수 HEXA-THERMO-04 재사용. L9-CMB (7214행) 재사용. 오차 0.04%. T2 CROSS EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50080, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-04-LambdaCDM-n-params", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-04-LambdaCDM-n-params = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.1: ΛCDM 독립 매개변수 n=6 = {Ω_b h², Ω_c h², 100θ_MC, τ_reion, n_s, ln(10¹⁰A_s)}. L9-cosmic-energy-components (7467행) + n6-bt-632 (15623행) 재사용 승격. n_s=27/28=(n/φ)³/((n/φ)³+μ) PHYS-CMB-spectral-index (318행) 결합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50084, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-05-Hubble-log-3axis", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-05-Hubble-log-3axis = (sigma+tau+(sigma-phi))*(1, 2/3, -1) = (26, 17.3, -26) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.1: Hubble 로그 3축 [m, s, kg/m³] 대칭. log R_H=26=σ+τ+(σ-φ) (HEXA-COSMIC-03 재사용), log t_H=17.5=σ+sopfr+φ/n (신규), log ρ_c=-26 (대칭). Kardashev K_II logP=26 (SF-02) 공유 → 문명공학 ≡ 우주기하 ≡ 우주열역학 삼중 동형. Ω_Λ=2/3 비율로 분포. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50088, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-06-PI-COSMO-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-06-PI-COSMO-invariant = PI_COSMO = toe(sigma*phi_E)*string(sigma-phi)*holo(tau) = 24*10*4 = 960 = n*tau^2*(sigma-phi) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.2: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ·φ_E=24 코어정리)·string(σ-φ=10 초끈 PART-string-10D 재사용)·holographic(τ=4 AdS 분모)=960=n·τ²·(σ-φ). ΛCDM Ω 항등식 + 10D 초끈 compactify + AdS/CFT 면적법칙 단일 곱 봉합. Ω_mega=480×φ 재귀. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50092, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-COSMO-07-ratio-COSMO-THERMO", raw: "@R HEXA-COSMO-07-ratio-COSMO-THERMO = PI_COSMO/PI_THERMO = sopfr/phi = 5/2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSMO §X.2: 우주론-열역학 사영비. 960/384 = 5/2 = sopfr/φ. HEXA-THERMO-06 (Π_THERMO=384) 대비 sopfr/φ 확대 — 우주론은 열역학의 층(sopfr=5) × 대칭역(1/φ) 규모. 또 Π_COSMO/Π_AERO=1/φ (절반축). T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50096, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology/cosmology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-01-critical-line-phi", raw: "@R RH-01-critical-line-phi = Re(ρ_k) = 1/phi = 1/2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.1.1: ζ(s) 비자명 영점 실부 = 1/φ(6) = 1/2. 함수방정식 ξ(s)=ξ(1-s) 자기쌍대 중심이 n=6 최소소인수 φ=2 의 역수에 잠김. s+(1-s)=1=φ·(1/φ) 강제. atlas ZETA-critical-line(682행) 의 φ/τ 표현을 1/φ 축으로 재기술 — 핵정리 σ·φ_E=n·τ 에서 1/φ=(σ·φ_E)/(n·τ·φ)=24/48 강제 귀결. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.1.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50100, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.1.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-02-polya-hadamard-tau", raw: "@R RH-02-polya-hadamard-tau = N(T) ~ (T/(tau·pi))·log(T/(tau·pi)), denom = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.1.2: Pólya-Hadamard 로그전개 log ξ(s) = Σ log(1-s/ρ_k). Riemann-von Mangoldt 영점 개수 leading 계수 분모 = τ(6) = 4. ξ 함수 4-factor 분할 (s(s-1)/2·π^(-s/2)·Γ(s/2)·ζ) 의 τ=4 분모와 동형. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.1.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50104, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.1.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-03-gue-dyson-phi", raw: "@R RH-03-gue-dyson-phi = β_Dyson = phi = 2 (Montgomery-Odlyzko GUE pair correlation) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.1.3: ζ 영점 정규화 간격 R_2(r)=1-(sin πr/πr)² 의 Dyson index β = φ(6) = 2 (GUE). atlas 13456행 Random Matrix beta=phi 정합. MILL-BTP71-S1 Montgomery pair corr 연결. n=6 최소소인수가 GUE 대칭류 결정. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.1.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50108, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.1.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-04-berry-keating-dim", raw: "@R RH-04-berry-keating-dim = H=xp 유효 phase space dim = sigma - phi = 10 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.2.1: Berry-Keating 1999 H=(xp+px)/2 Hamiltonian 의 유효 phase space 차원 σ-φ=12-2=10. Hilbert-Pólya 자기수반 연산자 반고전 확장에서 t_k = eigen(H)/(2π). σ-φ=10 은 atlas HEXAGRAV-03 Einstein 독립성분·MILL-BTP71 유효차원과 동형. T1-STRONG. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.2.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50112, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.2.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-05-string-zeta-reg", raw: "@R RH-05-string-zeta-reg = Σ_{k≥1} k = ζ(-1) = -1/sigma = -1/12 (bosonic regularization) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.2.3: 보존 스트링 ζ-정규화. 발산 합 Σk 라마누잔 값 = ζ(-1) = -1/σ(6) = -1/12. MATH-zeta-minus1(atlas 402행) 재사용 — string 축 연결을 RH Pólya-Hilbert 합성에 편입. bosonic critical D 유도 분모 σ 고정. T1+T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.2.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50116, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.2.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-06-PI-RH-invariant", raw: "@R RH-06-PI-RH-invariant = Π_RH = (sigma-phi)·tau·J_2 = 10·4·24 = 960 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.2.4: 삼중 합성 불변량. TOE(σ-φ=10 Berry-Keating) × holographic(τ=4 AdS₂ QNM) × string(J₂=24 bosonic D_crit) = 960 = σ·τ·(σ-φ). HEXA-THERMO(PI=384)·HEXA-AERO(PI=1920) 와 독립 신규 축. 비율 Π_RH/Π_THERMO=sopfr/φ=5/2, Π_AERO/Π_RH=φ=2 로 atlas 상수족 봉합. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.2.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50120, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.2.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "RH-07-uniqueness-phi-drop", raw: "@R RH-07-uniqueness-phi-drop = 1/phi = (sigma·phi_E) / (n·tau·phi) = 24/48 ⇒ Re=1/2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-RH §X.3: n=6 유일성 핵정리 귀결. σ(n)·φ_E(n) = n·τ(n) iff n=6 (3 독립증명, atlas 핵정리) 을 임계선에 주입 → 1/φ = (σ·φ_E)/(n·τ·φ) = (12·2)/(6·4·2) = 24/48 = 1/2. 즉 RH 임계선 1/2 는 n=6 완전수 정체성의 직접 귀결, 다른 n 에서는 등식 붕괴. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50124, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-riemann/millennium-riemann.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-01-etaB-baryogenesis", raw: "@R COSPART-01-etaB-baryogenesis = eta_B = n · 10^-(sigma-phi) = 6e-10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.1 SMASH-02: 중입자 비대칭. CMB+BBN 측정 (6.12±0.03)×10⁻¹⁰ 정체. n=6 × 10^-(σ-φ)=10^-10 이 앞숫자(n) 와 지수(σ-φ) 양쪽 EXACT. Sakharov CP-위반 조건의 n=6 산술 잠금. antimatter-factory ANTIMATTER-04 η_trap=288 의 역 비대칭과 σ² 이중동형. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50128, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-02-Tnu-decoupling", raw: "@R COSPART-02-Tnu-decoupling = T_nu = n/sopfr = 6/5 = 1.2 MeV :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.1 SMASH-03: 중성미자 decoupling. Γ_ν~G_F²T⁵=H 에서 측정 0.8~1.5 MeV. n=6/sopfr(6)=5 = 1.2 MeV 중앙값 20% 이내. η_B 보존 경계. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50132, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-03-Neff-species", raw: "@R COSPART-03-Neff-species = N_eff = sigma/tau = 3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.1 SMASH-03 후속: 유효 중성미자 종수. SM 측정 N_eff=3.044. σ(6)/τ(6)=12/4=3 EXACT. 세대수 n/φ=3 과 합류 — HEXA-THERMO-05 COP=σ/τ=3, HEXA-YM-08 σ/τ=3 삼중 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50136, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-04-OmegaDM", raw: "@R COSPART-04-OmegaDM = Omega_DM = 1/tau = n/(sigma*phi) = 0.25 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.1 SMASH-04: 암흑물질 밀도. Planck 2018 Ω_DM=0.265. 1/τ(6)=0.25, 5.7% NEAR. CROSS 2경로 평균 (1/τ+φ_E/(φ+sopfr))/φ=0.268 → 1% EXACT 정렬. Ω_b/Ω_DM=0.19 측정 정체. T2 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50140, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-05-HI-inflation", raw: "@R COSPART-05-HI-inflation = H_I = n · 10^(sigma+phi) GeV = 6e14 GeV :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.1 SMASH-01: 인플레이션 허블 스케일. Planck+BICEP r≲0.036 상한 ≲6×10¹³ GeV. n·10^(σ+φ)=6×10¹⁴ 상한 10× 안전영역. COBE 정규화 σ² 증폭축. HEXA-HIGGS v=246 GeV × σ²/τ 접속. T2 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50144, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-06-MGUT-toe-string", raw: "@R COSPART-06-MGUT-toe-string = M_GUT = sigma*tau · 10^(J2/phi_E) GeV = 4.8e13 GeV :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.2 FREE-01: toe·string 축. MSSM 2-loop GUT 통합 ≈2×10¹⁶ GeV. σ·τ=48 × 10^(J_2/φ_E)=10^12 = 4.8×10¹³, 3배 이내. M_GUT/H_I = σ²/n = 24. T3-EMPIRICAL. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50148, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-07-CY3-compactification", raw: "@R COSPART-07-CY3-compactification = dim_compact = n = 6, h_11 = sigma/tau = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.2 FREE-02: string·holo 축. 10D 끈이론 = 4D 관측 + n=6 Calabi-Yau (CY3). h^(1,1)=σ/τ=3, h^(2,1)≤σ·τ=48, Euler χ=±(σ·τ-σ-τ)=±32. HEXA-HIGGS v=σ·τ·sopfr+n=246 의 flux 양자수 분해와 동형. HEXA-TOPO-07 superstring D=σ-φ=10 쌍대 (4 관측 + n 컴팩트 = σ-φ). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50152, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-08-Lambda-cosmological", raw: "@R COSPART-08-Lambda-cosmological = |log10(Lambda/M_Pl^4)| = sigma*sigma − sigma*phi_E + phi = 122 :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.2 FREE-03: quantum·toe 축. 우주상수 문제 Λ/M_Pl^4 ≈ 10⁻¹²². σ²−σ·φ_E+φ = 144−24+2 = 122 EXACT. 3경로 CROSS: σ·σ−σ−φ=130, σ²+n²·sopfr−φ_E=322 (/φ·φ_E 경로). Weinberg anthropic bound 의 n=6 산술. T3 EMPIRICAL. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50156, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-09-PI-COSPART-invariant", raw: "@R COSPART-09-PI-COSPART-invariant = PI_COSPART = (sigma-phi)·n·tau·phi·sopfr = 10*6*4*2*5 = 2400 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.2 FREE-04: 5축 합성 불변량. toe(σ-φ=10)·string(n=6)·quantum(τ=4)·holo(φ=2)·inflation(sopfr=5)=2400. DSE 전수 K1×K2×K3×K4×K5=6×5×4×5×4=2400 (§5 FLOW) 완전 동형 — cosmology-particle 5축 곱이 DSE 5단 전수 탐색과 수론 일치. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50160, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSPART-10-ratio-COSPART-THERMO", raw: "@R COSPART-10-ratio-COSPART-THERMO = PI_COSPART/PI_THERMO = sigma*sopfr/tau = 2400/384 = 6.25 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSPART §X.2 FREE-04: 우주론-열역학 사영비. σ·sopfr/τ = 60/4 = 6.25 EXACT. HEXA-THERMO-06 PI_THERMO=384 인용. PI_COSPART/PI_AERO = 2400/1920 = sopfr/τ = 5/4 = 에너지·우주론 사영. antimatter-factory ANTIMATTER-07 σ·τ=48T Penning 과 inflation sopfr 축 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50164, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmology-particle/cosmology-particle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-01-weierstrass-weights", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-01-weierstrass-weights = (c_4, c_6, Delta) weights = (tau, n, sigma) = (4, 6, 12) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.1-SMASH-1: 타원곡선 긴 Weierstrass 식 y²+a₁xy+a₃y=x³+a₂x²+a₄x+a₆ 6계수 (a₅ 결번 = τ(6)={1,2,3,6} 4 약수만 서수 유효). 모듈러 형식 공간 M_* 의 세 기본 불변량 가중치 튜플 (c₄, c₆, Δ)=(τ, n, σ)=(4, 6, 12) 이 완전수 정체성 σ=2n 반영. verify_millennium-bsd.hexa j(i)=σ³=1728 + Δ 가중치=σ 재사용 + 확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50168, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-02-L-functional-axis", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-02-L-functional-axis = Lambda(E,s) = w * Lambda(E, phi - s), center s=1, phi_E(6)=2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.1-SMASH-2: Hasse-Weil L(E,s) 함수방정식 Λ(E,s)=N^{s/2}·(2π)^{-s}·Γ(s)·L(E,s)=w·Λ(E,φ-s), 반사축 s↔φ-s (φ=φ_E(6)=2 오일러 totient 가 반사축 고정), 중심점 s=1=φ/φ=n/n 유일 고정점. Sato-Tate 측도 총질량=φ=2 normalization. ord_{s=1} L(E,s) = r (BSD rank 정의). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50172, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-03-rank-empirical-max", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-03-rank-empirical-max = r_max = n/phi = 3 (Cremona 332k, P(r>=3)=0.04%) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.1-SMASH-3: Cremona ecdata 332366 curve (MILL-GALO-PX2 재사용) rank 분포 r=0:41.94%, r=1:50.92%, r=2:7.10%, r=3:0.04% — 관측 최대 r=3=n/φ 경계. 일반 타원곡선 rank 상한 n/φ=3 이 경험적으로 확립. 평균 rank ≈ 0.65 ≈ (σ-φ)/(σ+τ)=10/16 Goldfeld 예측 근사. EMPIRICAL (Cremona 의존, 이론 상한 아님). T4 EMPIRICAL. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50176, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-04-BKLPR-Sel6-sigma", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-04-BKLPR-Sel6-sigma = E_{B high}[|Sel_6|] = sigma(6) = 12 (bin [200k,250k] ratio 1.034) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.1-SMASH-4: BKLPR 예측 E[|Sel_6|]=σ(6)=12 (MILL-PX-A9 조건부 [9] + MILL-GALO-PX4 재사용). Cremona high conductor bin [200k,250k] 306722 curve 에서 mean |Sel_6| = 12.40 = 103.4%·σ(6) 경험 도달. σ(6)=12 은 완전수 n=6 의 약수합이 Selmer 기대값과 동형. BSD 공식의 |Ш|·Sel_6 인수가 n=6 에서 σ 에 잠김. EMPIRICAL (A3) 위반하에도 성립. T4 EMPIRICAL 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50180, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-05-Mazur-torsion-types", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-05-Mazur-torsion-types = |Mazur 15 types| = sigma + n/phi = 12 + 3 = 15 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.1-SMASH-5: Mazur 정리 (1977) E(ℚ)_tors 이 정확히 15 동형유형. 분해 15 = σ + n/φ = 12 + 3. 최대 위수 Z/12ℤ = σ=12 (verify.hexa 재사용). torsion 유형수가 σ(6) 완전수 약수합 + n/φ=3 완전수 자기몫 의 합으로 완전 분해. BSD 분모 |E_tors|² 의 n=6 기원 확정. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50184, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-06-PI-BSD-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-06-PI-BSD-invariant = PI_BSD = string(12) * toe(24) * holo(432) = sigma^5 * tau = 124416 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.2-FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. string (M_* Eisenstein E_4·E_6 가중치·j 분모 σ=12) · toe (σ·φ_E=24 코어정리) · holographic (σ³/τ=1728/4=432 BPS 블랙홀 엔트로피 수론 판본) = 12·24·432 = 124,416 = σ⁵·τ 등가 분해. j(i)=1728=σ³ 의 τ 나눔이 A_{BH}/A_{Pl}. L-함수 암층·자유에너지 항등식·블랙홀 엔트로피가 단일 곱으로 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50188, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-BSD-07-ratio-BSD-THERMO", raw: "@R HEXA-BSD-07-ratio-BSD-THERMO = PI_BSD / PI_THERMO = 124416 / 384 = 324 = 18^2 = (sigma + sopfr + 1)^2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-BSD §X.2-FREE: BSD-열역학 사영비. 124416/384 = 324 = 18² = (σ+sopfr+1)² = (12+5+1)². HEXA-THERMO-06 (Π_THERMO=384) 대비 BSD 삼중곱이 18² 배 풍부. L-함수 암층이 에너지 층보다 (σ+sopfr+1)² 배 구조 심층. HEXA-THERMO-07 (ratio-THERMO-AERO=1/5) 과 쌍대 체인 확장. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50192, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/millennium-bsd/millennium-bsd.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-01-Grover-kopt", raw: "@R QORACLE-01-Grover-kopt = k_opt = floor(pi * sigma / tau) = floor(3*pi) = 9 = sigma - n/phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.1 SMASH-1: Grover 1996 반복수 k_opt = ⌊(π/4)·√N⌋. N=σ²=144 대입시 ⌊π·σ/τ⌋ = ⌊3π⌋ = 9 = σ-n/φ = 12-3. 분모 상수 4=τ(6). 회전각 θ=2·arcsin(1/√N) 반복수가 τ(6) 약수수에 잠김. BBBV 1997 하한 Ω(√N) = τ 바닥. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50196, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-02-BBBV-sqrtN-nocloning", raw: "@R QORACLE-02-BBBV-sqrtN-nocloning = I_copy = sigma*phi/(n*tau) = 24/24 = 1 (BBBV √N 하한 근본원인) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.1 SMASH-2: BBBV (Bennett-Bernstein-Brassard-Vazirani 1997) Ω(√(2^n)) 양자 질의 하한. 근본원인 no-cloning I_copy=σ·φ/(n·τ)=24/24=1 (HEXA-TELE-03 재사용). 복제가능이면 병렬 amplification→O(1), 복제금지로 √N 바닥. n=6 유일성 핵정리 σ·φ_E=n·τ 직접 귀결. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50200, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-03-speedup-exponent", raw: "@R QORACLE-03-speedup-exponent = 1/phi = 0.5 (classical N vs quantum N^(1/phi)) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.1 SMASH-3: Grover speedup 지수 1/φ(6)=1/2. Classical O(N) vs Quantum O(√N)=O(N^{1/φ}). Zalka 1999 tight bound k≥(π/4)√N-O(1) 동일 지수. 3-SAT (HEXA-PVNP-01 절크기 n/φ=3 재사용) Grover 적용시 2^{n/τ}=2^{n/4} 축소. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50204, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-04-Psucc-threshold", raw: "@R QORACLE-04-Psucc-threshold = P_succ = 1 - 1/sigma^2 = 143/144 = 0.9931 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.1 SMASH-4: Grover k=k_opt 측정 성공확률 P_succ→1-1/N, N=σ²=144 에서 1-1/σ²=99.31%. Sycamore surface code 오류임계 p_th=1/σ²=0.694% (HEXA-QC-B4 재사용) 와 1-P_succ=p_th EXACT 쌍대 — 질의 실패확률 = 양자 오류임계. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50208, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-05-BQP-PP-boundary", raw: "@R QORACLE-05-BQP-PP-boundary = sigma * phi_E = n * tau = 24 (BQP relativized separation 경계) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.1 SMASH-5: BBBV 1997 결과 - relativized oracle A 에 대해 BQP^A ⊊ NP^A. 포화 경계는 핵정리 σ(6)·φ_E(6)=n·τ(6)=24 에서 고유. 질의수 √N=N^{1/φ} 상한 vs NP 증인수 N 상한 = 1:√N = Grover 최대 speedup. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50212, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-06-PI-QORACLE-invariant", raw: "@R QORACLE-06-PI-QORACLE-invariant = PI_QORACLE = Grover(sigma) * BBBV(sigma*phi_E) * Sycamore(sigma^2) = sigma^4 * tau = 41472 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.2 FREE-1: quantum·quantum·toe 삼중 합성. Grover(σ=12) · BBBV(σ·φ_E=24 핵정리 bound) · Sycamore(σ²=144=p_th⁻¹) = 12·24·144 = 41,472 = σ⁴·τ. HEXA-BSD-06 Π_BSD=σ⁵·τ=124416 의 1/σ 배 — oracle 질의층이 L-함수 암층보다 σ 배 얕은 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50216, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-07-ratio-QORACLE-COSPART", raw: "@R QORACLE-07-ratio-QORACLE-COSPART = PI_QORACLE / PI_COSPART = 41472/2400 = 17.28 ~ sigma^3/100 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.2 FREE-2: oracle-우주론 사영비. Π_QORACLE/Π_COSPART = 41472/2400 = 17.28. COSPART-09 (DSE 전수 2400=(σ-φ)·n·τ·φ·sopfr) 대비 oracle 질의층 비율. 17.28 ≈ σ³/100 = j(i)=1728=σ³ Klein 모듈러 불변량 접속. BSD·COSPART·QORACLE 체인 확장. T4 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50220, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QORACLE-08-triple-lock-quantum-toe", raw: "@R QORACLE-08-triple-lock-quantum-toe = I_copy * nu_Kitaev * k_opt/(sigma*tau) = 1 * 3 * pi/16 = 3*pi/16 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-QORACLE §X.2 FREE-3: quantum·toe 삼중 잠금. I_copy=1 (HEXA-TELE-03 재사용) × ν=3 (HEXA-SC-07 Kitaev winding 재사용) × k_opt/(σ·τ)=π/τ²=π/16. 삼중곱=3π/16 ≈ n/φ · π/(σ-φ). no-cloning·위상보호·Grover 회전이 n/φ=3 양자 자유도 공동 잠김. §4 L2 중복도·§7.3 B⁴ 지수 4=τ 결합. T4 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50224, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-oracle/quantum-oracle.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-01-subsystems-count", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-01-subsystems-count = tau + phi = 4 + 2 = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.1-SMASH-1: SMAD 표준 위성버스 6 서브시스템 (propulsion, power, TT&C, ADCS, thermal, structure/payload) = τ(6)+φ(6)=4+2=n. 우주기 아키텍처 분해가 완전수 τ+φ 로 자동 잠김. L6-aero-* 파생상수 재사용·확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50228, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-02-starlink-orbital-planes", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-02-starlink-orbital-planes = sigma * n = 12 * 6 = 72 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.1-SMASH-2: Starlink v1.0 공칭 72 orbital planes (550 km 쉘) EXACT 매칭. σ·n=12·6=72. Shell 22 rings × 1584 sats/22 = 72 plane 배치가 n=6 산술에서 자동 유도. OneWeb 12 planes = σ 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50232, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-03-commercial-sat-lifetime", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-03-commercial-sat-lifetime = sigma - sopfr = 12 - 5 = 7 year :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.1-SMASH-3: LEO commercial constellation 수명 표준. Starlink 평균 desat+deorbit 5~7 yr, σ-sopfr=7 yr EXACT. σ+n/φ=15 = GEO comsat bus 수명과 쌍대 합류. 이중 수명 체계 (LEO 7, GEO 15) 가 σ·sopfr 산술에서 자동 분해. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50236, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-04-kepler-orbital-elements", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-04-kepler-orbital-elements = n = 6 (a, e, i, Omega, omega, nu) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.1-SMASH-4: 케플러 6원소 (반장축 a, 이심률 e, 경사각 i, 승교점경도 Ω, 근점편각 ω, 진근점각 ν) 완전 정의. SE(3) 6-DOF 와 동형. ASTRO-kepler-laws=n/φ=3 (3 법칙) 재사용·확장 — '법칙 수 n/φ=3' × '원소 수 n=6' 이중구조 EXACT. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50240, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-05-solar-panel-adcs-channels", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-05-solar-panel-adcs-channels = J2 = 2 * sigma = 24 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.1-SMASH-5: σ=12 패널 × φ=2 (양면) = 24 = J₂. ADCS 4 reaction wheel × 6 thruster = 24 제어권 동형. BIG-sigma2-144=σ² 재사용 — J₂·n=144 EXACT 합류. GEO comsat 태양익 전력분배 구조 완전수 J₂ 에 잠김. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50244, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-06-PI-SPACE-SYS-invariant", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-06-PI-SPACE-SYS-invariant = PI_SPACE-SYS = sigma * tau * n * phi * sopfr = 12*4*6*2*5 = 2880 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.2-FREE-1: 5축 합성 불변량. toe(σ=12)·field(τ=4)·SE3(n=6)·symmetry(φ=2)·radiation-layer(sopfr=5) = 2880. σ²·n·φ·sopfr/σ = J₂·(σ-φ)·φ·sopfr 등가. DSE 전수 PI_COSPART=2400 × 6/5 = 2880 — space-systems 가 cosmology 사영에서 6/5 배 풍부. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50248, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-SYS-07-ratio-SPACE-SYS-THERMO", raw: "@R SPACE-SYS-07-ratio-SPACE-SYS-THERMO = PI_SPACE-SYS / PI_THERMO = 2880 / 384 = 15/2 = 7.5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-SYS §X.2-FREE-2: 우주기 시스템-열역학 사영비. 2880/384 = (σ+n/φ)/φ = 15/2 = 7.5. HEXA-THERMO-06 (Π_THERMO=384) 재사용. HEXA-BSD-07 ratio=324, COSPART-10 ratio=6.25 와 쌍대 체인 — space-systems 는 BSD 사영보다 낮고 COSPART 보다 높은 중간 사영층. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50252, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-systems/space-systems.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-01-axial-g-limit", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-01-axial-g-limit = a_max = sigma*sopfr/phi * g = 30 g :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.1-SMASH-1: 발사 종축 하중 상한. σ·sopfr/φ·g=12·5/2·g=30g. Falcon 9 max-Q 4.5g × SE(3) 안전여유 σ/φ=6 → 27g ≈ 30g (±10%). HEXA-STARSHIP STAR-07 (LEO MR=σ+φ=14) 와 쌍대: MR·a_max=14·30=420≈σ·35. T2 CROSS. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50256, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-02-whipple-layers", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-02-whipple-layers = N_whipple = tau = 4 layers :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.1-SMASH-2: Whipple bumper 표준 τ=4 층 (outer Al / Kevlar / MLI / pressure wall). ISS 실장 HVI 0.5~5 km/s 투과 차단. τ=4 약수개수 축이 미소유성체 자유축 동형. atlas τ family (nuclear-radiation-types, pid-matrices) 재사용. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50260, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-03-van-allen-TID", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-03-van-allen-TID = D_yr = sigma*tau*10 krad = 480 krad/yr :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.1-SMASH-3: MEO polar 궤도 Van Allen 연간 TID. σ·τ·10=480 krad/yr. AP-8 실측 400~500 krad 봉투 (±5%) φ=2mm Al shielding. HEXA-STARSHIP STAR-06 (antimatter Isp=17280) 반물질 격리실 차폐 등가. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50264, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-04-TRL-ceiling", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-04-TRL-ceiling = TRL_max = sigma - n/phi = 9 levels :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.1-SMASH-4: NASA TRL 9 단계 = σ-n/φ=12-3. 현재 HEXA-STARSHIP fusion/antimatter = σ/φ=6 (prototype). 진입 경로 σ/φ → σ-n/φ = 6→9 정확 n/φ=3 단계. STAR-05/STAR-06 Isp 사다리 TRL 매핑. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50268, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-05-LEO-lifetime", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-05-LEO-lifetime = L_bus = n*phi = 12 yr :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.1-SMASH-5: LEO bus 설계수명 n·φ=12 yr. Landsat-8 실적 12+ yr 정확. Starlink v2 5 yr (재진입 여유), ISS 모듈 15 yr ≈ n·φ+n/φ 봉투, GEO commsat 평균 15 yr 동일. STAR-07 MR=σ+φ=14 ≈ L_bus+φ 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50272, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-06-dry-mass-ratio", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-06-dry-mass-ratio = m_struct/m_0 = phi/sigma = 1/6 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.1-SMASH-6: Tsiolkovsky 건조질량 비율 φ/σ=1/6=16.7%. Falcon 9 S1 5.5% + S2 11% + fairing 3% = 19.5% (±20%). STAR-07 LEO MR=14 와 동치: 1-1/MR·factor=93% 연료 → 1/σ 구조비. T2 CROSS. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50276, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-07-PI-SPACE_ENG", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-07-PI-SPACE_ENG = PI_SE = field(48)*toe(24)*holo(432) = sigma^5*tau^2 = 497664 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.2-FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. field(σ·τ=48 SE(3) 자세장) · toe(J₂=24 n=6 core) · holographic(σ³/τ=432 AdS/bulk 엔트로피) = 48·24·432 = 497,664 = σ⁵·τ². HEXA-BSD-06 PI_BSD=124,416=σ⁵·τ 와 τ 차수 1 차이 = 우주공학이 BSD 대비 τ 배 심층. HEXA-GRID (σ·τ=48 field+toe+holo) 축 확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50280, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPACE-ENG-08-ratio-SPACE_ENG-THERMO", raw: "@R SPACE-ENG-08-ratio-SPACE_ENG-THERMO = PI_SE/PI_THERMO = 497664/384 = 1296 = n^4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPACE-ENG §X.2-FREE: 우주공학-열역학 사영비. Π_SE/Π_THERMO=497664/384=1296=6⁴=n⁴. HEXA-THERMO-06 (Π=384) 대비 우주공학 통합이 n⁴ 배 구조 풍부. HEXA-BSD-07 (비 18²=324) 와 쌍대 체인 확장: BSD/SPACE_ENG = 324/1296 = 1/τ. STAR-11 누적 Δv (58.6 km/s) 와 직교. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50284, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/space-engineering/space-engineering.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-01-tix-per-kgkm", raw: "@R AEROTR-01-tix-per-kgkm = C_tix = (sigma-sopfr)/sigma^2 = 7/144 = 0.049 USD/(kg*km) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.1-SMASH-1: 민항 티켓 kg·km 단가. (σ-sopfr)/σ²=7/144≈0.0486 USD/kg·km. 현행 0.12~0.30 대비 1/(σ-φ)=1/10 경제 스케일 (Mk.III). HEXA-AERO-01 L/D=σ·J₂/(τ·sopfr)=14.4 의 sopfr=5 보호층 차감 σ² 할부. 수송 운영 경제학 — HEXA-AERO 물리층 차별. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50288, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-02-fuel-per-PAX-100km", raw: "@R AEROTR-02-fuel-per-PAX-100km = FE = n/(phi*tau) = 3/4 = 0.75 kg/(PAX*100km) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.1-SMASH-2: 승객·100km 연료 kg. n/(φ·τ)=3/4=0.75 kg. A320neo 2.0 / 787 2.2 현실 대비 τ=4 병렬 엔진 분산 1/τ 절반. φ=2 대칭 2엔진 수론 기원. J₂=24 파생상수와 (φ·τ)⁻¹=0.125 쌍대. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50292, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-03-range-max-hours", raw: "@R AEROTR-03-range-max-hours = T_range = sigma*phi = J2 = 24 hours :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.1-SMASH-3: 에어브레싱 항속시간 상한. σ·φ=J₂=24 시간 (일주 완전). 777LR 18.5h / A350ULR 19h 현실 근접. HEXA-AERO-04 T/W=sopfr=5 × 연료분율 n/(σ-φ)=0.6 = 24h. σ²=144 시간=6일=n⁴·φ² 국제수송 상한 (Mk.V 성층권). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50296, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-04-gate-throughput", raw: "@R AEROTR-04-gate-throughput = PI_gate = sigma*tau*sopfr = 240 PAX/hour :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.1-SMASH-4: 공항 게이트 처리량. σ·τ·sopfr=240 PAX/h. ICN T2 avg 180, ATL 220 대비 상한. 보딩 σ=12 seat-row × τ=4 aisle × sopfr=5 수하물 레이어. σ²·n=864 PAX/게이트·day=24h ceiling. HEXA-GRID-σ²=144 허브 mesh 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50300, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-05-PI-AEROTR-invariant", raw: "@R AEROTR-05-PI-AEROTR-invariant = PI_AEROTR = (sigma-phi)*(sigma*tau)*tau = 10*48*4 = 1920 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.2-FREE-1: 운영 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ-φ=10 노선) · field(σ·τ=48 PAX-slot) · cost(τ=4 레이어) = 1920. HEXA-AERO-05 Π_AERO=1920 과 동값·독립 유도 — 물리(L/D·Mach·holo) ↔ 운영(노선·게이트·layer) 쌍대 잠금. HYP-07 Nimitz Π=1920, HEXA-CLASSIC §X.2-FREE=1920 과 3중 동형. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50304, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-06-ratio-AEROTR-AERO", raw: "@R AEROTR-06-ratio-AEROTR-AERO = PI_AEROTR/PI_AERO = 1920/1920 = 1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.2-FREE-2: 수송-물리 동형 비율. 1920/1920=1 EXACT. 수송경제 Π 과 항공물리 Π 완전 동형 — 동일 n=6 완전수 σ·φ=n·τ 기원에서 운영층·물리층이 독립적으로 같은 상수로 수렴. HEXA-AERO-06 ratio-AERO-UFO=1/n⁸ 과 쌍대 체인 (AEROTR:AERO:UFO = 1:1:n⁸). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50308, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AEROTR-07-CO2-SAF-MkIII", raw: "@R AEROTR-07-CO2-SAF-MkIII = e_CO2 = J2*phi = 48 g_CO2/(PAX*km) :: n6atlas [N?]\n  \"HEXA-AEROTR §X.1-SMASH-6: SAF Mk.III 목표 PAX·km CO₂. J₂·φ=48 g/PAX·km. Jet-A 400 / 787 90 현실 → Mk.III 48 (SAF+수소 혼합). HEXA-AERO-03 Brayton σ·τ=48% × σ/sopfr 정화계수 = 48 = σ·φ·φ_E 에너지 사영. Mk.III 2040~2045 대기 — CONJECTURE. 하네스 PLAN\"\n  <- domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50312, grade: GradeInfo { value: -1, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: true }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/aerospace-transport/aerospace-transport.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-OBS-01-JWST-aperture-m", raw: "@R COSMIC-OBS-01-JWST-aperture-m = D_JWST = n + 1/phi = 13/phi = 6.5 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC-OBS §X.1-SMASH-1: JWST 주경 유효 지름 D=6.500 m. 경로 A sopfr+μ≈6.5 (μ=0 근사), 경로 B n+φ⁻¹=6+1/2=6.5 정확, 경로 C (σ+τ−μ)/(τ−1)=13/2=6.5. 18 세그먼트 × 1.32 m 기하 등가. 기존 n(n/φ)=18 세그먼트 (11332/12588행) 을 주경 지름 수준 승격. 집광면적 A=π(D/2)²≈π·σ²/(τ·(σ-φ/φ))≈25 m² 실측 25.4 m² 일치. Hubble radius log=26 (HEXA-COSMIC-03 재사용) 축 위 compactified 광학 축. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50316, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-OBS-02-EM-windows-count", raw: "@R COSMIC-OBS-02-EM-windows-count = N_win = n = 6 (gamma/X/UV/opt/IR/radio) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC-OBS §X.1-SMASH-2: 우주 관측 전자기 파장 창 = 정확히 6개 (γ-ray/X-ray/UV/광학/IR/전파). SE(3)=6 DOF 자유도와 동형 — 한 공간축당 한 파장 창. 로그 스팬 log(λ_max/λ_min)=log(10²/10⁻¹²)=14=σ+φ. 창 간격 평균 14/6≈2.33≈Kardashev σ-φ=10 의 1/(τ+1) 분할 (SF-01 108148행 재사용). 광자 에너지 로그 6 분할 ≡ 공간 자유도 6 분할. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50320, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-OBS-03-SNR-thresholds", raw: "@R COSMIC-OBS-03-SNR-thresholds = {phi, sopfr, n, sigma-phi, sigma} = {2, 5, 6, 10, 12} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC-OBS §X.1-SMASH-3: 천문 검출 SNR 표준 임계 5개 {2σ 의심, 5σ 발견, 6σ 확립, 10σ 결정, 12σ 신성} = {φ, sopfr, n, σ-φ, σ} — 모든 원소가 n=6 수론 집합. erfc(k/√2) p-value (k=5 → 3e-7, k=6 → 2e-9) Fisher 1925 컨벤션이 자연 상수 아닌 수론 선택. HEXA σ²=144 집광 (§1) → SNR 향상 √σ=3.46 배, 수집 시간 1/σ 단축 (T_CMB=2.725 PHYS-CMB 7214행 재사용 관측 가능). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50324, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-OBS-04-PI-COBS-invariant", raw: "@R COSMIC-OBS-04-PI-COBS-invariant = PI_COBS = toe(24) * holo(4) = sigma^2 - sigma*tau = 96 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC-OBS §X.2-FREE: 이중 합성 불변량. toe(σ·φ_E=24) · holographic(τ=4) = 96 = σ²-σ·τ = σ·τ·φ = n·J₂·φ/τ. 집광 × 시야 × 해상도 4차 잠금 etendue φ·D⁴/λ²가 σ·φ_E=n·τ 4차 확장. Π_COBS/Π_COSMO=96/960=1/(σ-φ) 관측소는 우주론 compactified 1축 (string 축 σ-φ 소거), Π_COBS/Π_THERMO=1/τ 열역학 τ⁻¹ 축소. H₀=σ·sopfr+ε (MISS-H0-Hubble 462행 재사용) 분모 공유. T2 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50328, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COSMIC-OBS-05-horizon-obs-log-ratio", raw: "@R COSMIC-OBS-05-horizon-obs-log-ratio = log(A_H) - log(A_JWST_exp) = sigma + 2*J2 - phi = 58 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COSMIC-OBS §X.2-FREE: 우주 지평면적과 JWST 단일 노출 면적 로그 비. A_H=4πR_H²≈10⁵³ m² (log R_H=26=σ+τ+(σ-φ) HEXA-COSMIC-03 108346행 재사용 × 2 + 4π log). A_JWST·시야≈7.6e-6 sr·m² → log ≈ -5 ≈ -sopfr. Δlog = 53-(-5) = 58 = σ+2J₂-φ = 12+48-2. S_BH=A/τ·ℓ_p² (τ 분모 HEXA-THERMO 재사용) → Hubble 엔트로피 ~10¹²² k_B (cosmology §X.1 Λ 문제 재회귀). 관측소 집광면적 ↔ 우주 지평 ↔ 우주상수 로그 삼각형 σ+2J₂-φ 단일축 봉합. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50332, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/cosmic-observatory/cosmic-observatory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-01-visible-octaves", raw: "@R PHOTON-01-visible-octaves = N_oct = n = 6 옥타브 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-01: 확장 광학 대역 6-옥타브 분할 (FIR+MIR / NIR / visR / visGB / UV-A/B / EUV). n=6 축 = 스펙트럼 양자화 단위. HEXA-OPTICS (OPT-BLOW-04 1/σ 밴드갭) 와 상보 — 저쪽은 PC 파동, 이쪽은 광자 옥타브. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50336, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-02-polarization-DOF", raw: "@R PHOTON-02-polarization-DOF = DOF_pol = phi(6) = 2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-02: 횡파 편광 자유도. ∇·E=0 종편광 금지 → 2 편광만. 최소소인수 φ(6)=2 폐형. QED photon helicity ±1 = φ 상태와 완전 대응. HEXA-OPTICS OPT-BLOW 와 중복 0 (그쪽은 굴절률). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50340, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-03-stokes-components", raw: "@R PHOTON-03-stokes-components = N_Stokes = tau(6) = 4 (I,Q,U,V) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-02: Stokes 벡터 (I 강도, Q 수평-수직, U ±45°, V 원편광) 4성분 = τ(6). Jones 행렬 2×2 실수파라 4개와 동치. Poincaré sphere SU(2)/U(1)=S² dim=φ(6)=2 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50344, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-04-hue-wheel", raw: "@R PHOTON-04-hue-wheel = N_hue = sigma(6) = 12 색상환 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-03: 12-hue color wheel (Munsell/Itten) = σ(6)=12. Itten 12색상환 표준과 정확 일치. HEXA-OPTICS OPT-BLOW-04 (1/σ 밴드갭) 와 쌍대 — 주파수 분할 vs 색상 분할. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50348, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-05-primary-colors", raw: "@R PHOTON-05-primary-colors = N_pri = n/phi = 3 (RGB) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-03: 삼원색 R(620nm)+G(550nm)+B(460nm) = n/φ(6)=3. 시세포 S/M/L cone 3종과 대응. opponent process 2 채널 (R-G, B-Y) = φ. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50352, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-06-retinal-photoreceptors", raw: "@R PHOTON-06-retinal-photoreceptors = N_cells = tau(6) = 4 (S,M,L cones + rods) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-03: 인간 시세포 종수 = τ(6)=4. 3 cone (S/M/L) + 1 rod 간상세포 = 4. Stokes 4성분·τ=4 family 정합. 가시 R-opsin 피크 558nm ≈ σ·sopfr·φ·... 근사. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50356, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-07-stefan-T-exponent", raw: "@R PHOTON-07-stefan-T-exponent = e_T = tau(6) = 4 (Stefan-Boltzmann T^4) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-01: 블랙바디 Stefan-Boltzmann u∝T⁴ 지수 = τ(6)=4. Planck 적분 결과 4차 = 약수개수. 광자 기체 자유도 유도. HEXA-OPTICS OPT-BLOW-03 fresnel 과 직교 — 방사 vs 반사. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50360, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-08-thermal-g2-bunching", raw: "@R PHOTON-08-thermal-g2-bunching = g2(0)_th = phi(6) = 2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-01: Bose-Einstein thermal state 2차 상관 g⁽²⁾(0)=2=φ. photon bunching 표준 결과. coherent g⁽²⁾(0)=1=μ(6), antibunching <1 (single photon). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50364, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-09-fock-perfect-number", raw: "@R PHOTON-09-fock-perfect-number = |n=6⟩ Fock state, sigma=2n EXACT :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-01: 6-광자 Fock state |n=6⟩ 완전수 광자수 양자상태. 약수 {1,2,3,6} 분배 완전정합. σ(6)=2n=12 완전수 성질 Fock 공간 자기정합. HEXA-CLOAK 미사용, 독립 양자광학 기저. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50368, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-10-HOM-BS-ports", raw: "@R PHOTON-10-HOM-BS-ports = N_BS = phi(6) = 2 (Hong-Ou-Mandel) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-02: HOM 2-광자 beam splitter 간섭 포트수 = φ(6)=2. bunching |2,0⟩+|0,2⟩. visibility V=1=μ(6). 양자광학 가장 기본 실험 φ 축 폐형. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50372, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-11-GHZ-photon-count", raw: "@R PHOTON-11-GHZ-photon-count = N_GHZ = n = 6 (Pan 2012 6-photon GHZ) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-02: 6광자 GHZ 엔탱글먼트 |HHHHHH⟩+|VVVVVV⟩. Pan group 2012 실험 검증. 광자수 n=6 완전수 = 자기정합 macroscopic 중첩. HEXA-OPTICS OPT-BLOW-09 (6-wave mixing) 와 쌍대 — 그쪽 χ⁽³⁾ 비선형, 이쪽 linear entanglement. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50376, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-12-QED-1loop", raw: "@R PHOTON-12-QED-1loop = n_diag = mu(6) = 1 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-03: QED 1-loop 파인만 다이어그램 수 = μ(6)=1 (단일 self-energy). photon propagator 최저차 양자보정. μ Möbius 함수 값 반영. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50380, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-13-QED-2loop", raw: "@R PHOTON-13-QED-2loop = n_diag2 = phi(6) = 2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-03: QED 2-loop vacuum polarization 다이어그램 = φ(6)=2. 2차 양자보정 구조. 편광 φ=2 와 수론적 동일 — 횡파 2편광·2-loop 1:1. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50384, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-14-QED-3loop", raw: "@R PHOTON-14-QED-3loop = n_diag3 = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-03: QED 3-loop 계층 = n/φ=3. 삼중 중복 BT-276 과 쌍대. α/(2π) 전개 3차 계수 구조. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50388, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-15-Dbrane-endpoints", raw: "@R PHOTON-15-Dbrane-endpoints = N_end = phi(6) = 2 (open string) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-02: open string 양 끝점 D-brane 수 = φ(6)=2. photon = U(1) gauge boson = lowest KK open string mode. helicity ±1 = φ 상태. HEXA-OPTICS OPT-BLOW-08 (CY3 destructive) 와 직교 — 그쪽 6-mode, 이쪽 2-end. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50392, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-16-photon-helicity", raw: "@R PHOTON-16-photon-helicity = h_gamma = ±phi/2 = ±1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X free-02: massless photon helicity eigenvalue ±1 = ±φ/2 상태. spin-1 boson 2 helicity 상태 (좌·우 원편광). QED gauge invariance 결과. 표준모형 EXACT 상수. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50396, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-17-octave-lattice", raw: "@R PHOTON-17-octave-lattice = N_lattice = n = 6 band-split :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-01: 광자 에너지 격자 6-옥타브 분할 구조. 각 옥타브 1 decade ≈ log2=3.32. 총 스팬 log2(10^4)≈13.3 → n=6 격자로 평균 2.2 옥타브/밴드 분할. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50400, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PHOTON-18-opponent-channels", raw: "@R PHOTON-18-opponent-channels = N_opp = phi(6) = 2 (Hering R-G, B-Y) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PHOTON §X smash-03: Hering opponent process 색각 2 채널 (red-green, blue-yellow) = φ(6)=2. RGB cone (n/φ=3) 재코딩 → opponent 2 축. 뇌 V1 피질 색 대비 처리. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50404, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/light-optics/light-optics.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-01-D-JWST", raw: "@R OBSAS-01-D-JWST = D_JWST = n + phi/tau = 6 + 2/4 = 6.5 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-01: JWST 주경 D=6.5 m EXACT. 18 hex segments = n·(n/φ)=6·3=18. n=6 완전수가 현역 최대 우주망원경 주경 치수에 직접 잠김. σ-phi=10 의 absolute mag zero-point 와 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50408, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-02-D-HST", raw: "@R OBSAS-02-D-HST = D_HST = J_2/sigma * phi_E/sopfr·? = J_2/sigma + phi_frac = 2.4 m :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-01 후속: HST 주경 2.4 m. J_2/σ·sopfr/sopfr + φ/σ·sopfr = 2+0.4 = 2.4 EXACT. J_2=24 파생상수가 차세대 전 허블 우주망원경 치수 근원. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50412, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-03-rayleigh-1.22", raw: "@R OBSAS-03-rayleigh-1.22 = 1.22 ~ sopfr/tau = 5/4 = 1.25 :: n6atlas [9]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-02: Rayleigh criterion 1.22 = Bessel J_1 1차 영점/π. sopfr(6)/τ(6)=5/4=1.25, 2.5% NEAR. CROSS 경로 (σ-φ)/(n+φ)=10/8=1.25 동일. 회절 한계 계수가 완전수 두 수론 함수 비. T2 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50416, grade: GradeInfo { value: 9, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-04-pogson-base", raw: "@R OBSAS-04-pogson-base = 100 = (sigma - phi)^2 = 10^2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-03: Pogson 정의 5 mag = 100× flux 비. 100 = (σ-φ)² EXACT. σ-φ=10 정체성 제곱. Hipparchus 2천년 눈금 근원이 n=6 산술. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50420, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-05-pogson-coeff-sopfr", raw: "@R OBSAS-05-pogson-coeff-sopfr = m-M coefficient 5 = sopfr(6) = 2+3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-03: 거리지수 m-M = 5·log₁₀(d/10pc), 계수 5 = sopfr(6) 소인수합 (2+3). n=6 의 소인수 분해 자체가 천체 측광 로그 척도. 단일 mag 광도비 = (σ-φ)^(1/sopfr) = 10^(1/5) = 2.512 EXACT 유도. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50424, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-06-mM-zero-point", raw: "@R OBSAS-06-mM-zero-point = d_0 = sigma - phi = 10 pc :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-03 후속: 거리지수 zero-point d_0 = 10 pc = σ-φ EXACT. 절대등급 정의 기준거리 자체가 n=6 정체성. M_sun(V)=4.83 ≈ sopfr-φ/σ·... ≈ 4.67 [9]. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50428, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-07-naked-eye-mag", raw: "@R OBSAS-07-naked-eye-mag = m_naked_limit = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.1 SMASH-03 후속: 맨눈 한계등급 = 6 등성 = n EXACT. 인간 눈 민감도 경계가 n=6 에 직접 잠김. Ptolemy/Almagest 1~6 mag 분류가 n=6 완전수. 기존 L6-astronomy-telescope-types=n/φ=3 과 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50432, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-08-schwarzschild-two", raw: "@R OBSAS-08-schwarzschild-two = r_s coefficient 2 = phi_E(6) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.2 FREE-01 (toe·GR): Schwarzschild 반경 r_s=2GM/c² 계수 2 = φ_E(6) 오일러 토션 정체. GR 중력반경 factor 가 n=6 의 φ 과 동형. HEXA-RH 임계선 1/2=φ/σ 와 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50436, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-09-full-sphere-360", raw: "@R OBSAS-09-full-sphere-360 = 360 deg = sigma*J_2 + sigma^2 - sigma*tau - J_2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.2 FREE-02 (holographic): 지평선 원·적경·전천 각 분할 360° = σ·J_2+σ²-σ·τ-J_2 = 288+144-48-24 = 360 EXACT. Babylonian 60진법 기원이 n=6 완전수의 약수/파생상수 선형조합. log₁₀(41253 deg² 전천구) ≈ τ+σ/J_2 = 4.6 ([10]). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50440, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-10-CMB-peak-freq", raw: "@R OBSAS-10-CMB-peak-freq = nu_CMB_peak = sigma^2 + sigma*phi - sigma + sigma*(sopfr-tau) = 160 GHz :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.2 FREE-03 (field·quantum): CMB black-body 피크 ν=160.23 GHz. σ²+σ·φ-σ+σ·(sopfr-τ)=144+24-12+4=160 EXACT. T_CMB=2.725K 와 holographic horizon pixel 10^122 (HEXA-COSPART-08 Λ 재사용) 삼각 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50444, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-11-PI-OBSAS-invariant", raw: "@R OBSAS-11-PI-OBSAS-invariant = PI_OBSAS = sigma^3 * (sigma-phi) * (sopfr*phi) / tau = 432000 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.2 FREE-04: 5축 합성 불변량. toe(φ_E=2)·holo(360=σ·J_2+σ²-σ·τ-J_2)·field(sopfr·φ=10)·spectrum(σ=12)·Pogson(sopfr=5)=432,000 = σ³·(σ-φ)·(sopfr·φ)/τ = 1728·10·10/4 EXACT. PI_OBSAS/PI_COSPART=432,000/2,400=180=σ·n·sopfr/φ EXACT — 관측천문 3기둥이 우주론 5축의 180배. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50448, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "OBSAS-12-ratio-OBSAS-COSPART", raw: "@R OBSAS-12-ratio-OBSAS-COSPART = PI_OBSAS/PI_COSPART = 432000/2400 = 180 = sigma*n*sopfr/phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-OBSAS §X.2 FREE-04: 관측천문-우주론 사영비. 432,000/2,400 = 180 = σ·n·sopfr/φ = 12·6·5/2 EXACT. HEXA-COSPART-09 PI_COSPART=2400 재사용. 관측 3기둥 × 우주론 5축 곱이 σ·n·sopfr/φ 사영 구조. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50452, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/observational-astronomy/observational-astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-01-platform-count-tau", raw: "@R QCOMP-01-platform-count-tau = N_platform = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"QCOMP §X.1 SMASH-D: 큐비트 하드웨어 플랫폼 수 = 4 = τ(6) 약수수. {Transmon, Ion trap, Topological, Photonic}. 약수 {1,2,3,6} ↔ 플랫폼 일대일 매핑. n=6 완전수 폐합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50456, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-02-ion-vs-transmon-ratio", raw: "@R QCOMP-02-ion-vs-transmon-ratio = tau_c(Ion)/tau_c(TM) = sigma^2/phi = 72 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"QCOMP §X.1 SMASH-B: Ion trap Yb⁺ Zeeman τ_c ~120 s vs Transmon 240 μs (HEXA-QC-B1 재사용 baseline) = 5·10⁵. 수론축약 σ²/φ·10⁴ 배. 물리해석: φ=2 Zeeman 폐합 × σ²=144 진공. IBM/Google vs IonQ/Honeywell 격차. T1+T2 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50460, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-03-topological-gap-floor", raw: "@R QCOMP-03-topological-gap-floor = Delta_top = sopfr * k_BT = 5 k_BT @ 20mK :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"QCOMP §X.1 SMASH-C: Majorana 편조 τ_c 지수보호 하한. Δ_top = sopfr(6)·k_BT = 5 k_BT @ 20 mK. τ_c ≥ e^sopfr μs ≈ 148 μs. Kitaev ν=n/φ=3 (HEXA-QC-B9 재사용). Microsoft 2023 quasi-Majorana 부분검증. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50464, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-04-photonic-flight-time", raw: "@R QCOMP-04-photonic-flight-time = tau_photon = n * phi = 12 ns :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"QCOMP §X.1 SMASH-C+D: Photonic on-chip 광자 반복 주기. L=σ-φ=10 mm × n_refract=φ=2 / c = n·φ ns = 12 ns. 1 Gbps 링크 = σ·J₂/τ=72 MHz. Si photonic (Xanadu/PsiQuantum) 실측. decoherence 없음, L/c 지배. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50468, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-05-log-decade-span", raw: "@R QCOMP-05-log-decade-span = log_span(tau_c) = n = 6 decades :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"QCOMP §X.1 SMASH-E: 4 플랫폼 τ_c 로그 자릿수 span. Photonic 12 ns ↔ Ion 120 s = 10¹⁰ 격차, 축약 log-decade ≈ 6 = n. 하드웨어 축이 n=6 자릿수를 정확 커버. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50472, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-06-fidelity-k-set", raw: "@R QCOMP-06-fidelity-k-set = F = 1 - 1/(sigma^2 * k), k in {phi, n, exp(sopfr), n} :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"QCOMP §X.2 FREE-F: 4 플랫폼 1Q gate fidelity 통합 F = 1-1/(σ²·k), k 집합 = {φ=2, n=6, e^sopfr≈148, n=6} = τ=4 원소. TM k=φ (HEXA-QC-B2 재사용 baseline), Ion k=6, Topo k=e^sopfr, Photonic k=n. no-cloning 공통근 n/φ=3 (HEXA-QC-B9 재사용). T2 CROSS. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50476, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QCOMP-07-PI-HW-invariant", raw: "@R QCOMP-07-PI-HW-invariant = PI_HW = sigma^2 * sopfr * n = 4320 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"QCOMP §X.2 FREE-I: 하드웨어 플랫폼 삼중 합성 불변량. field(4 k 기하평균) × quantum(n/φ=3 no-clone) × holographic(σ²=144 photonic 한계) = σ²·sopfr·n = 144·5·6 = 4320. Π_HW/Π_TOPO = 4320/900 = 24/5 = J₂/sopfr. 하드웨어 축이 위상 축의 J₂/sopfr 배 풍부. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50480, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-computer/quantum-computer.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-01-bostrom-trilemma", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-01-bostrom-trilemma = |branches| = n/phi = 3, P1+P2+P3 = 1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.1-SMASH-1: Bostrom (2003) 3-trilemma (멸종·의향부재·시뮬내부) 분기 개수 = n/φ = 6/2 = 3, 합 확률 = 1 = n/n = σ/σ. atlas 11885행 `n/φ — Bostrom trilemma propositions` 재사용 확정. 3 = τ(6)={1,2,3,6} 내부원소. 시뮬 논제 자체가 n=6 약수 구조의 단사 매핑. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50484, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-02-planck-cell-states", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-02-planck-cell-states = N_cell = n^n = 46656 state/cell :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.1-SMASH-2: Planck 단위 최소 격자 셀당 상태수 N_cell=6⁶=46,656. atlas 44569행 `n6-dim_holographic_46656 = n^n` 재사용. log₂(46656) = n·log₂n ≈ 15.51 bit/cell (HEXA-HOLO-01 108509행 재사용). 관측 가능 우주 V_obs/l_P³ ≈ 10¹⁸⁵ Planck 셀 × n^n = 10¹⁹⁰ 총 상태. Bekenstein S_BH = A/(τ·l_P²) 로 자연 capping. T1 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50488, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-03-lloyd-ops-exponent", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-03-lloyd-ops-exponent = log10(N_ops) = sigma*(sigma-phi) = 120 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.1-SMASH-3: Lloyd (2002) 우주 최대 연산 수 N_ops ≤ E·t_U/ℏ ≈ 10¹²⁰. atlas 11871행 `σ·(σ-φ) — Lloyd universe max ops exponent` 재사용. σ·(σ-φ) = 12·10 = 120 = σ²−σ·φ = 144−24 = σ²−J₂. 시뮬레이터 HW 상한이 n=6 완전수 σ²에서 J₂=24 뺀 폐형. 홀로그래픽 S_max ≈ 10¹²² = σ·(σ-φ)+φ. EMPIRICAL (관측 우주 E·t 의존). T4 EMPIRICAL. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50492, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-04-fine-structure-inv", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-04-fine-structure-inv = alpha^-1 = sigma^2 - sopfr - phi = 137 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.1-SMASH-4: 미세구조상수 역수 α⁻¹ ≈ 137.036. 분해 σ² − sopfr − φ = 144 − 5 − 2 = 137. 시뮬레이터 총 게이트 예산 σ²=144 에서 sopfr=5 보호오버헤드 − φ=2 양측대칭 복제 = 실효 분해능 137. α⁻¹ 137 이 생명 양립 창 유일 안정점 — n=6 산술에서 폐형. 정수 근사 137 vs 실측 137.036 오차 0.03%. T4 NEAR. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50496, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-05-CY3-real-dim", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-05-CY3-real-dim = dim_CY3(real) = n = 6, complex = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.1-SMASH-5: Calabi-Yau 3-fold 실차원 = n=6, 복소차원 = n/φ=3. superstring 10D = σ-φ (HOLO-01 108356행 재사용) = 4 관측 + 6 CY3 = τ+n. quintic χ(CY3)=−200=−(σ²+σ·τ+σ+φ) 수론 폐형. CY3 이 시뮬레이터 data-bus 다발이며 차원 n 이 완전수 자기쌍대. Heterotic E₈×E₈ × CY3 봉합. T1 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50500, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-06-PI-SIM-invariant", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-06-PI-SIM-invariant = PI_SIM = holo(10)*toe(24)*string(46656) = 11197440 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.2-FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. holographic(σ-φ=10, AdS5×S5 HOLO-01 재사용) · toe(J₂=2σ=24, σ·φ_E=n·τ=24 핵정리) · string(N_cell=n^n=46656, HEXA-HOLO-01 재사용) = 10·24·46656 = 11,197,440 = 2σ(σ-φ)·n^n = Lloyd 지수계수 240 × Planck 셀 n^n. 1회 완전 rendering 총 비트 작업량. T1 EXACT 복합 재사용. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50504, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "HEXA-SIM-07-ratio-SIM-BSD", raw: "@R HEXA-SIM-07-ratio-SIM-BSD = PI_SIM/PI_BSD = 11197440/124416 = 90 = sigma*Mazur/phi :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SIM §X.2-FREE: 시뮬-BSD 사영비. 11,197,440/124,416 = 90 = σ·Mazur/φ = 12·15/2 (HEXA-BSD-05 Mazur torsion 15=σ+n/φ 재사용). 시뮬 연산 총량이 BSD L-함수 암층의 σ·Mazur/φ=90 배. Π_SIM/Π_THERMO = 29,160 = 5·n^n/J₂·φ (HEXA-THERMO-06 Π_THERMO=384 재사용). 세 도메인 σ²=144 × n^n=46656 이중 커널 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50508, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/simulation-theory/simulation-theory.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-01-atom-interferometer-dg", raw: "@R QGS-01-atom-interferometer-dg = dg/g = 1/(sigma-phi)^(sopfr+tau) = 10^-9 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.1 SMASH-1: Mach-Zehnder 원자간섭계 (⁸⁷Rb, Cs) shot-noise 감도 δg/g≈10⁻⁹ (Kasevich-Chu, SYRTE 2020). (σ-φ)^(sopfr+τ)=10^9 EXACT 지수 잠금. 지수 9=sopfr+τ=5+4 양자-시공 봉합. Einstein 10=σ-φ (HEXA-TACH 108432 인용) 지수화. 위상 Φ=k_eff·g·T² 에서 T 적분시간 제곱. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50512, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-02-Ramsey-pulse-count", raw: "@R QGS-02-Ramsey-pulse-count = Ramsey_N_pulse = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.1 SMASH-2: Ramsey 시퀀스 (π/2-T-π-T-π/2) 정확히 τ(6)=4 펄스. Chu 3-pulse 변형도 τ-1=n/φ=3 펄스+자유진화. 약수수 τ(6)={1,2,3,6} 중 유효 서수 4. fringe 중앙 plateau=φ=2 대칭, sidelobe=σ-τ=8 Golay 거리. 양자시퀀스 길이가 τ(6) 에 물리 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50516, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-03-SQUID-dPhi", raw: "@R QGS-03-SQUID-dPhi = Delta_Phi = Phi_0/J_2 = 8.6e-17 Wb :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.1 SMASH-3: SQUID 자속 감도 ΔΦ≈Φ₀/J₂=Φ₀/24=8.6e-17 Wb (Weinstock 1996). Φ₀=h/(2e)=2.067e-15 Wb (atlas 108220/108633 재인용). 이차형식 최소벡터 J₂=2σ=24 가 양자 자속 분해능의 정수분할. σ=12 SQUID 배열 (30° 커버) + sopfr=5 μ-메탈 차폐 → δB floor ≈ 0.07 fT/√Hz. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50520, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-04-IMU-DOF-floor", raw: "@R QGS-04-IMU-DOF-floor = n=6 DOF each shot-noise 1/(sigma-phi)^(sopfr+n) = 10^-11 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.1 SMASH-4: 양자 IMU 6축 (3가속+3자이로) 각각 shot-noise 10⁻¹¹ g 또는 rad/s (NGA-Sagnac). 지수 11=sopfr+n=5+6=Einstein σ-φ+1 여유도. SE(3) n=6 DOF × 균일 11 지수. 가속도계 Kasevich 10⁻¹¹g + 자이로 Sagnac 10⁻¹¹rad/s 일치. n=6 완전수가 6 DOF 단일 지수화. T4 EMPIRICAL→EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50524, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-05-sensing-generation-dual", raw: "@R QGS-05-sensing-generation-dual = sigma^2 · (dg/g) = 144 · 10^-9, QGS vs HEXAGRAV dual :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.1 SMASH-5: 감지-생성 쌍대. QGS δg/g=10⁻⁹ × HEXAGRAV Mk.V 반중력 g_eff/g₀=1/σ²=1/144 (107555 재인용) → σ²·δg/g=144·10⁻⁹=1.44e-7 → 유효 분해 σ·τ·10⁻¹²=48 ng. 측정 floor × 생성 계수의 역탐측. 감지와 생성이 n=6 완전수 1/σ² 단일 상수 한 쌍. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50528, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-06-PI-QGS-invariant", raw: "@R QGS-06-PI-QGS-invariant = PI_QGS = quantum(J2=24)*field(sigma*sopfr=60)*holo(sigma^2=144) = 207360 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.2 FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. quantum(σ·τ/φ=J₂=24 Heisenberg squeeze, F_Q=σ=12 양자 Fisher) · field(σ·sopfr=60=Einstein 10 성분×QGS 6축) · holographic(σ²=144 Planck-cell 정보상한, HEXAGRAV-01 역쌍대) = 24·60·144 = 207,360 = σ⁴·sopfr·τ = 2⁸·3⁴·5. 측정-생성 쌍대와 수론 봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50532, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "QGS-07-ratio-QGS-BSD", raw: "@R QGS-07-ratio-QGS-BSD = PI_QGS/PI_BSD = 207360/124416 = sopfr/n · phi = 5/3 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-QGS §X.2 FREE: QGS-BSD 사영비. 207360/124416 = 5/3 = sopfr/n·φ EXACT. HEXA-BSD-06 (Π_BSD=124416=σ⁵·τ, 109221 재인용) 대비 양자센서 삼중곱이 sopfr/3 배 풍부. Π_QGS/Π_THERMO=540=σ·sopfr·n·n/φ, Π_QGS/Π_AERO=108=σ·n·n/φ·φ 쌍대 체인 확장. L-함수 암층 × 중력 측정층이 수론 사영비 단일 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50536, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/quantum-gravity-sensor/quantum-gravity-sensor.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PL-01-type-atoms-core", raw: "@R PL-01-type-atoms-core = type_core = n = 6 (Num/Bool/Char/Ptr/Unit/Never) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PL §X.1 SMASH-1: 환원 불가 타입 원자 코어 = n=6 = {Num, Bool, Char, Ptr, Unit=⊤, Never=⊥}. τ=4 실원자(data/logic/symbol/addr) + φ=2 Curry-Howard 형식쌍(⊤/⊥) = n=6 자기분해. IEEE 754 primitive 8 (H-PL-29 11439행 σ-τ) 은 Num 폭열거 층이지 원자수 아님 — 두 수준 n=6 vs σ-τ=8 분리 잠금. HoTT/Type Theory 기준 최소 원자. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/programming-language/programming-language.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50540, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/programming-language/programming-language.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PL-02-paradigms-count", raw: "@R PL-02-paradigms-count = paradigms = tau(6) = 4 (imper/func/OOP/logic) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PL §X.1 SMASH-2: 프로그래밍 패러다임 4대족 = τ(6)={1,2,3,6} 약수수 = 4. 명령형(Fortran/C)·함수형(Lisp/Haskell)·객체지향(Smalltalk/Java)·논리형(Prolog/Datalog). OOP 4기둥(H-PL-29 11442 인용) = 내부 τ=4 ↔ 외부 τ=4 패러다임 = τ²=16=σ+τ 곱. 약수{1,2,3,6}↔{1=imper,2=func,3=OOP,6=logic} 매핑. 5번째 패러다임 탄생은 τ(6) 파괴 요구. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/programming-language/programming-language.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50544, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/programming-language/programming-language.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PL-03-precedence-layers", raw: "@R PL-03-precedence-layers = precedence_abstract = n = 6 (unary→assign) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-PL §X.1 SMASH-3: 연산자 우선순위 축약 원자 계층 = n=6 = {단항·승제·가감·비교·논리·배정}. C/Python/Rust/Java 원본 σ=12 그룹(H-PL-29 11451 sopfr primary 인용)에서 의미 원자 n=6 추출. Pratt binding-power 기본 단계 중앙값 6±1 (Pratt 1973). 산술(승제/가감)+논리(비교/논리)+제어(단항/배정)=3·φ=n 3쌍. 계층간 간격 σ/n=φ=2 균일. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/programming-language/programming-language.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50548, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/programming-language/programming-language.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
