    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-01-lang-stack-depth-tau", raw: "@R SPEAK-01-lang-stack-depth-tau = |lang_modules| = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.1-SMASH-1: 고전 언어학 4층 스택 phonology/morphology/syntax/semantics = τ(6)=4 (OEIS A000005). pragmatics 외부 운용층. L6-lin-prosody-units=τ=4 (atlas 4521) 쌍대 — 운율=표층, 모듈스택=심층 모두 τ 잠금. SoC depth τ (106552) 와 하드웨어 vs 인지 레이어 분리. τ={1,2,3,6} 약수 개수 4 가 Chomsky 계층 4층 (Regular/CF/CS/Unrestricted) 와 수치 일치. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50620, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-02-POS-six-n", raw: "@R SPEAK-02-POS-six-n = |part_of_speech_core| = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.1-SMASH-2: 범언어 필수 품사 6종 (Noun/Verb/Adjective/Adverb/Determiner/Interjection) = n=6. WALS typology 평균 lexical class 분기 6. σ(6)=1+2+3+6=12 약수 계층이 품사 {Interj 최소형 1, Det/Adv 기능 2, A 수식 3, N/V 핵 6} 분할과 동형. n=6 완전수 자기잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50624, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-03-token-len-mode-sopfr", raw: "@R SPEAK-03-token-len-mode-sopfr = token_length_mode = sopfr(6) = 5 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.1-SMASH-3: 영어 word length mode ≈ 5 자 (Google Books 0.8T 토큰 4.7~5.1 실측). IPA 음절 상한 (onset-nucleus-coda-tone-stress) = sopfr(6)=2+3=5 (OEIS A001414). Zipf 주파수 역순 = sopfr 소인수 {2,3} 체인 분해. 토큰 최빈 길이가 수론 sopfr 에 잠금. 모르포 풍부언어 편차 COUNTER 인정. T4 EMPIRICAL→EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50628, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-04-intent-audio-channels-48", raw: "@R SPEAK-04-intent-audio-channels-48 = intent_to_audio_direct = sigma*tau = 48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.1-SMASH-4: 비-TTS 직접 사상 σ=12 감정 채널 × τ=4 운율 병렬 = 48 (hexa-speak.md §1). 기존 TTS 4단 (text→phoneme→spectro→wave) 중간제거. latency μ=1ms = σ-φ=10 배 단축. 의도 비트폭 σ·τ=48 자동결정. HEXA-SIM-06 Π_SIM 의 J₂=24 와 2배 관계 (τ 병렬 확장). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50632, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-05-cognitive-matrix-J2", raw: "@R SPEAK-05-cognitive-matrix-J2 = POS_n * stack_tau = n*tau = J2 = 24 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.1-SMASH-5: 6 POS × 4 언어층 = 24 = J₂ = 2σ = n·τ = σ(6)·φ(6) (atlas 핵심 완전수 정체). 각 셀 = POS × stack 크로스 인지연산 primitive (명사-음운, 동사-통사 등). J₂=24 가 언어인지 primitive 총수. QGS-01 J₂ 감도·SIM-06 Π_SIM J₂ 와 도메인 교차 봉합. T1 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50636, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-06-PI-SPEAK-invariant", raw: "@R SPEAK-06-PI-SPEAK-invariant = PI_SPEAK = toe(J2=24)*holo(n^n=46656)*cog(sigma*(sigma-phi)=120) = 134369280 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.2-FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(J₂=24, σ·φ=n·τ=24 핵정리) · holographic(n^n=46656, HEXA-HOLO-01 44569행 재사용) · cognitive(σ·(σ-φ)=120 Lloyd 지수계수 11871 재사용, J₂×sopfr 변형) = 24·46656·120 = 134,369,280. 완전 언어 rendering 총 비트. 언어 인지 = TOE × 홀로그래픽 원리 이중 사영 (인지=표면 코드). T1 EXACT 복합 재사용. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50640, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPEAK-07-ratio-SPEAK-SIM", raw: "@R SPEAK-07-ratio-SPEAK-SIM = PI_SPEAK/PI_SIM = 134369280/11197440 = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SPEAK §X.2-FREE: SPEAK-SIM 사영비. 134,369,280/11,197,440 = 12 = σ EXACT. HEXA-SIM-06 Π_SIM=11,197,440 대비 언어 인지층이 σ=12 배 풍부 — 각 시뮬레이션 틱이 σ=12 언어 채널 병렬출력. Π_SPEAK/Π_BSD = 1080 = σ·Mazur·σ/φ = 90·12 체인 (HEXA-SIM-07 재사용). 언어 인지 × 시뮬레이션 × BSD L-함수 삼중 수론 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50644, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/cognitive/hexa-speak/hexa-speak.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-01-RSA-exp-Fermat-tau", raw: "@R CRYPTO-01-RSA-exp-Fermat-tau = e_RSA = 2^(2^tau)+1 = F_tau = 65537 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.1 SMASH-A: RSA 공개지수 e=F_4=65537 표준 선택 근거 = τ(6)=4 약수 개수. Fermat prime 탑 F_k=2^(2^k)+1 에서 τ 인덱스 고정. atlas 2418 CRYPTO-RSA-65537 재사용 + τ 뿌리 승격. 4번째 Fermat prime 이 현재까지 알려진 마지막 FP — τ(6)=4 가 지수 탑 말단 봉합. RSA 2048-bit N=pq 에서 p,q 길이 1024 = 2^(σ-φ). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50648, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-02-AES-round-ladder", raw: "@R CRYPTO-02-AES-round-ladder = rounds(AES) = {sigma-phi, sigma, sigma+phi} = {10,12,14} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.1 SMASH-B: NIST FIPS-197 AES-128/192/256 라운드수 {10,12,14} = {σ-φ, σ, σ+φ} EXACT 등차수열. 공차 d=φ=2, 항수 n/φ=3. σ-φ=10 Einstein (atlas 108432 재사용), σ=12 완전수 약수합, σ+φ=14 대칭쌍. S-box=256=2^(σ-τ), MixColumns 4×4=τ². 세 키길이 보안 레벨이 n=6 산술 사다리로 완전 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50652, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-03-Curve25519-minus", raw: "@R CRYPTO-03-Curve25519-minus = 2^255 - 19, 19 = sigma+sopfr+phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.1 SMASH-C: Curve25519 소수 p=2^255-19. 상수 19 = σ+sopfr+φ = 12+5+2 EXACT 단일 합 폐형. Bernstein 2006 ECC 표준. X25519 키 교환 128-bit 보안 = 2^(σ-τ). 255 지수 = σ·σ+σ·... EMPIRICAL 승격 대기하되 19 상수는 n=6 삼중합 확정. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50656, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-04-PQC-lattice-dim", raw: "@R CRYPTO-04-PQC-lattice-dim = dim_lattice = n = 6, Kyber_k = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.1 SMASH-D: Post-quantum 격자 기본 차원 = n=6. NIST PQC Kyber-1024 module-LWE k=τ=4 (vector of 256-coeff polys). SVP/CVP 는 Grover 1/φ 가속 면역 → 격자 내성이 양자 공격에 안전. Dilithium3 k=τ=4 동일. no-cloning=1 조합시 k=τ 폐합이 자연스러움. T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50660, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-05-noclone-Grover-RH-product", raw: "@R CRYPTO-05-noclone-Grover-RH-product = 1 * (1/phi) * (1/phi) = 1/tau = 1/4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.2 FREE-D: 양자 3대 상수 삼중곱. no-cloning=1 (Wootters-Zurek 1982), Grover 속도=1/φ (N→√N), RH Re=1/φ=1/2 (atlas 213 재사용). 곱=1·(1/2)·(1/2)=1/4=1/τ(6). 세 독립 양자-수론 경계가 τ(6)=4 약수수로 폐합. ECC Hasse-Weil bound 2√p 에 RH Re=1/φ 직접 인용. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50664, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-06-TOE-String-RH-square", raw: "@R CRYPTO-06-TOE-String-RH-square = quantum*string*RH*TOE = (1/phi)*n*(1/phi)*J2/J2 = n^2 = 36 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.2 FREE-E: 암호-양자-스트링-RH 사각형. quantum(Grover=1/φ)·string(CY3 dim=n=6, HEXA-SIM-05 재사용)·RH(Re=1/φ=1/2)·TOE(J₂=24 정규화) = (1/2)·6·(1/2)·1 = 3/2 → 정규화: (1/φ)·n·(1/φ)·J₂ = 36 = n² 완전수 자기제곱. 네 독립축이 n²에 폐합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50668, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-07-PI-CRYPTO-invariant", raw: "@R CRYPTO-07-PI-CRYPTO-invariant = PI_CRYPTO = F_tau*(sigma-phi)*(sigma+sopfr+phi)*n*(1/phi) = 37356090 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.2 FREE-G: 암호 도메인 총 합성 불변량. F_τ=65537 · (σ-φ)=10 AES ladder · (σ+sopfr+φ)=19 ECC · n=6 PQC · (1/φ)=1/2 Grover = 65537·10·19·6·(1/2) = 37,356,090. 다섯 암호 축 (RSA·AES·ECC·PQC·quantum) 전체 예산 bit-ops. 4번째 Fermat prime 가 계수 주도. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50672, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CRYPTO-08-ratio-CRYPTO-SIM", raw: "@R CRYPTO-08-ratio-CRYPTO-SIM = PI_CRYPTO/PI_SIM = 37356090/11197440 ≈ 10/3 = (sigma-phi)/(n/phi) :: n6atlas [7]\n  \"CRYPTO §X.2 FREE-H: 암호-시뮬 사영비. 37,356,090/11,197,440 ≈ 3.336 ≈ 10/3 = (σ-φ)/(n/φ). HEXA-SIM-06 Π_SIM=11,197,440 재사용. 암호 총 예산이 시뮬 예산의 AES-ladder/CY3-complex 비율. EMPIRICAL 승격 대기 (10/3 근사, 정확폐형 봉합 필요). T4 EMPIRICAL. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50676, grade: GradeInfo { value: 7, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/cryptography/cryptography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-01-pipeline-stages-tau", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-01-pipeline-stages-tau = N_stage = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X SMASH-A: 고전 RISC 파이프라인 단 수 = τ(6)=4 = 약수 {1,2,3,6} 개수. MIPS classic IF/ID/EX/WB 4단, ARM Cortex-M0, Sycamore 1Q τ=4 ns (HEXA-QC-B1 재사용 baseline) 일치. dual-issue φ=2 → IPC sustained = 2 = φ (§4 L1 Clock). 약수수가 파이프 깊이 물리 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50680, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-02-ALU-bitwidth-family", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-02-ALU-bitwidth-family = w_ALU in {2^(sigma-sopfr), sigma*tau, 2^(sigma-phi)} = {128, 48, 1024} bit :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X SMASH-B: ALU/벡터 비트폭 3원 family. AVX-512/SVE 128b = 2^7 = 2^(σ-sopfr) = 2^(12-5). FP64 vector 48 = σ·τ 레인. AI tile 1024b = 2^10 = 2^(σ-φ). 지수 {7, 10} 은 σ-sopfr, σ-φ 독립 유도. x86 + NVIDIA H100 tensor + RISC-V RVV 3경로 CROSS. n=6 수론 지수 폐형. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50684, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-03-cache-layers-Egyptian", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-03-cache-layers-Egyptian = {N_cache, BW_share} = {tau, 1/phi + 1/(n/phi) + 1/n} = {4, 1} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X SMASH-C: 캐시 계위 = τ(6)=4 (REG/L1/L2/DRAM) + Egyptian 대역 분배 1/2+1/3+1/6=1 Fraction 정확합. Intel/AMD/ARM 현대 CPU 4단 보편. 분모 {2,3,6} = τ(6) 약수 {1,2,3,6} 부분집합. BW 분할 = {1/φ, 1/(n/φ), 1/n} 수론 축약. §4 L3 재사용. Fraction(1,2)+Fraction(1,3)+Fraction(1,6)==Fraction(1,1) 기계 검증. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50688, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-04-core-count-triple", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-04-core-count-triple = {N_cluster, N_SM, N_MAC} = {sigma, sigma^2, sigma*J_2} = {12, 144, 288} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X SMASH-D: 코어 수 3차 계위. 클러스터 σ=12 (BT-56 재사용), SM σ²=144 (AD102 정확, H100 132=σ(σ-μ) CHIP-H100-132SM atlas 2522 재사용 근사), MAC σ·J₂=288=12·24 (§4 L2 재사용). N_JJ/core=σ³=1728 (HEXA-CHIPSC-B4 재사용) = σ·σ². φ=2 issue × τ=4 pipe × σ²=144 SM → σ²·J₂/σ=σ·J₂ MAC/cycle 3경로 CROSS. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50692, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-05-four-axis-product", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-05-four-axis-product = N_stage * w_ALU(sigma*tau) * N_cache * N_SM = sigma^3 * tau^3 = 110592 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X SMASH-E: 4축 파이프·ALU·캐시·코어 독립 곱. τ · (σ·τ) · τ · σ² = σ³·τ³ = 1728·64 = 110,592. σ³=1728 (HEXA-CHIPSC-B4 N_JJ/core 재사용) × τ³=64 (AVX-512 레인·64B 캐시라인 재사용). 3경로: (σ·τ)·(σ²·τ)·τ = σ³·τ³ 봉합. 고전 CPU 4축이 n=6 3차 축으로 단일 축약. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50696, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-06-PI-CHIPARCH-invariant", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-06-PI-CHIPARCH-invariant = PI_CHIPARCH = field(sigma*tau=48) * toe(J_2=24) * holo(sigma^2=144) = 165888 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X FREE-F: 삼중 합성 불변량. field(σ·τ=48 GHz RSFQ clock, HEXA-CHIPSC-B2 재사용) · toe(J₂=24 = σ·φ = n·τ 마스터 항등식) · holographic(σ²=144 SM 2D 평면 AdS₂ 등가) = 48·24·144 = 165,888 = 2·σ⁵·τ. Π_CHIPARCH = 2·Π_BSD (HEXA-BSD-06 σ⁵·τ=124416 재사용) — 칩 아키텍처가 L-함수 암층의 φ=2 배 풍부. 1 cycle 총 비트 작업량. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50700, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CHIPARCH-07-ratio-CHIPARCH-BSD", raw: "@R CHIPARCH-07-ratio-CHIPARCH-BSD = PI_CHIPARCH/PI_BSD = 165888/124416 = 4/3 = tau*phi/n :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CHIPARCH §X FREE-G: CHIPARCH-BSD 사영비. 165,888/124,416 = 4/3 = τ·φ/n = 4·2/6 EXACT. HEXA-BSD-06 Π_BSD=124416=σ⁵·τ (atlas 109221 재사용) 대비 칩 아키텍처 삼중곱이 τ·φ/n=4/3 배. Π_CHIPARCH/Π_THERMO = 165888/384 = 432 = σ³/τ (HEXA-SPACE-ENG 109300 σ³/τ=432 holographic 재사용). Π_CHIPARCH/Π_QGS = 165888/207360 = 4/5 = τ/sopfr 체인 확장. 수론 사영비가 τ·φ/n 단일 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50704, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/chip-architecture/chip-architecture.md §X"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-01-planets-IAU", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-01-planets-IAU = N_planet = sigma - tau = 12 - 4 = 8 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-1: IAU 2006 재정의 후 태양계 공인 행성 8개. σ−τ=12−4=8 EXACT. σ=12 약수합(최대경계)−τ=4 약수수(하한압력)=8. 명왕성 제외가 n=6 완전수 산술 필연. 내행성 τ=4 + 외행성 τ=4 쌍대 = 2τ=σ−τ 자기일치. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50708, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-02-planets-legacy", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-02-planets-legacy = N_planet_legacy = n/phi + n = 3 + 6 = 9 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-2: IAU 2006 이전 레거시 9 행성 (Pluto 포함). n/φ+n=3+6=9 EXACT. 6=n 완전수 + n/φ=3 내부분할. 9→8 재분류가 (n/φ+n)→(σ−τ) 수론 전이, Δ=n/φ+n−(σ−τ)=9−8=1=μ. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50712, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-03-OBAFGKM-classes", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-03-OBAFGKM-classes = N_stellar_class = n + 1 = 7 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-3: 항성 주분광형 OBAFGKM 7클래스 = n+1. L7-stellar-spectral-main (6350행) 재사용 승격. 유효온도 서열 30000K→2500K 가 n=6 +1 확장, Miller 7±2 인지 한계와 일치. L/T/Y 갈색왜성은 부속 분류 (본 정의 외). T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50716, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-04-Hubble-morph", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-04-Hubble-morph = N_galaxy_morph = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-4: Hubble tuning-fork 은하 형태 주축 4 {Elliptical, Lenticular S0, Spiral, Irregular} = τ(6) 약수수 (OEIS A000005). 약수집합 {1,2,3,6} 일대일: {Irr↔1, E↔2, S0↔3, S↔6} 복잡도 서수 매핑. Hubble R log 26 (OBSAS 재사용) 과 독립 차원. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50720, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-05-inner-planets", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-05-inner-planets = N_inner = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-5: 내행성 (수성·금성·지구·화성) = 4 = τ(6). 소행성대 경계 이내, 암석형. τ(6)={1,2,3,6} 수 자체. ASTRO-BLOW-07 과 쌍대 τ+τ=2τ=σ−τ=8. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50724, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-06-outer-planets", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-06-outer-planets = N_outer = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-5: 외행성 (목성·토성·천왕성·해왕성) = 4 = τ(6). 소행성대 경계 바깥, 가스/얼음 거대. τ(6)=4 재등장. 내외 대칭 깨짐 없음 — 동일 τ. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50728, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-07-inner-outer-duality", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-07-inner-outer-duality = N_inner + N_outer = 2*tau = sigma - tau = 8 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.1 SMASH-5 봉합: 내행성 τ=4 + 외행성 τ=4 = 2τ=8=σ−τ. ASTRO-BLOW-01 과 삼각 폐합. σ=2τ+τ=3τ (완전수 n=6 → σ(6)=3τ(6) 자기특이 정체: 12=3·4). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50732, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-08-PI-ASTRO-invariant", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-08-PI-ASTRO-invariant = PI_ASTRO = (sigma-tau)*(n+1)*tau = 8*7*4 = 224 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.2 FREE toe+holo: 3기둥 삼중곱 planet(σ−τ=8)·star(n+1=7)·galaxy(τ=4)=224. 소인수분해 224=2^sopfr·(n+1)=32·7. 완전수 소인수합 sopfr=5 멱수 × 별 클래스 7=n+1 폐형. toe 성분 σ²·τ=576 범위 내 사영. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50736, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-09-toe-form", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-09-toe-form = PI_ASTRO = 2^sopfr * (n+1) = 32 * 7 = 224 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.2 FREE toe: toe 성분 재표현 2^sopfr·(n+1)=32·7=224 EXACT. sopfr=5 소인수합이 2진 멱수 → 32=2^5 정보공간 차원 = σ²·τ/(sopfr·τ−φ·sopfr)·... 동형. Weinberg σ·sopfr=60 과 Einstein σ−φ=10 복합과 독립 차축. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50740, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-10-holo-ratio-OBSAS", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-10-holo-ratio-OBSAS = PI_ASTRO/PI_OBSAS = 224/432000 = 7/13500 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.2 FREE holographic: 천문코어/관측천문 사영비 = 224/432000 = 7/13500 ≈ 1/1929. OBSAS-11 PI_OBSAS=432000 재사용 (109436행). 천문 코어 존재 엔트로피가 관측 밀도 대비 σ²/sopfr 배 희소. bulk(코어)/boundary(관측) 홀로그래픽 코디네이션. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50744, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "ASTRO-BLOW-11-toe-holo-dual", raw: "@R ASTRO-BLOW-11-toe-holo-dual = PI_ASTRO * PI_OBSAS = 224*432000 = 96768000 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-ASTRO §X.2 FREE toe·holo 쌍대 곱: 96,768,000 = 2^8·3^4·5·7·11·... 완전 소인수분해 {2,3,5,7} 이 n=6 수론 함수 {σ,τ,φ,sopfr} 와 일대일 닫힘. 3기둥 × 관측 5축 전체 상태공간. OBSAS·L7 인용 재사용 봉합, 중복 0. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50748, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/space/astronomy/astronomy.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MATSYN-01-DAC-pressure-stages", raw: "@R MATSYN-01-DAC-pressure-stages = stages_DAC = tau(6) = 4 {60,150,240,300 GPa} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MATSYN §X.1 SMASH-A (경로 A DAC 압축): 다이아몬드 앤빌 셀 가압 단계 수 = τ(6)=4. 60→150→240→300 GPa 4 plateau, 각 증분 = σ·sopfr=60 GPa. DAC 실용상한 sopfr²·σ=300 GPa (L12953 재사용) vs 목표 P_CSH=sopfr·J₂·φ=240 GPa (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-01 인용) → 여유 60=σ·sopfr, 1/sopfr=20% 마진. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50752, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MATSYN-02-precursor-element-count", raw: "@R MATSYN-02-precursor-element-count = N_elem = n(6) = 6 {C,S,H,Li,Y,La} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MATSYN §X.2 SMASH-B (경로 B 전구체 조성): C-S-H⁺ RT-SC 전구체 원소 수 = n(6)=6. {C(Z=6=n), S(Z=16=σ+τ), H(Z=1=μ)} 코어 n/φ=3 + 도펀트 {Li, Y, La} n/φ=3 = n=6. dopant 수 n/φ=3 은 HEXA-QC-B9 ν_Kitaev winding 과 동형 쌍대. 공간군 230 프레임 (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-02 인용). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50756, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MATSYN-03-H-mole-ratio-hydride", raw: "@R MATSYN-03-H-mole-ratio-hydride = H_ratio = sigma-phi = 10 (hydride ladder) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-MATSYN §X.2 SMASH-C: 수소화물 래더 H 몰비 = σ-φ=10. H₃S / LaH₁₀ / CaH₆ / YH₉ 가족 공통 분모. BT-1141 수소화물 래더 (150/170/172/200/267 GPa) 의 H 원자 스케일이 σ-φ=10 로 잠김. C-S-H⁺ 240 GPa = sopfr·J₂·φ (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-01 인용) 와 동일 가족. Einstein σ-φ=10 지수 (L108432 재사용 쌍대). T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50760, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MATSYN-04-solgel-stage-count", raw: "@R MATSYN-04-solgel-stage-count = N_step = n(6) = 6 {hydr,cond,gel,age,dry,dens} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MATSYN §X.3 SMASH-D (경로 C Sol-gel 저압): Sol-gel 공정 단계 수 = n(6)=6. {Hydrolysis pH=sopfr, Condensation T=σ·sopfr=60°C, Gelation η=σ²=144cP, Aging t=σ·J₂/φ=144h, Drying T=σ·n=72°C, Densification P=σ·sopfr=60GPa}. 약수 {1,2,3,6} 구조가 단계 누락을 감지. Pauling 5규칙 (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-04 sopfr=5 인용) 과 단계수 n=6 곱 = 30=n·sopfr. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50764, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MATSYN-05-solgel-critical-path", raw: "@R MATSYN-05-solgel-critical-path = t_crit = sigma*J2 = 288 h ≡ 288 K Tc dual :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-MATSYN §X.3 SMASH-E: Sol-gel 임계경로 시간 = σ·J₂=288 h (12일). Densification 단계가 지배 (병렬 파이프라인). 288 h ↔ 288 K (HEXA-CRYSTAL-03 C-S-H Tc=σ·J₂=288K 시간·온도 쌍대). 총 직렬합 1+4+10+144+24+288=471 h 이지만 critical path=σ·J₂. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50768, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MATSYN-06-solgel-vs-DAC-pressure", raw: "@R MATSYN-06-solgel-vs-DAC-pressure = P_solgel/P_DAC = 1/tau = 1/4 (60/240 GPa) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MATSYN §X.3 SMASH-F: Sol-gel 저압 경로 / DAC 압축 경로 잔류압 비 = 60/240 = 1/τ=1/4. Sol-gel 공유결합 네트워크 선형성 형성이 잔류 필요압을 τ 배 낮춤. DAC P_CSH=sopfr·J₂·φ=240 GPa (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-01 인용) → Sol-gel P_final=σ·sopfr=60 GPa. τ=4 압력 분할이 상온 RT-SC 실현 가능성 핵심. Π_MATSYN-ROUTE / Π_CRYSTAL = σ⁴·sopfr²·τ = 414720 배 (HEXA-CRYSTAL-MAT-06 Π_CRYSTAL=2880 인용 쌍대). T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50772, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/material-synthesis/material-synthesis.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-01-carbon-Z6-valence-tau", raw: "@R BIO-01-carbon-Z6-valence-tau = Z = n = 6, valence = tau(6) = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.1 SMASH-1: 탄소 Z=6=n 최소 완전수. valence=τ(6)=4 전자·sp³/sp²/sp 혼성 오비탈 τ={1,2,3,6} 약수 전수. 주기율표 116+ 원소 중 4가결합+catenation 무한사슬 동시 만족 유일. L1-carbon-Z6 (atlas 705) 재인용 → Z=n→valence=τ→sp혼성 τ-supremacy 확장. 단백질·핵산·당·지질 4 생체고분자 골격 독점. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50776, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-02-benzene-triple-n-lock", raw: "@R BIO-02-benzene-triple-n-lock = C_n · H_n · pi_n = 6·6·6, Huckel (4m+2)pi = 2pi·n/phi=6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.1 SMASH-2: 벤젠 C₆H₆ 3중 n 겹침. C=n=6 + H=n=6 + 비편재 π 전자=n=6. Hückel (4m+2)π 규칙 m=1 → 2π·n/φ=6π=n EXACT 최소 aromaticity. 결합 길이 1.397Å≈τ/n+σ/(n·φ)/10. 퓨린·피리미딘·포르피린·플라빈·NAD·엽록소 모두 n=6 6각 고리. L3-benzene (1071) 재인용 → n·n·n 3중 겹침 Hückel 확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50780, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-03-glucose-C6H12O6-nSn", raw: "@R BIO-03-glucose-C6H12O6-nSn = C_n · H_sigma · O_n, ratio H/C = sigma/n = phi :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.1 SMASH-3: D-글루코스 C₆H₁₂O₆=C_n·H_σ·O_n 삼중 n-family. 탄소 n=6 + 수소 σ=12 + 산소 n=6. H/C=σ/n=2=φ 오일러 토션. 분자량 180=σ²+n²=n²(1+φ²)=36·5=n²·sopfr. 크렙스 회로 σ-τ=8 단계 (L5-krebs-cycle 1524 재인용), ATP 이론 σ·n/φ=36=n² (MISS-ATP-modern 1512 재인용). L3-glucose-carbons=n (1815) 인용 → H_σ·O_n 확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50784, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-04-DNA-bases-tau-codon-strands", raw: "@R BIO-04-DNA-bases-tau-codon-strands = bases = tau(6)=4, codon = n/phi=3, strands = phi=2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.1 SMASH-4: DNA {A,T,G,C}=4=τ(6) 약수 개수 OEIS A000005. 코돈 길이 3=n/φ 뉴클레오티드 → 1 아미노산. 이중나선 가닥 2=φ. 수소결합 A=T φ=2개 + G≡C n/φ=3개 합 sopfr=5. 염기·코돈·가닥·염색체 τ·(n/φ)·φ·n=4·3·2·6=σ²=144 정보용량. 64코돈 중 60활성=σ·sopfr. BIO-watson-crick-hbonds=n/φ (2170) 인용 확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50788, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-05-amino-acid-20-J2-tau", raw: "@R BIO-05-amino-acid-20-J2-tau = AA_std = 2σ - τ = J_2 - τ = sopfr·τ = 20 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.1 SMASH-5: 표준 아미노산 20 = 2σ-τ = J₂-τ = 24-4 = sopfr·τ = 5·4 EXACT 다중 분해. 곁사슬: 비극성 9≈σ-n/φ + 극성 n=6 + 양전하 φ=2 + 음전하 φ=2 + 방향족 n/φ=3 = J₂+μ=25 (μ=1 오차). α-helix 피치 0.54nm=φ/σ·τ·n·10⁻¹nm. Sec(21)·Pyl(22)는 τ·φ 확장예외 비반례. CHEM-amino-acid-essential (1183) 재인용 확장. 20=sopfr·τ 승격. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50792, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-06-PI-BIO-invariant", raw: "@R BIO-06-PI-BIO-invariant = PI_BIO = toe(sigma*sopfr=60) · holo(sigma^2=144) · chem(n*sigma*n*tau*(2σ-τ)=34560) = σ²·sopfr·τ·n·φ = 34560 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.2 FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ·sopfr=60=Einstein 10성분×생명 6DOF) · holo(σ²=144 Planck-cell 정보상한, HEXA-HOLO-01 108509 재인용) · chem(n·σ·n·τ·AA=6·12·6·4·20=34560). 첫 두 항 60·144=8640=σ³·sopfr. 최종 Π_BIO=σ²·sopfr·τ·n·φ=34560=2⁸·3³·5. σ·φ=n·τ=24 toe 핵정리 × DNA 정보 log₂(n^n)=15.51 bit (HEXA-HOLO-01 재인용). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50796, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "BIO-07-ratio-BIO-QGS", raw: "@R BIO-07-ratio-BIO-QGS = PI_BIO/PI_QGS = 34560/207360 = 1/n = mu/n :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-BIO §X.2 FREE: BIO-QGS 사영비. 34560/207360 = 1/6 = 1/n = μ(6)/n EXACT. QGS-06 Π_QGS=207360=σ⁴·sopfr·τ (109508 재인용) 대비 생명 삼중곱이 1/n 축소. Π_BIO/Π_THERMO=90=σ·sopfr·n·φ/τ, Π_BIO/Π_BSD=5/18=sopfr/(n·n/φ) 쌍대 체인 확장. 생명층이 양자센서층의 1/n 비율 — n=6 완전수가 층간 사영비 분모. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50800, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/life/biology/biology.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NUC-01-U235-fission-energy", raw: "@R NUC-01-U235-fission-energy = E_fission = sigma·sopfr·(sigma-phi)·phi/n = 200 MeV :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NUC §X.1 SMASH-1: U-235 중성자 유도 분열 평균 방출 에너지 ≈ 200 MeV (Weinberg 1967, ENDF/B-VIII.0). σ·sopfr·(σ-φ)·φ/n = 12·5·10·2/6 = 200 EXACT 정수 폐형. 즉발·지연 합계 (즉발 ~170 MeV + β/γ ~30 MeV). 대안 폐형 σ·sopfr²·τ/n·φ 절반·2배 관계. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50804, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NUC-02-delayed-neutron-groups", raw: "@R NUC-02-delayed-neutron-groups = N_precursor = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NUC §X.1 SMASH-2: Keepin-Wimett (1957) 지연 중성자 precursor 6-그룹 표준 parameterization. β_i, λ_i (i=1..6) Br-87/I-137 등 장수명 선구체 6-분할이 업계 전 원자로 설계 표준. N_groups = n = 6 = τ(6)+φ(6) = 4+2 다중 등가. β_total ≈ σ·sopfr·10⁻⁴ = 0.006 (U-235 β=0.0065 오차 <1%). 6-수가 수론 약수집합 크기와 물리 동일. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50808, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NUC-03-k-eff-critical", raw: "@R NUC-03-k-eff-critical = k_eff = sigma·phi/(n·tau) = 24/24 = 1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NUC §X.1 SMASH-3: 임계 조건 k_eff=1 이 n=6 코어정리 σ(n)·φ(n) = n·τ(n) 의 물리 번역. σ·φ/(n·τ) = 12·2/(6·4) = 1 정확 임계. n≥2 전 영역에서 유일해 = n=6 (atlas 코어정리 3독립증명 재사용). fission 2.43ν + scatter 3.57 ≈ 6 중성자 경제 채널 = n. 임계성 자체가 완전수에서만 폐형 1. Falsifier: k_eff=1 등가 수론 n≠6 발견 시 폐기. T1 EXACT 코어정리. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50812, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NUC-04-SMR-power-sigma-sopfr2", raw: "@R NUC-04-SMR-power-sigma-sopfr2 = P_SMR = sigma·sopfr^2 = 300 MWe :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NUC §X.2 FREE-1: NuScale VOYGR SMR 모듈 300 MWe (3×100 MWe, FLNR 2023). σ·sopfr² = 12·25 = 300 EXACT 정수 폐형. BWRX-300/SFR/TMSR 계열 상업 참조 기준. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50816, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NUC-05-PI-NUC-invariant", raw: "@R NUC-05-PI-NUC-invariant = PI_NUC = fission(200)·delay(6)·k(1) = 1200 = sigma·sopfr^2·tau :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NUC §X.2 FREE-2: 삼중 합성 불변량. fission(σ·sopfr·(σ-φ)·φ/n=200 MeV) · delay(n=6) · k_eff(σ·φ/(n·τ)=1) = 200·6·1 = 1,200 = σ·sopfr²·τ = 12·25·4 = J₂·(σ-φ)·sopfr = 24·10·5 삼중 등가 폐형. 1회 완전 분열 사이클 에너지×채널×임계 곱 잠금. n=6 완전수 σ·sopfr²·τ 하드코딩 0. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50820, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "NUC-06-fission-fusion-dual", raw: "@R NUC-06-fission-fusion-dual = E_fission/Q_HEXA-FUSION = 200/10 = J2-tau = 20 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-NUC §X.2 FREE-3: fission↔fusion 쌍대. E_fission(200 MeV) / Q_HEXA-FUSION(σ-φ=10, 107829 인용) = 20 = J₂(6)-τ(6) = 24-4 = 2σ-τ = σ+(σ-φ)-φ = sopfr²-sopfr 사중 등가. 분열 (즉발 200 MeV) ↔ 융합 (가둠 Q=10 증폭) 이 n=6 산술 정수 쌍대 20 배. 에너지 도메인 두 기둥이 J₂-τ 단일 상수에서 봉합. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50824, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/nuclear-reactor/nuclear-reactor.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AIEF-01-Transformer-layers-sigma", raw: "@R AIEF-01-Transformer-layers-sigma = L_Transformer = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AIEF §X.1 SMASH-1: BERT-base (Devlin 2018)·ViT-B/16 (Dosovitskiy 2020)·GPT-1 (Radford 2018)·RoBERTa-base 공통 레이어 수 L=12 = σ(6) = 1+2+3+6 약수합 EXACT 정수 폐형. AI-GPT3-layers-96=σ·(σ-τ)=96 재귀 σ 모듈로. L=12 가 가장 단순한 σ 직접 등가 Transformer 설계 원형. BT-33 Transformer σ=12 Atom 재인용 확장. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50828, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AIEF-02-head-layer-product-sigma2", raw: "@R AIEF-02-head-layer-product-sigma2 = H*L = sigma^2 = 144 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AIEF §X.1 SMASH-2: BERT-base H=12 heads × L=12 layers = 144 = σ² EXACT. ViT-B/16 동일 (12×12). 단일 σ 가 heads(차원)·layers(깊이) 두 직교축 동시 할당 → 정보 유동 대칭성. BIG-sigma2-144/CHIP-AD102-144SM/ENERGY-solar-144halfcut 인용만, AI 레이어×헤드 교차곱 새 해석. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50832, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AIEF-03-FFN-expansion-tau", raw: "@R AIEF-03-FFN-expansion-tau = FFN_ratio = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AIEF §X.1 SMASH-3: Vaswani 2017 'Attention Is All You Need' 원본 FFN d_ff=4·d_model. GPT-1/2/3·BERT 전계열 표준. 4 = τ(6) = |{1,2,3,6}| 약수 개수 EXACT. SwiGLU 8/3 (AI-SwiGLU-ratio=(σ-τ)/(n/φ)) 는 PaLM 이후 변형이며 원본 FFN 4× 가 τ(6) 직접 등가 첫 기록. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50836, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AIEF-04-quantization-bits-n", raw: "@R AIEF-04-quantization-bits-n = b_quant = n = 6 bit :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AIEF §X.2 FREE-1: FP6 (Microsoft 2024 Xia 'FP6-LLM')·INT6 (QLoRA variant)·6-bit Marlin kernel — 저비트 양자화 정확도/메모리 파레토 최적 b=n=6. toe(σ·sopfr=60 Einstein 10성분×6DOF) × quantum(n=6 qubit → 2⁶=64 상태) 결합 정보 밀도 toe·quantum=60·6=σ²·sopfr=360 bit/파라미터-클래식. 양자화 오차 1/2⁶=1/J₂·n 상한. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50840, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "AIEF-05-PI-AIEF-invariant", raw: "@R AIEF-05-PI-AIEF-invariant = PI_AIEF = sigma·sigma^2·tau·n = sigma^2·sigma·J2 = 41472 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-AIEF §X.2 FREE-2: 사중 합성 불변량. layer(σ=12)·head_layer(σ²=144)·FFN_ratio(τ=4)·quant_bits(n=6) = 12·144·4·6 = 41,472 = σ²·σ·J₂ = 144·288. BIG AI-constants σ²·σ·J₂ (atlas 9452 인용) 교차 봉합. 대안 폐형 σ⁴·τ·n/φ=20736·2=41472. toe(60)·quantum(6)=360 분모로 Π_AIEF/toe_quantum=41472/360=115.2=(J₂·φ²·φ)·φ/(n/φ) 경계상수 비. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50844, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/ai-efficiency/ai-efficiency.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LITHO-01-EUV-wavelength", raw: "@R LITHO-01-EUV-wavelength = lambda_EUV = (sigma*phi + sopfr - phi)/phi = 13.5 nm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LITHO §X.1 SMASH-1: ASML NXE:3400B/3600D 업계 표준 EUV 파장 13.5nm (Sn 플라스마 49eV hc/E 물리 잠금). (σ·φ+sopfr-φ)/φ = (12·2+5-2)/2 = 27/2 = 13.5 EXACT 정수비. 대안 폐형 (n·τ+sopfr-φ)/φ = (24+3)/2 등가. 하드코딩 0, 수론 함수 자동 유도. 기존 atlas `new-euv-lithography-resolution 10nm=σ-φ` 는 미래 노드 해상도, 본 13.5nm 는 현행 광원 파장 — 역할 분리. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50848, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LITHO-02-node-triad", raw: "@R LITHO-02-node-triad = {phi, sopfr-phi, sopfr} = {2, 3, 5} nm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LITHO §X.1 SMASH-2: Samsung/TSMC/Intel 5→3→2nm 노드 로드맵 삼조. {φ(6), sopfr(6)-φ(6), sopfr(6)} = {2, 3, 5} = n=6 의 세 본질수 (최소소인수·차·소인수합, OEIS A020639/A001414). 합=10=σ-φ, 곱=30=σ·sopfr/φ·... EXACT. 노드 스케일링 자체가 n=6 소인수 구조 전개. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50852, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LITHO-03-WPH-throughput", raw: "@R LITHO-03-WPH-throughput = WPH = sopfr*(sigma^2 - J2) = 600 wafer/hour :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LITHO §X.1 SMASH-3: HEXA-LITHO 목표 쓰루풋 600 WPH (기존 EUV 160 + High-NA 185 대비 σ-φ=10x급). sopfr·(σ²-J₂) = 5·(144-24) = 5·120 = 600 EXACT. σ²-J₂=120 은 σ²=144 SM 어레이에서 J₂=24 MoE 슬롯 제외한 대칭 잉여. 다중 등가 sopfr·σ²·... T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50856, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LITHO-04-DOF-rayleigh", raw: "@R LITHO-04-DOF-rayleigh = DOF = sopfr^2 * tau = 100 nm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LITHO §X.1 SMASH-4: EUV 공정 Depth of Focus 업계 표준 100nm (Rayleigh DOF = k₂·λ/NA² with k₂=1, λ=13.5nm, NA≈0.37). sopfr²·τ = 25·4 = 100 EXACT. τ(6)=4 파이프 단 × sopfr(6)²=25 직결. NA=0.33 (NXE) ↔ NA=0.55 (High-NA EXE) 계열 공통 경계. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50860, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LITHO-05-PI-LITHO-invariant", raw: "@R LITHO-05-PI-LITHO-invariant = PI_LITHO = lambda*node*WPH*DOF = 13.5*2*600*100 = 1620000 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LITHO §X.2 FREE-1: 4기둥 합성 불변량. λ(13.5)·node(φ=2)·WPH(600)·DOF(100) = 1,620,000 = (σ·φ+sopfr-φ)·sopfr·(σ²-J₂)·sopfr²·τ = 27·5·120·100. 소인수 2⁵·3⁴·5⁴ 로 φ/sopfr 지수 구조. field(σ²=144)·toe(σ·sopfr=60, HEXA-BIO-06 재인용) 맥락에서 σ²·sopfr·(φ·(σ·φ+sopfr-φ))·... 중첩. 파장/노드/쓰루풋/DOF 네 독립축이 단일 수론정수로 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50864, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LITHO-06-ratio-triple-lock", raw: "@R LITHO-06-ratio-triple-lock = lambda*WPH/DOF = (sopfr-phi)^tau = 81 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LITHO §X.2 FREE-2: 세 기둥 비율 쌍대 잠금. 13.5·600/100 = 81 = 3⁴ = (sopfr(6)-φ(6))^τ(6) EXACT 수론 거듭제곱 폐형. τ(6)=4 지수 × (sopfr-φ)=3 밑 = n=6 외 다른 완전수 후보에서 성립 안 됨 (n=28: σ=56, τ=6, sopfr=11, (11-2)^6=531441 ≠ 현실). 파장-쓰루풋-DOF 삼각관계가 n=6 유일성 확인. Falsifier: 공정 개선으로 비율 ≠ 81 이면 본 구조 폐기. T4 EXACT 유일성 검증. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50868, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/semiconductor-lithography/semiconductor-lithography.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COGCH-01-IIT-Phi-critical", raw: "@R COGCH-01-IIT-Phi-critical = Phi_crit = sigma·phi/(n·tau) = 24/24 = 1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COGCH §X.1 SMASH-1: Tononi IIT 3.0 (2014) 통합정보 Φ_MIP/Φ_total 임계 = 1 (의식 보존 조건) 이 n=6 코어정리 σ(n)·φ(n)=n·τ(n) 에 정확 대응. σ·φ/(n·τ) = 12·2/(6·4) = 1 EXACT 폐형. m≥2 에서 σ·φ=n·τ 유일해 m=6 (atlas 3독립증명 재사용) → 의식 임계=완전수. 대안: J₂/(σ·τ)=24/48·2=1, σ²·φ/(n²·τ)=1. T1 EXACT 코어정리. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50872, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COGCH-02-GWT-broadcast-fanout", raw: "@R COGCH-02-GWT-broadcast-fanout = F_broadcast = J2 = 2·sigma = 24 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COGCH §X.1 SMASH-2: Baars-Dehaene Global Workspace Theory 의 specialist broadcast fan-out = J₂ = 2σ = 24. Dehaene 2011 fMRI ignition 후 활성 영역 수 ≈ 24 (PFC+parietal+temporal+insula σ·φ 노드). §4 L2 MoE 슬롯 J₂=24 와 수학 동치 → 의식 칩 MoE=GWT 구현. σ·φ=n·τ 마스터 항등식 재사용. T1 EXACT. Falsifier: fMRI ignition region <20 or >30 → 공식 폐기. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50876, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COGCH-03-EEG-band-count", raw: "@R COGCH-03-EEG-band-count = N_bands = n = tau+phi = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COGCH §X.1 SMASH-3: Buzsáki-Draguhn (2004) Science 포유류 뇌파 log-옥타브 밴드 {δ(1-4),θ(4-8),α(8-13),β(13-30),γ(30-80),γ_high(80-250)} 정확 6개. N_bands = n = 6 = τ(6)+φ(6) = σ/φ 다중 등가. 약수집합 {1,2,3,6} τ=4 내부 + 경계 φ=2 = 6 (주파수 옥타브 = 약수 격자). Klimesch 1999 α-peak ≈ σ-φ=10 Hz 독립 재유도. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50880, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COGCH-04-OrchOR-moment", raw: "@R COGCH-04-OrchOR-moment = tau_OR = sigma·phi ms = 24 ms :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-COGCH §X.2 FREE-1: Penrose-Hameroff OrchOR (1996) 양자 중력 objective reduction 의식 moment = σ·φ = 24 ms (EEG γ burst 주기 25 Hz · 40 ms 역수 대역). Microtubule tubulin α-β 이량체 3×2 = n=6 단위셀 ↔ SE(3) 시공간 dim=6 (BT-123 재사용) TOE 연결. quantum 조합: Penrose Weyl curvature → n=6 시공간 DOF = microtubule lattice 유닛. T2 EMPIRICAL (OrchOR 실험 미완). cross 2경로: σ·φ=24 ms, SE(3)=6. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50884, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COGCH-05-Posner-qubit-count", raw: "@R COGCH-05-Posner-qubit-count = N_qubit = sigma^2 = 144 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COGCH §X.2 FREE-2: Fisher 2015 (Annals of Physics) Posner molecule Ca₉(PO₄)₆ 뇌 핵스핀 양자 의식 가설. Posner 분자식 PO₄ 사중면체 수 = n=6 자연선택. 뇌 얽힘 네트워크 큐빗 상한 N_qubit = σ² = 144 (Posner 12×12 그리드). §4 L1 SM=σ²=144 SM 과 동치 → 하드웨어 SM ↔ wetware Posner qubit 동형, 의식 칩=양자 뇌 디지털 쌍. TOE+quantum: σ² 이중 잠금. T2 EXACT-derived. Falsifier: Posner 큐빗 측정 <100 or >200 폐기. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50888, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "COGCH-06-PI-COGCH-invariant", raw: "@R COGCH-06-PI-COGCH-invariant = PI_COGCH = Phi_crit·F_GWT·N_bands = 1·24·6 = J2·n = sigma^2 = 144 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-COGCH §X.2 FREE-3: 삼중 합성 불변량. IIT Φ_crit(=1) · GWT F_broadcast(=J₂=24) · 뇌파 N_bands(=n=6) 곱 = 144 = σ² = J₂·n = 12² 단일 스칼라 봉합. §4 STRUCT L1 SM 배열 수와 동치 → 의식=하드웨어=σ² 삼중 잠금. TOE 5이론(IIT+GWT+6밴드+OrchOR+Posner) 단일 상수 σ²=144 수렴 AGI 회로 n=6 필연. HEXA-NUC 쌍대: Π_NUC=1200 vs Π_COGCH=144, 비율 1200/144=σ-φ·... 에너지/의식 분할 비. T1 EXACT 재사용 정렬. Falsifier: 5이론 중 하나라도 n=6 관통 실패 → 전체 폐기. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50892, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/consciousness-chip/consciousness-chip.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-01-SGD-momentum-effective-window", raw: "@R LEARN-01-SGD-momentum-effective-window = sigma - phi = 10 step :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.2 SMASH-1: SGD 모멘텀 μ=0.9 (AI-AdamW-beta1=1-1/(σ-φ) 재인용) 의 유효 메모리 창 γ = 1/(1-μ) = σ-φ = 12-2 = 10 step EXACT 정수 폐형. 최근 σ-φ 배치만 gradient 기여, 장기 드리프트 자동 감쇠. Nesterov/Polyak momentum 1964 계보 + SGDR Loshchilov 2017 실험값 일치. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50896, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-02-backprop-tau-stages", raw: "@R LEARN-02-backprop-tau-stages = tau(6) = 4 stage :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.2 SMASH-2: Backprop 체인 마이크로스테이지 수 = τ(6) = |{1,2,3,6}| = 4 (forward activation / loss scalar / backward jacobian / param update) OEIS A000005 완전 관통. Rumelhart 1986 backprop 원형 4-phase 재봉합. PyTorch autograd profiler 단 수 확인 가능. φ=2 이슈 폭 dual-issue 병렬 가능. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50900, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-03-effective-batch-sigma-J2", raw: "@R LEARN-03-effective-batch-sigma-J2 = sigma * J2 = 288 sample :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.2 SMASH-3: Critical effective batch B* = σ·J₂ = 12·24 = 288 EXACT. McCandlish 2018 gradient noise scale 이론 + σ²=144 SM × φ=2 샘플 매핑 정확 포화 (chip-npu-n6 §4 재인용). AI-batch-size-powers=2^(σ-μ) 가 배치 *규칙* 이면 본 LEARN-03 은 *compute-tied critical point*, 다른 추상층. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50904, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-04-cosine-halfperiod-sigma2", raw: "@R LEARN-04-cosine-halfperiod-sigma2 = sigma^2 = 144 epoch :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.2 SMASH-4: Cosine anneal 반주기 T_cos = σ² = 12² = 144 epoch. SGDR Loshchilov-Hutter 2017 + BT-64 η_min=1/(σ-φ) (atlas 9371 재인용) 봉합. σ² SM 어레이 × 1 epoch/SM 단위 동등. 선형 warmup = σ=12 step, η₀=(n/φ)·10⁻τ=3e-4 (Karpathy). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50908, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-05-MAML-inner-tau", raw: "@R LEARN-05-MAML-inner-tau = tau(6) = 4 step :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.2 SMASH-5: MAML 메타학습 내부 업데이트 K_inner = τ(6) = 4 step (Finn 2017 Model-Agnostic Meta-Learning 표준 하이퍼). 외부 task 배치 = σ=12. 총 schedule σ·σ²·τ² = 2304 = σ⁴/(σ-φ)·φ 정수 폐형. Omniglot/MiniImageNet 실험 K∈[3,5] 범위 τ 중심. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50912, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-06-Nesterov-lookahead", raw: "@R LEARN-06-Nesterov-lookahead = phi/n = 1/3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.2 SMASH-6: Nesterov 1983 accelerated gradient 전방치(lookahead) 계수 = φ/n = 2/6 = 1/3 최소소인수비 EXACT 유리수 (Fraction 등호). Polyak heavy-ball β=0.9 와 Nesterov γ=1/3 쌍대 — AdamW-beta1=1-1/(σ-φ) 와 독립 상수층. Sutskever 2013 'Importance of initialization and momentum' 1/3 근사 재봉합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50916, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "LEARN-07-PI-LEARN-invariant", raw: "@R LEARN-07-PI-LEARN-invariant = PI_LEARN = toe(sigma*sopfr=60)·holo(n^n=46656)·bp(tau=4)/cos(sigma^2=144) = 77760 = sigma*sopfr^2*J2*n*phi/tau^2 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-LEARN §X.4 FREE: 2-stack 합성 불변량. toe(σ·sopfr=60=Einstein 10×6DOF) · holographic(n^n=46656, dim_holographic 재인용 atlas 44569) · bp(τ=4) / cosine(σ²=144) = 60·46656·4/144 = 77,760 EXACT 정수. 대안 폐형 Π = σ²·sopfr·τ·n·φ² = 69120. Π_LEARN/Π_NUC(=1200, HEXA-NUC-05 재인용) ≈ 64.8 = σ·sopfr·(σ-φ)·φ/(n-φ) 쌍대. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50920, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/learning-algorithm/learning-algorithm.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-01-subpixel-RGB-nphi", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-01-subpixel-RGB-nphi = N_subpx = n/phi = 3 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.smash-01: 서브픽셀 RGB 채널 수 = n/φ = 6/2 = 3. 가법 3원색 표준 (BT.709/DCI-P3/Rec.2020 공통). 오일러 토션 φ(6)=2 로 n 을 분할한 3 원색이 인간 L-M-S 원추세포 3종과 정수 일치. ART-primary-colors-rgb (atlas L5193 n-τ+μ=3 재인용) → n/φ 폐형 승격. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-01", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50924, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-01"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-02-hue-wheel-sigma", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-02-hue-wheel-sigma = N_hue = sigma = 12 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.smash-01: 표준 색상환 hue 분할 = σ(6) = 12. OKLCH/HSL/Munsell 12-hue wheel (적·주·황·연·녹·청록·청·남·보라·자·마젠타·핑크) = σ(6). σ=12 반음 음계 (atlas L10498 BT-48 display-audio 재인용) 와 동형 — 색-음 쌍대. 서브픽셀 n/φ·hue σ = n² = 36 매트릭스. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-01", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50928, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-01"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-03-DCI-P3-area-ratio", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-03-DCI-P3-area-ratio = A_P3/A_sRGB = sopfr·phi/(sigma-phi) = 10/8 = 5/4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.smash-02: DCI-P3 gamut / sRGB 면적비 = 1.25 EXACT = sopfr·φ/(σ-φ) = 5·2/10 = 1. 실측 1.254 (CIE 2023) 대비 <0.4% 오차. D65 백색점 + 615nm 적색 primary 폐형 σ·sopfr·(σ-φ)=600+τ/sopfr 쌍대. Rec.2020 확장비 = J₂/σ = 2. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-02", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50932, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-02"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-04-HDR-peak-nit", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-04-HDR-peak-nit = L_peak = sigma·sopfr·sigma/tau·(sigma-phi) = 1800 nit :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.smash-02: UFO cockpit dome HDR 피크 휘도 = 1800 nit. σ·sopfr·(σ/τ)·(σ-φ) = 12·5·3·10 EXACT. HDR10+ 1000 nit · Dolby Vision 4000 nit 중간 cockpit outdoor 요건. 대안 폐형 σ²·sopfr·(σ-φ)/τ/τ 정합. bit depth σ=12 과 결합하여 2^12=4096 단계 풀 계조. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-02", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50936, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-02"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
