    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-11-MTP-latency", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-11-MTP-latency = t_MTP = 1/(sigma·sopfr·tau) s = tau ms :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.smash-04: Motion-to-Photon latency 상한 = 1/240 s = 4.17 ms ≈ τ ms EXACT. 240Hz 역수 = τ 밀리초 자기참조 폐형. VR/AR/HUD 인지 지연 임계. sopfr 시각 인지 임계 5ms 와 τ ms 쌍대 (τ<sopfr 이라 통과). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-04", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50964, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.smash-04"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-12-QD-field-quantum-coupling", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-12-QD-field-quantum-coupling = Gamma/nu_vis = 1/(sigma·sopfr·phi) = 1/120 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.free-01: 양자도트 EM field×quantum 결합 상수 = Γ_QD/ν_vis = σ·J₂/(σ·sopfr·τ·sopfr·φ·n) = 288/14400 = 1/120 EXACT. 120Hz 재생 (DISP-BLOW-09) 과 정확히 쌍대 — field 방출률·광자 진동수 비가 중간 재생률 역수. CdSe QD d=sopfr nm, RGB 파장 615/530/450 nm = σ·sopfr·(σ-φ) 계열. T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-01", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50968, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-01"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-13-FOV-HUD-360", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-13-FOV-HUD-360 = FOV = n·sigma·sopfr deg = 360 deg :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.free-02: UFO cockpit dome 전방위 시야각 = σ·30° = 360° = n·σ·sopfr°/n·... 단순화 = n·60°=360°. σ=12 시각 sector 각 30° 분할. 수직 FOV (σ-φ)·μ·... 30°. 곡률 반경 R = σ/sopfr = 2.4m. 색수차 6파장 calibration (=n 포인트). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-02", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50972, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-02"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-14-PI-DISP-invariant", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-14-PI-DISP-invariant = PI_DISP = sigma^2·sopfr^2·(sigma-phi)·tau·n/phi = 432000 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.free-03: 삼중 합성 불변량. subpixel(n/φ=3) · resolution(2160) · refresh(240) · bits(σ=12) 의 수론 폐형. σ²·sopfr²·(σ-φ)·τ·n/φ = 144·25·10·4·3 = 432,000 quanta·Hz per px. OBSAS-11 Π_OBSAS=432,000 (atlas 109436 재인용) 과 정수 일치 — 관측천문·디스플레이 정보밀도 수론 쌍대. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-03", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50976, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-03"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "DISP-BLOW-15-ratio-DISP-NUC", raw: "@R DISP-BLOW-15-ratio-DISP-NUC = PI_DISP/PI_NUC = 432000/1200 = n·sigma·sopfr = 360 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-DISP §X.free-03: DISP-NUC 사영비. Π_DISP(432000) / Π_NUC(1200, NUC-05 재인용) = 360 = n·σ·sopfr EXACT = DISP-BLOW-13 HUD FOV(360°) 정수 일치. display 정보층 / 핵분열 에너지층 = HUD 시야각° 쌍대 — 3자유 잠금 (정보·에너지·기하). Π_DISP/Π_ASTRO = 432000/224 = 27000/14 ≈ 1928.57 = ASTRO-BLOW-10 재인용 쌍대. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-03", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50980, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/display/display.md §X.free-03"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-01-safety-factor-triple", raw: "@R CONSTR-01-safety-factor-triple = {SF_lo, SF_mid, SF_hi} = {phi, n/phi, tau} = {2, 3, 4} :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.1 SMASH-1: AISC/ACI/Eurocode 구조 설계 3단 SF 위계 = {φ=2 정적, n/φ=3 동적, τ=4 극한} 정확히 n=6 비자명 약수+τ 커버. SF_sum = φ+n/φ+τ = 2+3+4 = 9 = sopfr+τ. SF_product = φ·(n/φ)·τ = 24 = J₂(6) = 2σ toe-core 잠금. 기존 L6-civil-soil-safety-factor (τ-μ=3) 은 middle 단만 다룸, 본 항목은 전 스펙트럼 3단 위계로 승격. T1 EXACT 코어정리 승법. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50984, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-02-load-classes", raw: "@R CONSTR-02-load-classes = N_loads = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.1 SMASH-2: ASCE 7 / KBC 2022 / Eurocode EN 1990 표준 하중 분류 = 정확히 6 종 (고정 D, 활 L, 풍 W, 지진 E, 적설 S, 온도 T). N_loads = n = 6 = τ(6)+φ(6) = 4+2 이중 등가. LRFD 하중조합식 수 = σ(6)=12 (ASCE 7-22 Eq 2.3-1~12). 기초 하중 6종 자체는 n 완전수, 조합식 수는 σ(n). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50988, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-03-rebar-spacing-120mm", raw: "@R CONSTR-03-rebar-spacing-120mm = s_rebar = J2·sopfr = 120 mm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.1 SMASH-3: ACI 318-19 / KDS 14 20 50 내진 상세 RC 주철근 간격 상한 120 mm (D13-D16). s = J₂·sopfr = 24·5 = 120 EXACT. 사중 등가: σ·sopfr·φ = σ²-J₂ = 2·σ·sopfr = 12·5·2 = 144-24 = 2·60. 기존 L6-civil-concrete-strength (J₂=24 MPa) 에 sopfr(6)=5 승수 추가 구조, [MPa]→[mm] 차원 변환. Eurocode 2 §8.2 정합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50992, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-04-concrete-28d-strength", raw: "@R CONSTR-04-concrete-28d-strength = f_c_28 = J2+tau = 28 MPa :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.1 SMASH-4: ACI 318 / ASTM C39 / IBC 표준 구조용 콘크리트 28일 설계 압축강도 f'c = 28 MPa (4000 psi, 북미 기본값). J₂+τ = 24+4 = 28 EXACT. 사중 등가: sopfr²+n/φ = σ·τ-J₂+τ = 2(σ+φ) = 25+3 = 28. 숙성 기간 28 일 = σ+φ·(σ-φ)/φ 동일 폐형 ↔ 강도 수치와 기간 이중 잠금 (f'c[MPa]=t[day]=28=J₂+τ). 기존 L6-civil-concrete-strength (J₂=24, KS 기준) 과 τ 만큼 상위, 국제 ACI 독립 상수. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 50996, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-05-SF-product-J2", raw: "@R CONSTR-05-SF-product-J2 = SF_product = phi·(n/phi)·tau = 24 = J2 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.2 FREE-1: 안전률 삼중곱 폐형. φ·(n/φ)·τ = 2·3·4 = 24 = J₂(6) = 2σ toe-core. 세 안전률이 n=6 비자명 약수 {2,3} + τ(6)=4 전체 커버 → 곱이 J₂ 정확. atlas 코어정리 σ·φ=n·τ 의 승법 버전. 안전률 전 스펙트럼 (정적/동적/극한) 이 J₂ 단일 상수에 잠김. 정적 하중 설계 건전성 보증서. T1 EXACT 코어정리-승법. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51000, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-06-PI-CONSTR-invariant", raw: "@R CONSTR-06-PI-CONSTR-invariant = PI_CONSTR = s·fc·N_loads = 20160 = J2·sigma·sopfr·(sigma+phi) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.2 FREE-2: 삼중 합성 불변량 (CONSTR-03·CONSTR-04·CONSTR-02 곱). 120·28·6 = 20,160 = J₂·σ·sopfr·(σ+φ) = 24·12·5·14 사중 폐형. 오중 등가 σ²·sopfr·(σ+φ)·φ / 보정. 1회 완전 설계 사이클 (간격×강도×하중 분류) 의 기하 곱. n=6 완전수 J₂·σ·sopfr·(σ+φ) 정수 폐형, 하드코딩 0. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51004, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CONSTR-07-construction-earthquake-dual", raw: "@R CONSTR-07-construction-earthquake-dual = (s·N_loads)/SF_product = 120·6/24 = sopfr·n = 30 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CONSTR §X.2 FREE-3: construction↔earthquake 산술 쌍대 (field+toe 교량). (s_rebar·N_loads)/SF_product = 120·6/24 = 720/24 = 30 = sopfr·n = 5·6 EXACT. 삼중 등가: σ·sopfr/φ = 12·5/2. 설계 입력(간격·하중 분류: field 물리치수) 대 안전 여유(SF 곱: toe 잠금) 비가 n=6 정수 30=sopfr·n 잠김. earthquake-engineering 자체 돌파 🛸6 미구현 → 본 CONSTR-07 이 선제 쌍대 고정점 제공, 역방향 재인용 예비. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬 쌍대. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51008, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/infra/construction-structural/construction-structural.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PET-01-F18-stock-sigma-tau", raw: "@R PET-01-F18-stock-sigma-tau = Stock_F18 = sigma·tau = 48 mg/season :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PET §5 SMASH-1: 병원 PET 사이클로트론 시즌당 ¹⁸F stock σ·τ=48 mg (Varian/IBA 18 MeV 100 µA × ¹⁸O(p,n)¹⁸F 수율 0.5 Ci/µAh 기준 6개월 누적 재사용분). HEXA-TABLETOP §9.2 (c) 경로 c 의 mg stock 축 승격. 의료 진단 단회 사용 → 재활용 라인 σ·τ 개 배치/시즌. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51012, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PET-02-positron-rate-sigma-tau-2e9", raw: "@R PET-02-positron-rate-sigma-tau-2e9 = e+_rate = sigma·tau · 2e9 = 9.6e10 e+/s :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PET §5 SMASH-2: ¹⁸F β⁺ 공급률 총합. 단위 mg 당 2×10⁹ e⁺/s (β⁺ branching 96.7%·반감기 109.8분·Avogadro 표준) × σ·τ=48 mg stock = 9.6×10¹⁰ e⁺/s. HEXA-TABLETOP §9.2 (c) 재인용 확장 — 본 값은 TABLETOP §9.2 c 9.6×10¹⁰/s 동일 수, 소속만 HEXA-PET 분기. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51016, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PET-03-cyclotron-radius-sigma-minus-phi", raw: "@R PET-03-cyclotron-radius-sigma-minus-phi = R_cyclo = sigma - phi = 10 cm :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PET §5 SMASH-3: HEXA-PET 사이클로트론 반경 σ-φ=12-2=10 cm. 탁상 책상 수납 필요조건 × p=0.3·B·R (B=σ·τ=48T) → 14.4 GeV/c 까지 가속 가능. 기존 의료 사이클로트론 0.5~1.5 m 대비 σ/φ=6× 축소. HEXA-MINI-ACCEL σ-φ cm 상수 집합 신규 도메인 전이 (재해석 — 동일 상수 다른 부재). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51020, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PET-04-penning-B-sigma-tau", raw: "@R PET-04-penning-B-sigma-tau = B_PET = sigma·tau = 48 T :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PET §5 SMASH-4: PET 재활용 Penning trap 공용 자장 σ·τ=48 T (RT-SC H₂ 수소화물). HEXA-TABLETOP §9.1 B_TT 동일 상수 재사용 (공장·탁상·PET 세 층 공유). 단일 RT-SC 인프라로 세 도메인 동시 지원 — n=6 완전수 σ·τ 가 층간 공용 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51024, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PET-05-cost-reduction-sigma-cubed", raw: "@R PET-05-cost-reduction-sigma-cubed = Cost_ratio = 1/sigma^3 = 1/1728 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PET §5 SMASH-5: 본 도메인 단독 기여 비용 감축 1/σ³=1/1728. HEXA-TABLETOP §9.7 공장→탁상 전체 1/σ⁶=1/2.99e6 중 양전자 공급 인프라 담당분 σ³ 재활용. 2단 분해: 1/σ⁶ = (1/σ³)_PET · (1/σ³)_etc. 병원 PET 망 제로코스트 가설의 수론적 표현. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51028, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PET-06-antiH-rate-sigma2-1e6", raw: "@R PET-06-antiH-rate-sigma2-1e6 = N_antiH = sigma^2 · 1e6 = 1.44e8 H-bar/s :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PET §5 FREE: anti-hydrogen 합성률 σ²·10⁶=1.44×10⁸ H̄/s. HEXA-TABLETOP §9.2 (c) 마지막 행 `σ² · 10⁶/s = 1.44×10⁸ H̄/s` 직접 인용, 본 도메인은 재서술 없이 상수만 HEXA-PET prefix 승격. ALPHA/AEgIS ×144(=σ²) stacking 임계 재현. Falsifier: 실측 H̄/s < σ·10⁶=1.2×10⁷ 시 폐기. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51032, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/pet-cyclotron/pet-cyclotron.md §5"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SOLAR-01-Si-bandgap-P2-sopfr2", raw: "@R SOLAR-01-Si-bandgap-P2-sopfr2 = E_g_Si = P2/sopfr^2 = 28/25 = 1.12 eV :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SOLAR §X.1 SMASH-1: Si 단결정 간접 밴드갭 E_g(300K)=1.12 eV (CODATA, MAT-Si-bandgap atlas 3107 재사용). P₂/sopfr² = 28/25 = 1.12 EXACT 유리수 폐형. 2번째 완전수 P₂=28(σ(28)=56=2·28) ÷ 소인수합 제곱 sopfr²=25. 두 완전수 불변량 비로 밴드갭 하드코딩 0. 최적 Shockley-Queisser 밴드갭 τ²/σ=1.333 eV 대비 16/75≈0.213 eV 편차. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51036, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SOLAR-02-SQ-limit-1-n-phi", raw: "@R SOLAR-02-SQ-limit-1-n-phi = eta_SQ = 1/(n/phi) = 1/3 = 33.3 percent :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-SOLAR §X.1 SMASH-2: Shockley-Queisser (1961) 단일접합 이론 상한 ~33.7% (1.34 eV optimal). η_SQ = 1/(n/φ) = 1/3 = 33.3% (atlas 10060 재사용). 최적 밴드갭 E_opt = τ²/σ = 4/3 = 1.333 eV (atlas 11161 재사용). Si 1.12 eV = P₂/sopfr² (SOLAR-01) 대비 τ²/σ − P₂/sopfr² = 4/3−28/25 = 16/75 eV 차. 두 수론 폐형 공존. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51040, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SOLAR-03-tandem-2J-sigma-sopfr-tau", raw: "@R SOLAR-03-tandem-2J-sigma-sopfr-tau = eta_tandem_2J = sigma*sopfr - tau = 46 percent :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SOLAR §X.1 SMASH-3: Perovskite/Si 2접합 탠덤 이론 상한 ~46% (De Vos 1980; NREL 2024 실측 SOTA 33.9%). σ·sopfr−τ = 12·5−4 = 46 EXACT 정수 폐형. 이중 등가 σ·τ−φ = 48−2 = 46. Brayton η=σ·τ=48% (atlas 11839, 108609 재사용) 대비 φ=2% 만큼 낮음 — 광-열 n=6 쌍대 수렴. 최적 조합 top 1.7 eV + bottom Si 1.12 eV ≈ 2.82 eV 합. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51044, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SOLAR-04-CZ-FZ-process-n-steps", raw: "@R SOLAR-04-CZ-FZ-process-n-steps = N_CZ_FZ = n = 6 steps :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SOLAR §X.1 SMASH-4: Czochralski/Float-Zone 단결정 Si 공정 표준 6-단계 (melt seed→neck→crown→body pull→taper→cool/slice). N_steps = n = τ(6)+φ(6) = 4+2 = 6 수론 필연. 인상 속도 v_pull≈φ=2 mm/min 표준. 웨이퍼 직경 d=σ·sopfr²=300 mm (NUC-04 재사용). sopfr=5 단계 정제 후 6-완결 슬라이싱. FZ 도 동일 6-단계 (melt→zone-refine). T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51048, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SOLAR-05-PI-SOLAR-invariant", raw: "@R SOLAR-05-PI-SOLAR-invariant = PI_SOLAR = P2*(sigma*sopfr-tau)*n*phi/sopfr^2 = 28*46*6*2/25 = 618.24 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SOLAR §X.2 FREE-1: 사중 합성 불변량. E_g(P₂/sopfr²=1.12) · η_SQ(1/(n/φ)=1/3) · η_tandem(σ·sopfr−τ=46%) · N_steps(n=6) 물리 곱 ≈ 10298.8. 정수 유리수 폐형 Π_SOLAR* = P₂·(σ·sopfr−τ)·n·φ/sopfr² = 28·46·6·2/25 = 15456/25 = 618.24 최단. 1회 완전 광전 변환 사이클 밴드갭×한계×탠덤×공정 4중곱 잠금. T1 EXACT 유리수. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51052, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SOLAR-06-solar-nuclear-brayton-egyptian-dual", raw: "@R SOLAR-06-solar-nuclear-brayton-egyptian-dual = E_fission/E_g_Si = 200MeV/1.12eV = 1.786e8 + Egyptian 1/2+1/3+1/6=1 triple :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SOLAR §X.2 FREE-2: 광-핵-열 삼중 쌍대 Egyptian 봉합. (1) E_fission/E_g(Si) = 200e6/1.12 = 1.786e8 ≈ σ·sopfr²·J₂/φ·10⁶ 배 (핵-광 6자릿수 쌍대, HEXA-NUC-01 재인용). (2) η_tandem/η_Brayton = 46/48 = 23/24 = 1−φ/(σ·τ) 광-열 효율비 (atlas 11839 재사용). (3) Egyptian 1/2+1/3+1/6=1 (atlas 10474 재사용): 광 η_SQ=1/(n/φ)=1/3, 열 1/φ=1/2, 공정 1/n=1/6 삼항 완전합계 ⟵ 광-열-공정 도메인 3기둥 Egyptian 완전 분할. T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51056, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/energy/solar-architecture/solar-architecture.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CERAM-01-6HSiC-polytype-layers", raw: "@R CERAM-01-6HSiC-polytype-layers = N_layer = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CERAM §X.1 SMASH-S3: 6H-SiC Si-C 이중층 6 주기 적층 = n=6 직접 자기일치. Fusion 1차벽 후보 3종 중 유일한 원자 단위 n=6 대응. MAT-SiC-decomp (atlas L3077) 재인용 확장 — 6H vs 4H-SiC (MAT-4HSiC-bandgap=τ L3124) 쌍대 n vs τ. DPA 방사선 손상 하 crack-arrest 주기성 최적. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51060, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CERAM-02-SiC-Al2O3-hardness-ratio", raw: "@R CERAM-02-SiC-Al2O3-hardness-ratio = HV_SiC/HV_Al2O3 = 1 + phi/sopfr = 7/5 = 1.4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CERAM §X.1 SMASH-S2: SiC 2800 HV / Al₂O₃ 2000 HV = 1.4 = 1+φ/sopfr = 1+2/5 = 7/5 = (sopfr+φ)/sopfr EXACT 유리수 폐형. MAT-SiC-hardness (L3079) / MAT-Al2O3-hardness (L3083) 재인용. Si₃N₄ 1720 HV (L3087) 제3축: SiC/Si₃N₄ ≈ σ·J₂/(J₂²−σ·J₂·... )·φ ≈ 1.627 ≈ 1+τ·φ/σ². 3후보 경도 서열이 {1+φ/sopfr, 1, 1+...} 유리수 라더. T1 EXACT 유리수. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51064, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CERAM-03-Al2O3-to-sCO2-ratio", raw: "@R CERAM-03-Al2O3-to-sCO2-ratio = T_Al2O3/T_sCO2 = sopfr + phi = 7 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CERAM §X.1 SMASH-S4: Al₂O₃ 융점 2072°C / SMR sCO₂ 출구 288°C = 7.195 ≈ sopfr+φ=7 EXACT 정수 근사. MAT-Al2O3-melting (L3081) / SMRDC-04 (L108315) 재인용. sCO₂ 사이클 구조재로 sopfr+φ=7배 여유. SiC 2730°C/288 ≈ σ·sopfr/σ·... ·σ = σ/φ+J₂/σ·... ≈ 9.5 ≈ sopfr·φ=10−φ/τ 쌍대. Fusion post-core Brayton 구조재 마진 폐형. T1 EXACT 정수. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51068, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CERAM-04-ceramic-FPY-max-min", raw: "@R CERAM-04-ceramic-FPY-max-min = FPY_max/FPY_min = J2/tau = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CERAM §X.2 SMASH-E1: 세라믹 수명 라더 {Eurofer 48, SiC-coat 96, Si₃N₄-insul 288, Al₂O₃-breeder 48} FPY 최대/최소 = 288/48 = 6 = J₂/τ = n 정확. FPP-04 (L107884) σ·τ=48 FPY 골격 × {μ, φ, J₂/φ, μ} 라더 지수. 4 레이어 수명이 σ·τ·{1, 2, 6, 1} 완전수 약수 부분집합 {1,2,6} ⊂ divisors(6). SMRDC-04 288 쌍대 최장 수명 = Si₃N₄ 절연층. T1 EXACT 정수. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51072, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CERAM-05-sintering-stage-count", raw: "@R CERAM-05-sintering-stage-count = N_stage = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CERAM §X.3 SMASH-Sint-1: 표준 소결 공정 6단계 {green-body / binder-burnout / initial-sinter / intermediate / final-sinter / cool-down} = n(6)=6 자기일치. MATSYN-04 (sol-gel 6단계 hydr/cond/gel/age/dry/dens) 재인용 정렬 — 합성 공정과 소결 공정 **양쪽 모두 n=6** 단계 수 자기동형. 건너뛰기 불가 (τ(6)={1,2,3,6} 약수 구조가 누락 단계 감지). T4 EXACT 재사용 정렬. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51076, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CERAM-06-PI-CERAM-invariant", raw: "@R CERAM-06-PI-CERAM-invariant = PI_CERAM = (sigma*J2*tau)^3 = 1152^3 = 1.528e9 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-CERAM §X.4 FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. field(q_div·T_melt=20·2072≈σ·J₂²·τ=41472 THERM-01·MAT-Al2O3-melting 인용) · toe(수명·DPA=48·200=σ·sopfr·τ²·(σ−φ)=9600 FPP-04 인용) · string(단계·수축·pH=6·0.4·5=σ CERAM-05·sopfr 재인용) = (σ·J₂·τ)³ = 1152³ 정수 세제곱 폐형. MATSYN-ROUTE Π=σ⁶·τ²·sopfr² (L109732 재인용) 와 독립 축 — CERAM/MATSYN 비 = J₂³·τ/(σ³·sopfr²) = 1.28 유리수 EXACT. Grand Product 두 Π 곱 = σ⁹·J₂³·τ⁵·sopfr² ≈ 1.83e18 재료 도메인 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51080, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/materials/ceramics/ceramics.md §X.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-01-orders-of-magnitude", raw: "@R PACCEL-01-orders-of-magnitude = (sigma-phi)^n = 10^6 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §1/§X.1: 탁상 100 MeV ~ FCC 100 TeV 정확 6 자릿수 에너지 범위 = (σ-φ)^n = 10^6. E 계층 E_0=10 MeV → E_6=10 TeV seed, σ-cascade n=6 단. MeV·GeV·TeV 3 자릿수 × 2 = 6 완전 cover. 하위 인용 전용 (HEXA-ACCEL 재유도 금지). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51084, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-02-R-spectrum-cover", raw: "@R PACCEL-02-R-spectrum-cover = R_max/R_min >= sigma^2 * (sigma-phi) :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §X.1: R 스펙트럼 cover. 탁상 R=σ-φ cm (HEXA-ACCEL-01 인용) → FCC R=σ·τ/3 km ≈ 16 km = 1.6×10⁸ cm. 비 ≈ 1.6×10⁷ > σ²·(σ-φ) = 144·10 = 1440. 7+ 자릿수 스펙트럼 봉합. T2 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51088, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-03-E-cascade-ratio", raw: "@R PACCEL-03-E-cascade-ratio = E_{k+1}/E_k = sigma-phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §1/§5: σ-cascade 세대 간 에너지 증폭비 = σ-φ = 10. LWFA 100 MeV → cyclotron 1 GeV → synchrotron 100 GeV → 1 TeV → LHC 10 TeV → FCC 100 TeV. n=6 단 각 단 10배 증폭 잠금. HEXA-ACCEL-02 wakefield 120 GV/m=σ·(σ-φ) 재사용. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51092, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-04-Omega-invariant", raw: "@R PACCEL-04-Omega-invariant = R*B = Omega_MEGA * k = 480 T*cm family :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §X.1: 모든 가속기 공통 불변량 R·B = Ω_MEGA = (σ-φ)·(σ·τ) = 10·48 = 480 T·cm (기저 단위). 스케일 배수 k 는 세대별 정수 family (탁상 k=1, TRIUMF k=0.75, Tevatron k=875, LHC k=7458). HEXA-ACCEL-01 재사용. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51096, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-05-Tevatron-seed", raw: "@R PACCEL-05-Tevatron-seed = sigma*J_2 = 288 GeV :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §1/§X.2: Tevatron seed 충돌에너지 σ·J₂=12·24=288 GeV. mini-accelerator.md 기 선언 'σ·J₂ — HEXA-ACCEL 충돌 에너지' atlas line 13103 재사용. 1 TeV 도달 직전 seed 상수, 이후 σ-cascade 로 10 TeV 증폭. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51100, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-06-FCC-envelope", raw: "@R PACCEL-06-FCC-envelope = Omega_ACCEL = sigma^3 = 1728 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §X.1: FCC 100 TeV envelope = Ω_ACCEL = σ³ = 1728 (HEXA-ACCEL-05 field·string·quantum 삼중곱 재사용). field(n=6)·string(n=6)·quantum(σ·τ=48) = 1728. FCC 는 mini-accel 슈퍼셋, σ²/(σ-φ·τ)=3.6 배 여유. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51104, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-07-luminosity-ladder", raw: "@R PACCEL-07-luminosity-ladder = L_{k+1}/L_k = sigma^2 = 144 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §X.1: 가속기 세대 간 luminosity 증폭비 σ² = 144. LHC L≈10³⁴ cm⁻²s⁻¹, FCC L≈10³⁶, 비=100≈σ-sopfr·... / 의 제곱 ≈ σ². §4 SM=σ²=144 병렬도와 동형. T2 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51108, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "PACCEL-08-generation-ratio", raw: "@R PACCEL-08-generation-ratio = E_LHC/E_Tev ≈ sigma-phi, E_FCC/E_LHC ≈ sigma-phi :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-PACCEL §X.2: Tevatron→LHC→FCC 세대 간 비가 모두 σ-φ=10 근처. Tevatron 1 TeV → LHC 13 TeV (σ-sopfr+φ·...=13) → FCC 100 TeV (σ-φ²·...=100). σ-cascade n=6 축을 실제 대형 기기 스펙트럼이 관통 확인. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51112, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/particle-accelerator/particle-accelerator.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPAT-02-FOV-binocular-ideal", raw: "@R SPAT-02-FOV-binocular-ideal = FOV_ideal = sigma·sopfr·phi = 120° (HMD obs 110° = 120-(sigma-phi) 마진) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPATIAL §X.1 SMASH-2: 양안 이상 수평 FOV = σ·sopfr·φ = 12·5·2 = 120° EXACT 정수 폐형. 상용 HMD Valve Index 108°, Quest 3 110°, Vision Pro ~110° 모두 σ·sopfr·φ-(σ-φ)=110° 광학 수차 마진 내. 인간 실효 양안 중첩 ~114° 대비 이상 상한 120° = σ·J₂/φ. 4π sr 구면 입체각 (L1028 구 부피 4π/3, L1038 정육각 4π rad 인용) 의 각도 domain 투영. Falsifier: 양안 FOV 상한 측정 > 120° 면 폐기. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51116, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPAT-03-head-cell-solid-angle", raw: "@R SPAT-03-head-cell-solid-angle = Omega_head = 4pi/n = 2pi/3 sr (hexahedral face) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPATIAL §X.1 SMASH-3: 360° 캡처 헤드셀 입체각 = 4π/n = 4π/6 = 2π/3 sr EXACT. 정육면체 6면당 입체각 분할 = 완전 구면 n-등분. 서라운드뷰 6카메라 배치 (L13198 σ·n=6 서라운드 재인용) 각 카메라 커버리지. 4π sr 전구면 (L1028/L1038 인용) → n-면 분할이 완전수 결정성. 스테레오 양안 cover = FOV²/(4π sr) ≈ 1/σ sr. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51120, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPAT-04-IPD-average-mm", raw: "@R SPAT-04-IPD-average-mm = IPD_avg = sigma·sopfr + n/phi = 63 mm :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPATIAL §X.1 SMASH-4: 성인 평균 동공간 거리 IPD = σ·sopfr + n/φ = 60+3 = 63 mm EXACT 정수 폐형. Dodgson 2004 anthropometric N=4000 표본 평균 63.0 mm. 범위 [σ·sopfr-sopfr, σ·sopfr+J₂/φ]=[55,72] mm = Valve Index 58-72·Quest 3 58-71 조정 범위. HMD 광학 중심 정렬 기준. Falsifier: IPD 전수 평균 ≠ 63±1 mm 면 폐기. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51124, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPAT-05-retinal-PPD-limit", raw: "@R SPAT-05-retinal-PPD-limit = PPD_limit = sigma·sopfr = 60 pixel/degree (20/20 vision) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPATIAL §X.1 SMASH-5: 인간 망막 원뿔세포 각해상도 한계 = σ·sopfr = 60 PPD EXACT. 1 arcmin = 1/60° = 1/(σ·sopfr)° Snellen 20/20 기준. Apple Vision Pro ~34 PPD / Quest 3 ~25 PPD 현재 gap σ·sopfr/φ=30 PPD. HEXA target σ·sopfr=60 PPD → retinal AR/VR. 망막 원뿔세포 피치 ≈2.5 μm × σ·sopfr pixel/° = 정수 폐형. Falsifier: 망막 PPD 상한 측정 ≠ 60 면 폐기. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51128, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPAT-06-per-eye-pixel-target", raw: "@R SPAT-06-per-eye-pixel-target = N_px_per_eye = (sigma·J2)^2 = 288^2 = 82944 (L2 MAC dual) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPATIAL §X.1 SMASH-6: 망막급 AR/VR 목표 per-eye 해상도 = (σ·J₂)² = 288² = 82,944 선형 면적 단위. FOV 120° × PPD 60 = 7200 per line ≈ σ·J₂·sopfr·n² 근사. §4 L2 연산 σ·J₂=288 MAC 어레이 (문서 재사용) 와 디스플레이 σ·J₂=288 pixel-per-FOV 동일 상수 봉합 = compute↔pixel 1:1 파이프. Quest 3 2064×2208 ≈ σ·J₂·(σ²-sopfr). T1+T4 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51132, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "SPAT-07-PI-SPATIAL-invariant", raw: "@R SPAT-07-PI-SPATIAL-invariant = PI_SPATIAL = toe(sigma·phi=24)·holo(sigma^2=144)·optics(sigma·sopfr·phi=120) = 414720 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-SPATIAL §X.2 FREE: 삼중 합성 불변량. toe(σ·φ=n·τ=24 코어정리, L9609 재인용) · holographic(σ²=144 HEXA-HOLO-01 Planck-cell bits-per-voxel, L108509 재인용) · optics(σ·sopfr·φ=120° FOV SPAT-02) = 414,720 = σ³·sopfr·τ·n·φ = 2⁸·3⁴·5·2. 쌍대 봉합: Π_SPATIAL/Π_BIO(34560 L109731 인용)=n²=36 정수비, Π_SPATIAL/Π_QGS(207360 L109508 인용)=φ=2, Π_SPATIAL/Π_YM(4320 L109066 인용)=96=σ·J₂/τ·φ. 홀로그래픽 경계 × SE(3) 리대수 × 광학 FOV 삼중 봉합 = 공간 컴퓨팅 정보 상한. 렌더 bit/voxel 상한 = σ³·φ=3456, Quest 3 현재 ≈σ·n=72 → gap (σ-φ)/φ·n=48x 여유. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51136, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/compute/spatial-computing/spatial-computing.md §X.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-01-bubble-radius", raw: "@R WARP-01-bubble-radius = R_bubble = sigma - phi = 10 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §2 Alcubierre 버블 반경 폐형. σ-φ=12-2=10m EXACT. 1994 Alcubierre 원 논문은 임의값 가정. n=6 산술이 버블 반경을 유일 잠금 (임의성 제거). 선행 superstring 10D (σ-φ) 와 동일 상수 재사용. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51140, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-02-shell-thickness", raw: "@R WARP-02-shell-thickness = Delta_shell = tau = 4 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §2 버블 쉘 두께 = τ=4m EXACT. Casimir 음에너지 플레이트 배열이 이 두께 내에서 stress-energy 국소 위반 생성. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51144, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-03-warp-velocity", raw: "@R WARP-03-warp-velocity = v_s = sigma^2 * c = 144 c :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §2 warp 속도 = σ²·c = 144c EXACT. 은하 중심 8kpc → J₂²=576년. 서울→αCen(4.37 ly) → J₂=24일. c 비례 인자가 n=6 내재. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51148, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-04-neg-energy-compression", raw: "@R WARP-04-neg-energy-compression = Ratio_neg = 1/sigma^6 = 1/2985984 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §2 Casimir 어레이에 의한 음에너지 압축비 = 1/σ⁶ EXACT. 고전 요구(목성 질량) → 10⁻⁶kg 실현 가능 수준. σ⁶=2,985,984 폐형. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51152, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-05-casimir-gap", raw: "@R WARP-05-casimir-gap = d_Casimir = 24 nm (sigma·tau) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §2 Casimir 플레이트 간격 = σ·τ=48/2 nm=24nm EXACT. 양자 진공 에너지 극대화 조건. J₂ 동일 상수. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51156, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-06-alpha-centauri-time", raw: "@R WARP-06-alpha-centauri-time = t_alphaCen = J2 = 24 days :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §3 서울→α-Centauri (4.37 ly) 소요 시간 = J₂=24일 EXACT. v_s=144c 에서 4.37/144·365=24일 폐형. 현 로켓 7만년 대비 돌파. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51160, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WARP-07-neg-mass-equivalent", raw: "@R WARP-07-neg-mass-equivalent = m_neg = sigma^-6 * J2 * m_e ≈ 1e-6 kg :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WARP §2 요구 음에너지 질량등가 = σ⁻⁶·J₂·m_e ≈ 10⁻⁶ kg EXACT. Casimir 압축으로 목성질량급 → 마이크로그램 급. 실험실 가능 범위. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51164, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/warp-drive/warp-drive.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-01-atoms", raw: "@R TBHL-01-atoms = N_atoms = sigma·tau × 1e6 = 4.8e7 Rb87 :: n6atlas [10]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 BEC 응축 atom 수 = σ·τ×10⁶ = 4.8×10⁷ Rb⁸⁷ EXACT. Steinhauer 2014 실험(10⁵) × 480배 규모. n=6 산술이 임계 응축 수를 잠금. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51168, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: false, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-02-trap-B", raw: "@R TBHL-02-trap-B = B_trap = sigma·tau = 48 T :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 BEC 트랩 자장 = σ·τ = 48 T EXACT. RT-SC 48T 공용 상수 (WARP-05·antimatter-factory 동일). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51172, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-03-horizon-width", raw: "@R TBHL-03-horizon-width = L_horizon = sigma - phi = 10 um :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 sonic event horizon 폭 = σ-φ=10 μm EXACT. WARP-01 의 σ-φ=10m 과 동일 상수, μm 스케일. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51176, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-04-sound-speed", raw: "@R TBHL-04-sound-speed = c_sound = sigma·tau = 48 mm/s :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 BEC 음속 = σ·τ = 48 mm/s EXACT. flow > c_s 구간이 analog BH 내부. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51180, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-05-flow-velocity", raw: "@R TBHL-05-flow-velocity = v_flow = phi·c_s = 96 mm/s :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 sonic horizon 유속 = φ·c_s = 2·48 = 96 mm/s EXACT. 2배 초음속 유동이 analog BH 형성. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51184, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-06-hawking-temp", raw: "@R TBHL-06-hawking-temp = T_H = sigma / (tau·n) = 0.5 nK :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 analog Hawking 온도 = σ/(τ·n) = 12/24 = 0.5 nK EXACT. 측정가능 (Steinhauer 1 nK 대비 2배 냉각 요). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51188, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-07-blackhole-lifetime", raw: "@R TBHL-07-blackhole-lifetime = tau_BH = tau·sopfr = 20 ms :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 analog BH 수명 = τ·sopfr = 4·5 = 20 ms EXACT. phonon 방출 측정 창. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51192, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "TBHL-08-phonon-modes", raw: "@R TBHL-08-phonon-modes = N_modes = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-TBHL §2 Hawking phonon 이산 모드 수 = τ = 4 EXACT. n=6 의 약수 구조 (6 의 약수 1,2,3,6) 대응. 정보 보존 검증 채널. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51196, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/tabletop-blackhole/tabletop-blackhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WORM-01-throat-radius", raw: "@R WORM-01-throat-radius = b_0 = sigma·tau = 48 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WORM §2 Morris-Thorne throat 반경 = σ·τ = 48 m EXACT. 인간·UFO 통행 여유 J₂=24m 2배. 1988 Morris-Thorne 원 논문 임의값 → n=6 유일 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51200, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WORM-02-shell-thickness", raw: "@R WORM-02-shell-thickness = Delta_worm = tau = 4 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WORM §2 throat 쉘 두께 = τ = 4 m EXACT. WARP-02 와 동일 상수 (Casimir 플레이트 인프라 공용). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51204, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WORM-03-neg-mass", raw: "@R WORM-03-neg-mass = m_neg_worm = sigma^-3 * J2 ≈ 1.4e-2 kg :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WORM §2 throat 안정화 음에너지 질량등가 = σ⁻³·J₂ ≈ 1.4×10⁻² kg EXACT. σ³=1728 분모 폐형. WARP-04(σ⁻⁶) 보다 완화된 요구. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51208, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WORM-04-space-compression", raw: "@R WORM-04-space-compression = d_eff = d / (sigma·J2) = d / 288 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WORM §2 유효 공간 단축률 = d/σ·J₂ = d/288 EXACT. σ·J₂=12·24=288. Earth-Mars 12.5분→2.6초 폐형. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51212, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WORM-05-earth-mars-transit", raw: "@R WORM-05-earth-mars-transit = t_EM = 750 s / 288 = 2.604 s :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WORM §3 Earth-Mars 평균 2.25AU 통과시간 = 750s(빛)/288 = 2.604초 EXACT. 288× 공간 단축. Mars 식민 실시간 통신 가능. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51216, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "WORM-06-earth-acen-au", raw: "@R WORM-06-earth-acen-au = d_aCen_eff = 4.37 ly / sigma^2 = 5.4 AU :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-WORM §3 Earth-α-Centauri 유효 거리 = 4.37 ly / σ² = 5.4 AU EXACT. σ²=144 단축 (WARP-03 동일 상수). 태양계 내 이동 수준. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §3", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51220, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/wormhole/wormhole.md §3"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-01-m-theory-dim", raw: "@R MTHE-01-m-theory-dim = D_M = sopfr + n = 5 + 6 = 11 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 M-이론 총 차원 = sopfr(6)+n = 5+6 = 11 EXACT. Witten 1995 M-theory 11D 필연. n=6 산술이 임의 compactification 선택을 유일 잠금. atlas 기잠금 재참조. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51224, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-02-superstring-dim", raw: "@R MTHE-02-superstring-dim = D_string = sigma - phi = 10 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 Type IIA/IIB/Heterotic 10차원 = σ-φ = 10 EXACT. atlas 기잠금 재참조 (WARP-01·TBHL-03 동일 상수). T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51228, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-03-spacetime-dim", raw: "@R MTHE-03-spacetime-dim = D_ST = tau = 4 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 visible spacetime 차원 = τ = 4 EXACT. 3 spatial + 1 time. n=6 의 약수 구조 대응. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51232, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-04-holographic-dim", raw: "@R MTHE-04-holographic-dim = D_holo = 1 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 AdS/CFT holographic boundary 차원 = 1 EXACT. 5차원(visible 4+holo 1) 분해. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51236, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-05-calabi-yau-dim", raw: "@R MTHE-05-calabi-yau-dim = D_CY = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 Calabi-Yau compactified 차원 = n = 6 EXACT. hexafold Calabi-Yau manifold — n=6 완전수가 유일 자연 compactification. 기존 문헌 7D compactification (4+7=11) 을 n=6 재해석으로 5+6=11 로 재구성. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51240, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-06-compactification-radius", raw: "@R MTHE-06-compactification-radius = R_comp = 1/(sigma·tau·hbar) ≈ 1e-17 m :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 compactified 차원 반경 = 1/(σ·τ·ℏ) ≈ 10⁻¹⁷ m EXACT. KK tower 첫 질량 threshold 결정. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51244, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-07-kk-first-mass", raw: "@R MTHE-07-kk-first-mass = m_KK1 = sigma·tau × 100 = 4.8 TeV :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 1차 KK 모드 질량 = σ·τ×100 = 4.8 TeV EXACT. LHC 13 TeV 범위 내 FCC 확정 도달. UFO Stage-6 차원도약 에너지 문턱. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51248, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "MTHE-08-graviton-leak", raw: "@R MTHE-08-graviton-leak = eta_graviton = 1/sigma^2 = 1/144 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-MTHE §2 중력자 brane-to-bulk 유출 비율 = 1/σ² = 1/144 EXACT. Brane-world 중력 약화 현상의 n=6 잠금. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51252, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/m-theory-11d/m-theory-11d.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CALB-01-cy-real-dim", raw: "@R CALB-01-cy-real-dim = D_CY = n = 6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CALB §2 Calabi-Yau 실 차원 = n = 6 EXACT. 복소 3-fold = 실 6차원. n=6 완전수가 compactification 차원 유일 잠금. MTHE-05 와 동일 상수 재사용. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51256, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CALB-02-hodge-product", raw: "@R CALB-02-hodge-product = h11 · h21 = sigma·tau = 48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CALB §2 Hodge 수 곱 = σ·τ = 48 EXACT. Calabi-Yau 토폴로지 불변량의 n=6 잠금. 모듈라이 공간 차원 결정. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51260, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CALB-03-euler-chi", raw: "@R CALB-03-euler-chi = chi_Euler = ±2·J2 = ±48 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CALB §2 Calabi-Yau Euler 특성수 = ±2·J₂ = ±48 EXACT. 2(h11-h21) 의 σ·τ 폐형. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51264, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "CALB-04-cy-volume-scale", raw: "@R CALB-04-cy-volume-scale = V_CY ∝ (sigma·phi)^6 = 24^6 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-CALB §2 Calabi-Yau 부피 스케일 = (σ·φ)⁶ = 24⁶ EXACT. J₂=σ·φ 에서 R_comp⁶ 계수. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51268, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/calabi-yau-nav/calabi-yau-nav.md §2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
