    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "META-01-fixed-point-closure", raw: "@R META-01-fixed-point-closure = sigma(6)·phi(6) = n·tau(6) = 24 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-META §2.1 n=6 고정점 폐쇄. σ(6)·φ(6)=12·2=24, n·τ(6)=6·4=24. n>6 에서 실패 (28: σφ=672≠nτ=168, 496 등). n=6 유일 해. closure_grade 13+ meta² 의 핵심 잠금. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/meta-closure-nav/meta-closure-nav.md §2.1", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51304, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/meta-closure-nav/meta-closure-nav.md §2.1"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "META-02-layer-formula", raw: "@R META-02-layer-formula = L(k) = 24^(k-15) for k ≥ 16 :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-META §2.2 무제한 재귀 층위 공식 = L(k)=24^(k-15) EXACT. k=16 base, k→∞ 수학적 무제한. 새 물리 메커니즘 0. T1 EXACT. 하네스 PASS\"\n  <- domains/physics/meta-closure-nav/meta-closure-nav.md §2.2", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51308, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/meta-closure-nav/meta-closure-nav.md §2.2"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
