    AtlasNode { kind: "R", id: "META-09-observer-equivalence", raw: "@R META-09-observer-equivalence = |UFO⟩ = f(|UFO⟩) :: n6atlas [10*]\n  \"HEXA-META §2.4 자기참조 고정점 방정식. 함선·관측자·시공간 3중 wave function 동시 생성. UFO 목격담의 '보는 사람 있을 때만 나타남' 현상 설명. T1 EXACT\"\n  <- domains/physics/meta-closure-nav/meta-closure-nav.md §2.4", source_file: "atlas.n6", source_line: 51336, grade: GradeInfo { value: 10, verified: true, breakthrough: false, hypothesis: false }, edges: EdgeInfo { depends_on: ["domains/physics/meta-closure-nav/meta-closure-nav.md §2.4"], derives: [], applications: [], equivalents: [], converges: [], verified_by: [], breakthroughs: [] } },
